(2880093, 396674, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Processing is overdone.  Dodged out all details from the top of the fingers.  Burned the bottom of the chin almost into the background.  Neck is also burned a bit much making this look like a floating head.  Slightly different angle would also have prevented the eyelashes of his right eye from appearing as a tuft of hair on the nose.  Bit of haloing visible along the ridge of the nose and the outline of the hand.  Overall, nice shot.  No doubt it will score extremely well.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Processing is overdone.  Dodged out all details from the top of the fingers.  Burned the bottom of the chin almost into the background.  Neck is also burned a bit much making this look like a floating head.  Slightly different angle would also have prevented the eyelashes of his right eye from appearing as a tuft of hair on the nose.  Bit of haloing visible along the ridge of the nose and the outline of the hand.  Overall, nice shot.  No doubt it will score extremely well.', '2006-10-01 03:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
