(2880136, 393678, 52130, '<td valign="top">ow, you made her look into the light. She''s in pain and you can see it on her face. I know you wanted good lighting, but try having her look in a different direction next time. People with light-colored eyes have trouble on bright days because their eyes reflect more light than absorb (unlike brown eyes). Just a tip.</td>', 'ow, you made her look into the light. She''s in pain and you can see it on her face. I know you wanted good lighting, but try having her look in a different direction next time. People with light-colored eyes have trouble on bright days because their eyes reflect more light than absorb (unlike brown eyes). Just a tip.', '2006-10-01 04:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
