(2880259, 403022, 48228, '<td valign="top">Stunning image here, as I love the richness of autumn colors, and it just works so perfectly for me.....<br/>I love this one, and it makes me feel like I am on top of the mountain.....<br/>I do hope you do well with this one..... <br/>If you looks close enough, the top of the mountain on the keft looks like a map of australia at a slight angle....<br/>"Wow", I love that, and I am going to give you an extra point....as I am a true "Aussie" through and through. A "10" from me.....</td>', 'Stunning image here, as I love the richness of autumn colors, and it just works so perfectly for me.....I love this one, and it makes me feel like I am on top of the mountain.....I do hope you do well with this one..... If you looks close enough, the top of the mountain on the keft looks like a map of australia at a slight angle...."Wow", I love that, and I am going to give you an extra point....as I am a true "Aussie" through and through. A "10" from me.....', '2006-10-01 04:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
