(2880768, 401485, 20941, '<td valign="top">you captured a special moment with good composition and focus. The grain works for me in this classic looking shot and the glow on her face is just right. There are a few distractions like the red line leading to the childs chin (ribbon?) and something on the shirt, but i love this beautiful image, its the kind of shot that will be treasured always. good job!</td>', 'you captured a special moment with good composition and focus. The grain works for me in this classic looking shot and the glow on her face is just right. There are a few distractions like the red line leading to the childs chin (ribbon?) and something on the shirt, but i love this beautiful image, its the kind of shot that will be treasured always. good job!', '2006-10-01 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
