(2880886, 395827, 40819, '<td valign="top">Lovely great use of light from above and below, must have been some well placed soft boxes. Great work.</td>', 'Lovely great use of light from above and below, must have been some well placed soft boxes. Great work.', '2006-10-01 09:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880887, 393678, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a lovely smile, and also a really happy portrait.</td>', 'What a lovely smile, and also a really happy portrait.', '2006-10-01 09:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880888, 393716, 7786, '<td valign="top">I like the ocean and the pear. But the color of the sky and clouds looks unatural to me.</td>', 'I like the ocean and the pear. But the color of the sky and clouds looks unatural to me.', '2006-10-01 09:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880890, 397312, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent.....</td>', 'Excellent.....', '2006-10-01 09:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880892, 393859, 40819, '<td valign="top">Wow......just wow.......should be the blue if you asked me.........more wow.</td>', 'Wow......just wow.......should be the blue if you asked me.........more wow.', '2006-10-01 09:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880894, 403854, 34192, '<td valign="top">I would bet that this isn''t currently scoring very well.  Its not within typical DPC tastes.  For me at least, the image is intriguing but seems to be ''unfinished.''  A guess here - you were working with high ISO as you were in deep shade.  I''m guessing you were using a Canon but that is irrelevent.  I think this image needs the bottom blur cropped out - as a viewer, it makes me take a stutter step when entering the image.  this will also pull the main subject a little more off center and really force me to look at the detris of the forest floor whose colors and patterns I find fascinating.  The focus is good, but slightly deeper would have been better.  This would build a connection between the mushroom and the detris that is stronger than what is here.  An interesting subject for the challenge that I could explore for a while.  Unfortunately you won''t find many voters willing to spend the time.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I would bet that this isn''t currently scoring very well.  Its not within typical DPC tastes.  For me at least, the image is intriguing but seems to be ''unfinished.''  A guess here - you were working with high ISO as you were in deep shade.  I''m guessing you were using a Canon but that is irrelevent.  I think this image needs the bottom blur cropped out - as a viewer, it makes me take a stutter step when entering the image.  this will also pull the main subject a little more off center and really force me to look at the detris of the forest floor whose colors and patterns I find fascinating.  The focus is good, but slightly deeper would have been better.  This would build a connection between the mushroom and the detris that is stronger than what is here.  An interesting subject for the challenge that I could explore for a while.  Unfortunately you won''t find many voters willing to spend the time.  Good Luck!', '2006-10-01 09:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2880895, 401761, 48228, '<td valign="top">I feel like we have seen this image before, but in ifferant colortones.....<br/>Very nice but I liked the bluetones much better if it is the same place.....</td>', 'I feel like we have seen this image before, but in ifferant colortones.....Very nice but I liked the bluetones much better if it is the same place.....', '2006-10-01 09:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
