(2880898, 395773, 60614, '<td valign="top">Very refreshing shot.  Love the star sparkle and the blue in water.  The composition is perfect.  Great usage of the thirds and crisp focus.</td>', 'Very refreshing shot.  Love the star sparkle and the blue in water.  The composition is perfect.  Great usage of the thirds and crisp focus.', '2006-10-01 09:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
