(2880944, 401485, 34192, '<td valign="top">There are many technical issues with this image - pixelation, sharpening artifacts, weirdly blurred spots.  However, looking past all those editing issues, there is an extremely well composed, well lit image.  I love the image itself and would really like to see a re-edited version.</td>', 'There are many technical issues with this image - pixelation, sharpening artifacts, weirdly blurred spots.  However, looking past all those editing issues, there is an extremely well composed, well lit image.  I love the image itself and would really like to see a re-edited version.', '2006-10-01 09:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
