(2881214, 401936, 55838, '<td valign="top">Your model is lovely and her position and expression is nice.  I think she needs a bit more golden soft lighting on her face (closer to what she has on her forearm &amp; bicep).  IMO the floor takes a lot away from this shot.  Maybe a plush red, black, or dark green back would work better.</td>', 'Your model is lovely and her position and expression is nice.  I think she needs a bit more golden soft lighting on her face (closer to what she has on her forearm & bicep).  IMO the floor takes a lot away from this shot.  Maybe a plush red, black, or dark green back would work better.', '2006-10-01 10:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881215, 394586, 48954, '<td valign="top">hmm, could use more focus..or is it image quality that is lacking? I like the blue water steams on the right though.</td>', 'hmm, could use more focus..or is it image quality that is lacking? I like the blue water steams on the right though.', '2006-10-01 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881218, 397706, 62095, '<td valign="top">This is a great effect with all the spray and a good shot with the tower in the background.  I defintiely would have lightened the shadows to bring the kids out of the darkness.</td>', 'This is a great effect with all the spray and a good shot with the tower in the background.  I defintiely would have lightened the shadows to bring the kids out of the darkness.', '2006-10-01 10:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
