(2881332, 402356, 51538, '<td valign="top">We rescued a joey once.  Australians in the 50s used to go out shooting them en masse from the back of trucks and then the only part they''d eat was the tail (as in ox tail stew / soup).  One of the shot mothers had a joey in her pouch and the joey was brought into my dad''s surgery (he was a doctor).  We hung up a sack on the back of the door to emulate the pouch but them outcome was not good.  Joeys need their monthers.</td>', 'We rescued a joey once.  Australians in the 50s used to go out shooting them en masse from the back of trucks and then the only part they''d eat was the tail (as in ox tail stew / soup).  One of the shot mothers had a joey in her pouch and the joey was brought into my dad''s surgery (he was a doctor).  We hung up a sack on the back of the door to emulate the pouch but them outcome was not good.  Joeys need their monthers.', '2006-10-01 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881333, 394586, 63495, '<td valign="top">wow wish i was there</td>', 'wow wish i was there', '2006-10-01 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
