(2881336, 402286, 24454, '<td valign="top">This photo is absolutley flawless.   It looks like a painting without losing the realism of excellent photography.   I''ve seen several photos of the Maroon Bells, and I really think this may be the best one I''ve seen.   For sure the best winter one.   Congratulations.  I''d love to see this one ribbon!  10</td>', 'This photo is absolutley flawless.   It looks like a painting without losing the realism of excellent photography.   I''ve seen several photos of the Maroon Bells, and I really think this may be the best one I''ve seen.   For sure the best winter one.   Congratulations.  I''d love to see this one ribbon!  10', '2006-10-01 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
