(2881421, 395827, 36065, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong, very striking image.  The lighting is near-flawless, and is the strength of the image.  Nice composition, but she looks a bit uncomfortable.  I have two small issues with the image.  First, I''d really like to see her right eye.  It missing makes the image a little tense.  Lastly, that lone right thumb underneath her breast is mildly distracting.  Still, a very nice image with a great model and terrific lighting.  Well-done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-09 06:16:01.</i></td>', 'This is a very strong, very striking image.  The lighting is near-flawless, and is the strength of the image.  Nice composition, but she looks a bit uncomfortable.  I have two small issues with the image.  First, I''d really like to see her right eye.  It missing makes the image a little tense.  Lastly, that lone right thumb underneath her breast is mildly distracting.  Still, a very nice image with a great model and terrific lighting.  Well-done.', '2006-10-01 11:20:14.000000', '2008-12-09 06:16:01.000000', 1),
