(2881727, 399278, 17837, '<td valign="top">What an interesting portrait. Is that a band? Friends? complete strangers to one another? Interesting lighting.</td>', 'What an interesting portrait. Is that a band? Friends? complete strangers to one another? Interesting lighting.', '2006-10-01 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881731, 402454, 17837, '<td valign="top">a good capture. The lighting is a bit harsh on the butterfly. I would also like to see more of him, and less of the plant blocking him.</td>', 'a good capture. The lighting is a bit harsh on the butterfly. I would also like to see more of him, and less of the plant blocking him.', '2006-10-01 12:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881735, 402807, 45754, '<td valign="top">that''s cool - Honey, I''m home!</td>', 'that''s cool - Honey, I''m home!', '2006-10-01 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881737, 401576, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the focus here, a nice strong yet simple composition...great title too.</td>', 'I really like the focus here, a nice strong yet simple composition...great title too.', '2006-10-01 12:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881740, 404021, 45754, '<td valign="top">A very pretty scene. Nice colors and depth</td>', 'A very pretty scene. Nice colors and depth', '2006-10-01 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881744, 392821, 35804, '<td valign="top">Yes...when I think of early light, it is exactly this....beautifully done.</td>', 'Yes...when I think of early light, it is exactly this....beautifully done.', '2006-10-01 12:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881746, 396806, 17837, '<td valign="top">ahhh open shade portraiture... it can be tricky! You did a fairly well job here. If I may offer a suggestion, instead of the portrait perspective, turn the camera to landscape, and reveal her legs as well. The way this is cropped, I feel like her legs end at the knees, which isnt very appealing. <br/> <br/>Perhaps a half stop underexposed, easily fixed in post processing. She looks uncomfortable here also, I dont know if its her pose, or she just feels awkward.</td>', 'ahhh open shade portraiture... it can be tricky! You did a fairly well job here. If I may offer a suggestion, instead of the portrait perspective, turn the camera to landscape, and reveal her legs as well. The way this is cropped, I feel like her legs end at the knees, which isnt very appealing.  Perhaps a half stop underexposed, easily fixed in post processing. She looks uncomfortable here also, I dont know if its her pose, or she just feels awkward.', '2006-10-01 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881749, 403909, 17837, '<td valign="top">I see these shots all the time, and there''s no other way to say it but you just missed on this shot. The sky is over exposed, while the middle ground and foreground are under exposed. a ND filter would certainly help your cause, as well as bracketing. A different time of day also would help a great deal. Good luck.</td>', 'I see these shots all the time, and there''s no other way to say it but you just missed on this shot. The sky is over exposed, while the middle ground and foreground are under exposed. a ND filter would certainly help your cause, as well as bracketing. A different time of day also would help a great deal. Good luck.', '2006-10-01 12:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881750, 401357, 32997, '<td valign="top">this blown out high contrast really works here...<br/>interesting impact, makes the bug seem almost alien...</td>', 'this blown out high contrast really works here...interesting impact, makes the bug seem almost alien...', '2006-10-01 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881753, 403603, 17837, '<td valign="top">haha! This photo is fun with great lighting and good color. This gets a 7 for humor cause the dog looks like he might wanna be taking a poo on the horse haha.</td>', 'haha! This photo is fun with great lighting and good color. This gets a 7 for humor cause the dog looks like he might wanna be taking a poo on the horse haha.', '2006-10-01 12:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881756, 401166, 17837, '<td valign="top">a fairly good sense of depth, I like the clouds and your vantage point. I''m curious to know where this was shot. Maybe a different time of day might make this photo better, as is, the shadows dont seem to be too deep, which tends to lead me to believe this photo was taken between 10-2. Sometimes this can''t be helped though.</td>', 'a fairly good sense of depth, I like the clouds and your vantage point. I''m curious to know where this was shot. Maybe a different time of day might make this photo better, as is, the shadows dont seem to be too deep, which tends to lead me to believe this photo was taken between 10-2. Sometimes this can''t be helped though.', '2006-10-01 12:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881757, 403451, 32997, '<td valign="top">great shot...<br/>compostion really works as my eyes are drawn in to the mannequin while the surrounding reds add to the surreal effect...</td>', 'great shot...compostion really works as my eyes are drawn in to the mannequin while the surrounding reds add to the surreal effect...', '2006-10-01 12:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881759, 402673, 35804, '<td valign="top">...with all this beautiful color...my eye still keeps going to the yellow border/line, perhaps a simple black border around the edge may have been more effective or none at all?</td>', '...with all this beautiful color...my eye still keeps going to the yellow border/line, perhaps a simple black border around the edge may have been more effective or none at all?', '2006-10-01 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881761, 402673, 17837, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest, that border is a huge distraction for me.</td>', 'I have to be honest, that border is a huge distraction for me.', '2006-10-01 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881765, 397423, 17837, '<td valign="top">a very good portrait. The sweater seems over exposed, maybe that was intentional, but I find my eyes going to that instead of the girls eyes, which IMO should be the subject here. Very crisp and great DOF.</td>', 'a very good portrait. The sweater seems over exposed, maybe that was intentional, but I find my eyes going to that instead of the girls eyes, which IMO should be the subject here. Very crisp and great DOF.', '2006-10-01 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881767, 395763, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot, I wish the sand had more contrast in it to bring out the lines more.</td>', 'I like the image a lot, I wish the sand had more contrast in it to bring out the lines more.', '2006-10-01 12:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881768, 404019, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro work! So many great textures and colors to peruse within this image...again, nicley done.</td>', 'Very nice macro work! So many great textures and colors to peruse within this image...again, nicley done.', '2006-10-01 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881769, 403705, 25166, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative. Great tones and composition.</td>', 'Very imaginative. Great tones and composition.', '2006-10-01 12:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881772, 398818, 17837, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying, it was just a swing and a miss. The clouds are burned out, and theres too much sky in the photo, which in turn competes for attention to your subject.</td>', 'I see what you were trying, it was just a swing and a miss. The clouds are burned out, and theres too much sky in the photo, which in turn competes for attention to your subject.', '2006-10-01 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881773, 393445, 32997, '<td valign="top">the highlights really make this mystical...tension is wonderfully enhanced by the shadows...<br/>very effectively processed..</td>', 'the highlights really make this mystical...tension is wonderfully enhanced by the shadows...very effectively processed..', '2006-10-01 12:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881776, 402365, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just love the yellow of aspen leaves in the fall...so pretty against the soft blue of the sky...beautiful shot.</td>', 'I just love the yellow of aspen leaves in the fall...so pretty against the soft blue of the sky...beautiful shot.', '2006-10-01 12:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881777, 397090, 17837, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say here. The color is a bit off, the exposure as well. Iffy about the composition here as well. I''m sorry, I just don''t see where you were going with it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say here. The color is a bit off, the exposure as well. Iffy about the composition here as well. I''m sorry, I just don''t see where you were going with it.', '2006-10-01 12:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881781, 403792, 17837, '<td valign="top">oh one of those camo grasshoppers. I just saw a print of one of these at my camera club. The focus is a bit off, I believe his eye should be in critical focus. Love the colors, and the lighting. Good job overall. The question is... Dead or alive?</td>', 'oh one of those camo grasshoppers. I just saw a print of one of these at my camera club. The focus is a bit off, I believe his eye should be in critical focus. Love the colors, and the lighting. Good job overall. The question is... Dead or alive?', '2006-10-01 12:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881783, 403844, 63495, '<td valign="top">very relaxing<br/>you captured the moment</td>', 'very relaxingyou captured the moment', '2006-10-01 12:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881784, 404085, 17837, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, good composition, good expression. a good photograph.</td>', 'Good lighting, good composition, good expression. a good photograph.', '2006-10-01 12:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881785, 404099, 45754, '<td valign="top">not sure what6 it is but it has a nice feel to it. Looks like an owl.</td>', 'not sure what6 it is but it has a nice feel to it. Looks like an owl.', '2006-10-01 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881786, 401962, 327, '<td valign="top">This is really nice..more then that. I admire your shot. These plane shots are very hard to do. Your is super. Congrats, focus, color well done.</td>', 'This is really nice..more then that. I admire your shot. These plane shots are very hard to do. Your is super. Congrats, focus, color well done.', '2006-10-01 12:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881791, 400629, 49109, '<td valign="top">good concept color and crop, foreground a bit too dark -8</td>', 'good concept color and crop, foreground a bit too dark -8', '2006-10-01 12:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
