(2881793, 394556, 17837, '<td valign="top">Lord, now that scares me. Hence my phobia of bugs hahahaha. <br/> <br/>Something about the colors and exposure are off a bit. There also seems to be no "critically sharp" point of interest, which is a must in macro photography.</td>', 'Lord, now that scares me. Hence my phobia of bugs hahahaha.  Something about the colors and exposure are off a bit. There also seems to be no "critically sharp" point of interest, which is a must in macro photography.', '2006-10-01 12:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
