(2881800, 397111, 17837, '<td valign="top">I must say, this photo is Trippy! Between the flare, the blownout highlights, the fact that I cant tell which side is up from down.... Im just... my brain overloaded haha.</td>', 'I must say, this photo is Trippy! Between the flare, the blownout highlights, the fact that I cant tell which side is up from down.... Im just... my brain overloaded haha.', '2006-10-01 12:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
