(2881814, 404072, 17837, '<td valign="top">First, let me say that I''m a huge portrait fan. I love this portrait. I''m not sure about the guy in red, as he takes attention off of the pretty woman.</td>', 'First, let me say that I''m a huge portrait fan. I love this portrait. I''m not sure about the guy in red, as he takes attention off of the pretty woman.', '2006-10-01 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881816, 396113, 327, '<td valign="top">This bridge is just amazing. It seems to change with the season, time of day, or night. Just beautiful.</td>', 'This bridge is just amazing. It seems to change with the season, time of day, or night. Just beautiful.', '2006-10-01 12:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881817, 395939, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like fairies should be hiding there. Mystical.</td>', 'Looks like fairies should be hiding there. Mystical.', '2006-10-01 12:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881822, 398375, 17837, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying, so I offer this suggestion to you. The left hand of the photograph, is basically doing nothing for the photo. I would crop the photo at the end of the building, give you shape, color, and the sky would be broken up by the cloud, and it would make this photo very much more impacting.</td>', 'I see what you were trying, so I offer this suggestion to you. The left hand of the photograph, is basically doing nothing for the photo. I would crop the photo at the end of the building, give you shape, color, and the sky would be broken up by the cloud, and it would make this photo very much more impacting.', '2006-10-01 12:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881824, 401418, 45754, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Good eye and well composed</td>', 'Very cool. Good eye and well composed', '2006-10-01 12:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881825, 403837, 327, '<td valign="top">Awwwh!~That should be illegal. LOL this is wonderful, what a great sense of humor and a darn good shot. All the best in the challeng.</td>', 'Awwwh!~That should be illegal. LOL this is wonderful, what a great sense of humor and a darn good shot. All the best in the challeng.', '2006-10-01 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881829, 403723, 327, '<td valign="top">That is one special sky you captured. Nice~</td>', 'That is one special sky you captured. Nice~', '2006-10-01 12:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881830, 398799, 45754, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. A tad lighter on the bridge since it is themain focal point. But still very nice</td>', 'Very lovely. A tad lighter on the bridge since it is themain focal point. But still very nice', '2006-10-01 12:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881832, 393678, 17837, '<td valign="top">The lighting is working well here. Its making her face seem very flat, as it is direct front lighting. Next time, have her turn her head to be at a 45 degree angle with the sun, this will give the portrait more dramatic lighting, and give an overall better effect. The focus seems a bit soft as well around the eyes, which is where critical focus should be obtained in a portrait.</td>', 'The lighting is working well here. Its making her face seem very flat, as it is direct front lighting. Next time, have her turn her head to be at a 45 degree angle with the sun, this will give the portrait more dramatic lighting, and give an overall better effect. The focus seems a bit soft as well around the eyes, which is where critical focus should be obtained in a portrait.', '2006-10-01 12:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881833, 397312, 63495, '<td valign="top">nice capture. i have not been able to get a hummer like that. good job</td>', 'nice capture. i have not been able to get a hummer like that. good job', '2006-10-01 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881834, 395788, 34134, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best bee shots I''ve seen!</td>', 'This is one of the best bee shots I''ve seen!', '2006-10-01 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2881835, 404083, 17837, '<td valign="top">A great grab shot for the family album!</td>', 'A great grab shot for the family album!', '2006-10-01 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
