(2881840, 404063, 327, '<td valign="top">Collioure, France. I had to look it up. Wow this is just great to see. I think you captured the feel of the harbor. Great colors here.</td>', 'Collioure, France. I had to look it up. Wow this is just great to see. I think you captured the feel of the harbor. Great colors here.', '2006-10-01 12:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
