(2881860, 394586, 29770, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful place.  Unfortunately, the focus looks a little off or the camera had some shake during the long exposure.  I do like the effect of the long exposure on the water falls.  The almost look like streams of light instead of water.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful place.  Unfortunately, the focus looks a little off or the camera had some shake during the long exposure.  I do like the effect of the long exposure on the water falls.  The almost look like streams of light instead of water.', '2006-10-01 12:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
