(2883155, 402536, 42100, '<td valign="top">Outstanding contrast to this great duotone.  I find it very interesting how different and similar at the same time that this is to my entry.  For starters the compositions are farely similar to one another, only the settings vary.  The next similarity is that the subjects in both are probably built pretty close to the same era.  Despite it''s age this one seems to be very much in the prime of its life.  While on the other hand the prime of my subject is long, long gone.  It is now just a Tumbleweed in the pasture of life.<br/> <br/>The backdrop for this compliments absolutely perfectly, and in no way takes away from the subject.  My only nitpick is the border, it seems so contemporary for such a classical photograph.  Is this Versailles(forgive my spelling) and a Citroen?  Well done!</td>', 'Outstanding contrast to this great duotone.  I find it very interesting how different and similar at the same time that this is to my entry.  For starters the compositions are farely similar to one another, only the settings vary.  The next similarity is that the subjects in both are probably built pretty close to the same era.  Despite it''s age this one seems to be very much in the prime of its life.  While on the other hand the prime of my subject is long, long gone.  It is now just a Tumbleweed in the pasture of life. The backdrop for this compliments absolutely perfectly, and in no way takes away from the subject.  My only nitpick is the border, it seems so contemporary for such a classical photograph.  Is this Versailles(forgive my spelling) and a Citroen?  Well done!', '2006-10-01 16:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883157, 403468, 63360, '<td valign="top">Very cool silhouette - I like the way the mother and son are framed by the water''s reflection.  I think this could be improved by cropping some of the foreground.</td>', 'Very cool silhouette - I like the way the mother and son are framed by the water''s reflection.  I think this could be improved by cropping some of the foreground.', '2006-10-01 16:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883160, 395592, 62095, '<td valign="top">He looks dog-tired. ;/</td>', 'He looks dog-tired. ;/', '2006-10-01 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
