(2883363, 403165, 61318, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been a fan of these types of shots, and they seem to be becomming more common here...without a significant background, the speed and power of these machines is almost completely lost...having said that, your shot is clear and sharp...overall solid attempt for what it is</td>', 'I''ve never been a fan of these types of shots, and they seem to be becomming more common here...without a significant background, the speed and power of these machines is almost completely lost...having said that, your shot is clear and sharp...overall solid attempt for what it is', '2006-10-01 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883366, 403391, 61318, '<td valign="top">having such a gap between the beast and the arm seems to lesson the impact of the moment, and provides too much negative space...going with b+w was a good decision</td>', 'having such a gap between the beast and the arm seems to lesson the impact of the moment, and provides too much negative space...going with b+w was a good decision', '2006-10-01 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
