(2883408, 403844, 31637, '<td valign="top">Its a pretty overall scene, but I do not know where to look first. I like the job you did with the feel of the photo..it''s a dark feeling, but there is too much negative space, not enough reflection on water and rocks are too far to see the great details. Perhaps a tighter crop would of helped and a loose sky too. 5</td>', 'Its a pretty overall scene, but I do not know where to look first. I like the job you did with the feel of the photo..it''s a dark feeling, but there is too much negative space, not enough reflection on water and rocks are too far to see the great details. Perhaps a tighter crop would of helped and a loose sky too. 5', '2006-10-01 17:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
