(2883434, 403667, 61318, '<td valign="top">not bad, not bad at all.  I wonder how a deeper DOF would have worked here though.  not saying that shallow isn''t effective, but perhaps having the entire scene in sharp focus would have been a bit more effective.  then again, I do enjoy having the front swan pop out and particularly the beak as such a contrasty focal point.</td>', 'not bad, not bad at all.  I wonder how a deeper DOF would have worked here though.  not saying that shallow isn''t effective, but perhaps having the entire scene in sharp focus would have been a bit more effective.  then again, I do enjoy having the front swan pop out and particularly the beak as such a contrasty focal point.', '2006-10-01 17:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883435, 397312, 61318, '<td valign="top">those ghosty wings are just fantastic</td>', 'those ghosty wings are just fantastic', '2006-10-01 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
