(2883645, 404097, 62095, '<td valign="top">This works fairly well although the burn-out is quite severe around the sun. The rocks are a nice touch.</td>', 'This works fairly well although the burn-out is quite severe around the sun. The rocks are a nice touch.', '2006-10-01 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883648, 404043, 36382, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.  I just think the post processing could have been done a bit better.  There''s a lot of red in the skin tones.  I love the expression.  I think it could be a great shot with the right post processing.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.  I just think the post processing could have been done a bit better.  There''s a lot of red in the skin tones.  I love the expression.  I think it could be a great shot with the right post processing.', '2006-10-01 18:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883650, 404088, 62095, '<td valign="top">The shot is stark and rugged, a good impression.</td>', 'The shot is stark and rugged, a good impression.', '2006-10-01 18:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883653, 403022, 39144, '<td valign="top">As a thumbnail this photo is beautiful. Full size the entire photo seems a bit blurry. Is it just me? Compositionally speaking, it is a 10. Colors are great, subject matter very appealing. Just the blurriness bothers me a bit.</td>', 'As a thumbnail this photo is beautiful. Full size the entire photo seems a bit blurry. Is it just me? Compositionally speaking, it is a 10. Colors are great, subject matter very appealing. Just the blurriness bothers me a bit.', '2006-10-01 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883654, 400236, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like how all the elements of this photo work together.</td>', 'I like how all the elements of this photo work together.', '2006-10-01 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883656, 403730, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful scene.  It is very well composed.  I think you could improve this shot a lot by lightening the shadows and applying more sharpening.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful scene.  It is very well composed.  I think you could improve this shot a lot by lightening the shadows and applying more sharpening.', '2006-10-01 18:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883658, 402744, 19944, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot.  The expression on her face, the black &amp; white, almost perfect.</td>', 'A wonderful shot.  The expression on her face, the black & white, almost perfect.', '2006-10-01 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883660, 401004, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I hope the lighthouse doesn''t really tilt that way.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I hope the lighthouse doesn''t really tilt that way.', '2006-10-01 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883661, 403465, 19944, '<td valign="top">WOW, this looks like on of those portraits that photographers hang on the big canvases in the mall to advertise their business.  I usually just stand and marvel at them.  Like I''m doing with this one.<br/> <br/>The lighthing is perfect, the blurred background is perfect, the facial expressions (woman &amp; dog) couldn''t be better.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting, but this would be a 12 if I could vote that high.</td>', 'WOW, this looks like on of those portraits that photographers hang on the big canvases in the mall to advertise their business.  I usually just stand and marvel at them.  Like I''m doing with this one. The lighthing is perfect, the blurred background is perfect, the facial expressions (woman & dog) couldn''t be better. I''m not voting, but this would be a 12 if I could vote that high.', '2006-10-01 18:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883663, 396768, 62095, '<td valign="top">Oops accidentally pressed 2 on this one! Still hopefully you didn''t notice.  Time to quickly fix that to a proper mark.  You''ve done well here capturing the light feather tones, I think.</td>', 'Oops accidentally pressed 2 on this one! Still hopefully you didn''t notice.  Time to quickly fix that to a proper mark.  You''ve done well here capturing the light feather tones, I think.', '2006-10-01 18:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883664, 403833, 61318, '<td valign="top">nice colors and textures here</td>', 'nice colors and textures here', '2006-10-01 18:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883666, 404005, 39144, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The lighting is beautiful. Contrast between shadows/highlights is excellent. I would like to see a longer shutter speed on this to turn the waterfall, which currently looks very busy, to a soft blur from top to bottom. Also, the foreground leaves that are out of the field of focus are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The lighting is beautiful. Contrast between shadows/highlights is excellent. I would like to see a longer shutter speed on this to turn the waterfall, which currently looks very busy, to a soft blur from top to bottom. Also, the foreground leaves that are out of the field of focus are a bit distracting.', '2006-10-01 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2883667, 401741, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for its simplicity.</td>', 'I like this shot for its simplicity.', '2006-10-01 18:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
