(2884008, 400819, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot.  I feel like I just caught a glimpse into the world of forever sweethearts.  Maybe the island is a "mirage" of where they spent their young lives together.  The island is great and the lamp post is very cool.  I think this was a good use of selective desaturation too.  Very nicely done. 8</td>', 'This is such a cool shot.  I feel like I just caught a glimpse into the world of forever sweethearts.  Maybe the island is a "mirage" of where they spent their young lives together.  The island is great and the lamp post is very cool.  I think this was a good use of selective desaturation too.  Very nicely done. 8', '2006-10-01 19:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884009, 403110, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oooo...this is very cool - looks like it''s straight out of "Cold Mountain" (I think that was the name of the movie anyway!).  I love how the snow looks against the fall colors. 8</td>', 'Oooo...this is very cool - looks like it''s straight out of "Cold Mountain" (I think that was the name of the movie anyway!).  I love how the snow looks against the fall colors. 8', '2006-10-01 19:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
