(2884013, 395499, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ooooo...how quirky &amp; fun!  I love the composition and the colors.  AND extra credit for hauling around a bedframe!  Wonderful!!!!!</td>', 'Ooooo...how quirky & fun!  I love the composition and the colors.  AND extra credit for hauling around a bedframe!  Wonderful!!!!!', '2006-10-01 19:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
