(2884019, 398283, 55838, '<td valign="top">A thing of beauty.  Gorgeous color and of course the campfire circle (as well as the wonderful colors) really sets this apart from other landscape shots so far.  I might have cloned out the headlights (or maybe it''s another fire) on the beach to the left of the rocks.  A wee bit distracting (but only the teensiest wee! :)   8.<br/>*****************<br/>Back to bump to 9 - one of my top two picks.  Good luck (as if you''ll need it!  :)</td>', 'A thing of beauty.  Gorgeous color and of course the campfire circle (as well as the wonderful colors) really sets this apart from other landscape shots so far.  I might have cloned out the headlights (or maybe it''s another fire) on the beach to the left of the rocks.  A wee bit distracting (but only the teensiest wee! :)   8.*****************Back to bump to 9 - one of my top two picks.  Good luck (as if you''ll need it!  :)', '2006-10-01 19:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884020, 402744, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  Beautiful facial expression - emotive.  It looks like you possibly added a grain (??) - whatever it is, the texture works well.  Love the crop and the B&amp;W.  The spot on the nose is a bit hot &amp; distracting but the shot strong enough to compensate IMO...8.</td>', 'This is lovely.  Beautiful facial expression - emotive.  It looks like you possibly added a grain (??) - whatever it is, the texture works well.  Love the crop and the B&W.  The spot on the nose is a bit hot & distracting but the shot strong enough to compensate IMO...8.', '2006-10-01 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
