(2884332, 397577, 46202, '<td valign="top">Nice use of vignette - The flower is very crisp and the colors are great. - 8</td>', 'Nice use of vignette - The flower is very crisp and the colors are great. - 8', '2006-10-01 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
