(2884431, 403995, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice simple clean</td>', 'Nice simple clean', '2006-10-01 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884432, 392577, 29293, '<td valign="top">not sure i like the border</td>', 'not sure i like the border', '2006-10-01 21:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884437, 396825, 19066, '<td valign="top">Wonderful presentation.  I love that eye.</td>', 'Wonderful presentation.  I love that eye.', '2006-10-01 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884439, 391073, 35708, '<td valign="top">The DOF was probably your intent but I think having a little bit more of the mantis in focus would be a little better; specifically in the ''arm'' area. Other than that I think this is a great shot; you have good colors, good layout (though that first shroom may be a little dominant (towering) over your subject, and I can tell you put forth a lot of effort on it. Nice work.</td>', 'The DOF was probably your intent but I think having a little bit more of the mantis in focus would be a little better; specifically in the ''arm'' area. Other than that I think this is a great shot; you have good colors, good layout (though that first shroom may be a little dominant (towering) over your subject, and I can tell you put forth a lot of effort on it. Nice work.', '2006-10-01 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884442, 403465, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice, soft, light shot. Love the expression and mood. Great dog!! Like the soft background. 10</td>', 'Nice, soft, light shot. Love the expression and mood. Great dog!! Like the soft background. 10', '2006-10-01 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884446, 403101, 25464, '<td valign="top">Pretty lady, nice background blur, but serious lighting issues.  Gotta watch the spotty lighting when dealing with natural shade.</td>', 'Pretty lady, nice background blur, but serious lighting issues.  Gotta watch the spotty lighting when dealing with natural shade.', '2006-10-01 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884447, 402286, 35708, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the orange tops were in the original or if you added the effect to simulate a sunset glistening off the peaks. Either way I think it stands out way too much since the rest of the picture conveys a calm serenity...</td>', 'Not sure if the orange tops were in the original or if you added the effect to simulate a sunset glistening off the peaks. Either way I think it stands out way too much since the rest of the picture conveys a calm serenity...', '2006-10-01 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884449, 396934, 25464, '<td valign="top">I have to give you credit.  These guys never stop moving!  Good shot.</td>', 'I have to give you credit.  These guys never stop moving!  Good shot.', '2006-10-01 21:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884451, 400901, 25464, '<td valign="top">This made me think of the stretchy girl on the Incredibles.  Interesting almost abstract portrait.</td>', 'This made me think of the stretchy girl on the Incredibles.  Interesting almost abstract portrait.', '2006-10-01 21:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884455, 398415, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection shot.</td>', 'Nice reflection shot.', '2006-10-01 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884456, 403465, 35708, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a very nice portrait. Too bad the dog didn''t look a little more relaxed as the female subject does but I know how hard it is to control animals. But the expression on the subject is great, the colors and composition add to it... I just cannot find anything but a few minor nit-picks with this. Great!!</td>', 'Wow, this is a very nice portrait. Too bad the dog didn''t look a little more relaxed as the female subject does but I know how hard it is to control animals. But the expression on the subject is great, the colors and composition add to it... I just cannot find anything but a few minor nit-picks with this. Great!!', '2006-10-01 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884457, 393183, 25464, '<td valign="top">incredible detail</td>', 'incredible detail', '2006-10-01 21:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884459, 396673, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice moment</td>', 'nice moment', '2006-10-01 21:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884462, 403674, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice stock image.  Love the star filter effect.</td>', 'Nice stock image.  Love the star filter effect.', '2006-10-01 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884466, 400362, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. The only thing I could say against it is the brightly lit side of the building is too much compared to the dim valley... either the house should be dimmed a little or the valley brightened a little to make the gap between them smaller in my opinion. But even still this is nice. I''d love to spend a week relaxing there!!</td>', 'This is a nice shot. The only thing I could say against it is the brightly lit side of the building is too much compared to the dim valley... either the house should be dimmed a little or the valley brightened a little to make the gap between them smaller in my opinion. But even still this is nice. I''d love to spend a week relaxing there!!', '2006-10-01 21:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884468, 403003, 25464, '<td valign="top">Tells a great story.  Nice journalistic approach.  Watch the tilt.  The muted colors are appropriate for the scene.  Nice job. The tilt is the only thing knocking the score down.</td>', 'Tells a great story.  Nice journalistic approach.  Watch the tilt.  The muted colors are appropriate for the scene.  Nice job. The tilt is the only thing knocking the score down.', '2006-10-01 21:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884470, 393643, 55738, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  And what a catch! the DOF is perfect as is the gaze of the puss.  Really, this is a great shot!</td>', 'Wonderful!  And what a catch! the DOF is perfect as is the gaze of the puss.  Really, this is a great shot!', '2006-10-01 21:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884471, 402091, 35708, '<td valign="top">I find the birds a little distracting due to the ''smooth'' colors of this shot. Everything seems to flow very well except for those little dots! I think some would say there is a bit too much exposure in the sky but I think it works well due to the diminished colors used. It is a nice shot... I just hope it was dim due to clouds and not smog!</td>', 'I find the birds a little distracting due to the ''smooth'' colors of this shot. Everything seems to flow very well except for those little dots! I think some would say there is a bit too much exposure in the sky but I think it works well due to the diminished colors used. It is a nice shot... I just hope it was dim due to clouds and not smog!', '2006-10-01 21:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884472, 394152, 25464, '<td valign="top">Horizon is a little tilted. Colors are great.  I think I would have preferred a little different angle so that the land in view wasn''t directly above the rock.</td>', 'Horizon is a little tilted. Colors are great.  I think I would have preferred a little different angle so that the land in view wasn''t directly above the rock.', '2006-10-01 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884473, 403711, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great stock image.</td>', 'Great stock image.', '2006-10-01 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884474, 394619, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting editing.  Very Sci-fi.</td>', 'Interesting editing.  Very Sci-fi.', '2006-10-01 21:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884475, 404019, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on this. Great job capturing the detail in the browns and grays of the insect.</td>', 'Nice focus on this. Great job capturing the detail in the browns and grays of the insect.', '2006-10-01 21:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884476, 403509, 63868, '<td valign="top">Focus is off. I like the composition.</td>', 'Focus is off. I like the composition.', '2006-10-01 21:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2884477, 399439, 35708, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great composition, but the difference in brightness hurts it in my opinion. The contrail in the sky does as well. I would have removed that from the picture and brightened up the right hand side just a little to make up if the difference. Also the buildings look a little over exposed as the lights in the windows are starting to blossom a bit too much. Dont take this the wrong way though... I really like what you did.</td>', 'Great idea, great composition, but the difference in brightness hurts it in my opinion. The contrail in the sky does as well. I would have removed that from the picture and brightened up the right hand side just a little to make up if the difference. Also the buildings look a little over exposed as the lights in the windows are starting to blossom a bit too much. Dont take this the wrong way though... I really like what you did.', '2006-10-01 21:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
