(2884712, 391073, 63360, '<td valign="top">The background makes this look like a fairytale.  I like the focus on the head, but wonder if it would be better to have the entire body in focus.</td>', 'The background makes this look like a fairytale.  I like the focus on the head, but wonder if it would be better to have the entire body in focus.', '2006-10-01 22:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
