(2884714, 391988, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. It looks to be ''over edited'' but I think it makes a great sci-fi piece.</td>', 'This is really cool. It looks to be ''over edited'' but I think it makes a great sci-fi piece.', '2006-10-01 22:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
