(2884735, 401192, 35708, '<td valign="top">The border does not help this shot. Cut it way back and make it black if you feel you must have it. Also find something in the composition to make more prominant so the viewers attention has something to latch on to.</td>', 'The border does not help this shot. Cut it way back and make it black if you feel you must have it. Also find something in the composition to make more prominant so the viewers attention has something to latch on to.', '2006-10-01 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
