(2884737, 404002, 63360, '<td valign="top">An interesting building.  Cropping some of the foreground and increasing the contrast would improve this photo.</td>', 'An interesting building.  Cropping some of the foreground and increasing the contrast would improve this photo.', '2006-10-01 22:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
