(2884749, 403114, 51538, '<td valign="top">My immediate reaction is to ask the question: via camera or via processing? Probably says more about me than your choice of technique.  The location is lovely.  The effect SF and strange.</td>', 'My immediate reaction is to ask the question: via camera or via processing? Probably says more about me than your choice of technique.  The location is lovely.  The effect SF and strange.', '2006-10-01 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
