(2884785, 401500, 63360, '<td valign="top">The lines created by the stair and railing are visually appealing.  The light behind is distracting.  Too bad it wasn''t right behind his back.</td>', 'The lines created by the stair and railing are visually appealing.  The light behind is distracting.  Too bad it wasn''t right behind his back.', '2006-10-01 22:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
