(2884801, 394700, 46202, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors!  A touch more DoF would have made a big difference, I think.  The body of the bird is perfectly focused and sharp, but the focus on his head is just a touch soft.</td>', 'Stunning colors!  A touch more DoF would have made a big difference, I think.  The body of the bird is perfectly focused and sharp, but the focus on his head is just a touch soft.', '2006-10-01 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
