(2885210, 395422, 17837, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition... I''m not sure if it works well here or not however. Good exposure.</td>', 'An interesting composition... I''m not sure if it works well here or not however. Good exposure.', '2006-10-02 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
