(2885214, 396113, 17837, '<td valign="top">A night image with a sepia tone... I dig it. at first I didnt, but I stared at it for a few moments, and I can see why you chose to do that. Its amazing how different it looks by night, isnt it?</td>', 'A night image with a sepia tone... I dig it. at first I didnt, but I stared at it for a few moments, and I can see why you chose to do that. Its amazing how different it looks by night, isnt it?', '2006-10-02 00:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885218, 403721, 17837, '<td valign="top">its a 10, do I really need to say more? Fantastic lighting, composition, catch lights, posing, VERY creative idea. I love it.</td>', 'its a 10, do I really need to say more? Fantastic lighting, composition, catch lights, posing, VERY creative idea. I love it.', '2006-10-02 00:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885219, 403509, 17837, '<td valign="top">I know people love their cats and all, but I wish there were more dogs in these challenges.</td>', 'I know people love their cats and all, but I wish there were more dogs in these challenges.', '2006-10-02 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
