(2885223, 402085, 17837, '<td valign="top">A wonderful capture. Its a bit noisy in the sky area... always check your blues, as they usually contain the most noise information.</td>', 'A wonderful capture. Its a bit noisy in the sky area... always check your blues, as they usually contain the most noise information.', '2006-10-02 00:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885225, 403713, 17837, '<td valign="top">Whoa, dude needs an eyebrow trim haha. Actually I think those covering his eye kinda distracts from the image a bit. These kinds of portraits are huge on the eyes, they make or break the photo.</td>', 'Whoa, dude needs an eyebrow trim haha. Actually I think those covering his eye kinda distracts from the image a bit. These kinds of portraits are huge on the eyes, they make or break the photo.', '2006-10-02 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885227, 403716, 17837, '<td valign="top">Well, this is the 3rd flower with a black background. I said it twice before, I just dont feel like these make good images.<br/> <br/>The exposure on the petals are a bit over exposed, there is no critical focus anywere in the image. I would also crop to make a better composition, because I dont think this works well.</td>', 'Well, this is the 3rd flower with a black background. I said it twice before, I just dont feel like these make good images. The exposure on the petals are a bit over exposed, there is no critical focus anywere in the image. I would also crop to make a better composition, because I dont think this works well.', '2006-10-02 00:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885229, 400795, 17837, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, though I feel as if there is no real determining factor of depth.its one continuous line from front to back, with nothing showing a sense of depth. The mountain in the rear shoudl appear smaller than it really is... and I think that takes away from the photo.</td>', 'Good DOF, though I feel as if there is no real determining factor of depth.its one continuous line from front to back, with nothing showing a sense of depth. The mountain in the rear shoudl appear smaller than it really is... and I think that takes away from the photo.', '2006-10-02 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885230, 404075, 17837, '<td valign="top">this is a fun capture. Not sure I like the sepia, and id love to see more of his reflection and less of that top wave.</td>', 'this is a fun capture. Not sure I like the sepia, and id love to see more of his reflection and less of that top wave.', '2006-10-02 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2885231, 397706, 17837, '<td valign="top">WOW. I wish I knew where this was!!!</td>', 'WOW. I wish I knew where this was!!!', '2006-10-02 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
