(2888020, 403374, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of these two, it has a very glamorous and vintage feel.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great portrait of these two, it has a very glamorous and vintage feel.  Nicely done!', '2006-10-02 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
