(2888024, 403663, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''ve checked this image on two monitors and it shows up dark on both.  I find the composition interesting but feel the lack of a full tonal range hurts just a little.</td>', 'I''ve checked this image on two monitors and it shows up dark on both.  I find the composition interesting but feel the lack of a full tonal range hurts just a little.', '2006-10-02 17:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
