(2888031, 396614, 34192, '<td valign="top">Image a little small to truly judge.  Title at conflict with image - I can see very little of the Harbour itself.</td>', 'Image a little small to truly judge.  Title at conflict with image - I can see very little of the Harbour itself.', '2006-10-02 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
