(2888150, 402163, 42025, '<td valign="top">love these birds, I make it a point to see them every time I go to the Denver zoo(not saying thats where you shot this) I know these birds have lovely colors but this image seems to be too saturated, which also makes the image appear grainy. would love to see the orginal and see if anything could make the color sat better.</td>', 'love these birds, I make it a point to see them every time I go to the Denver zoo(not saying thats where you shot this) I know these birds have lovely colors but this image seems to be too saturated, which also makes the image appear grainy. would love to see the orginal and see if anything could make the color sat better.', '2006-10-02 17:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
