(2888215, 399487, 62095, '<td valign="top">The black and white adds well to the starkness of this image.</td>', 'The black and white adds well to the starkness of this image.', '2006-10-02 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888237, 403818, 17837, '<td valign="top">A good rule of thumb for # of subjects, is to have odd numbers... 1/3/5 etc.<br/> <br/>The exposure on the birds is a bit off. Its tricky to capture good exposure on these because of the white feathers, but make sure to exposose FOR the white feathers, as it is easier to fix an underexposed part of your photo rather than trying to fix blown out highlights.<br/> <br/>I feel the composition could be better, theres no real "wow" factor.</td>', 'A good rule of thumb for # of subjects, is to have odd numbers... 1/3/5 etc. The exposure on the birds is a bit off. Its tricky to capture good exposure on these because of the white feathers, but make sure to exposose FOR the white feathers, as it is easier to fix an underexposed part of your photo rather than trying to fix blown out highlights. I feel the composition could be better, theres no real "wow" factor.', '2006-10-02 18:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888245, 402742, 61191, '<td valign="top">Title fits well, nice shot!</td>', 'Title fits well, nice shot!', '2006-10-02 18:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888246, 401238, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the photo; however, there are a few suggestions I offer. Next time, put the open negative space in the direction the rider is going. Right now, it looks like he is about to run into a wall. The exposure is great, but I feel this photo would benefit from being full color. <br/> <br/>Another suggestion, I feel like the impact of the photo is as such that if you broke the photo into 4 quadrants, your main interest would be that upper right quadrant. Perhaps you can run it through PS again, cropping just to that quadrant and posting it on outtakes.</td>', 'I like the photo; however, there are a few suggestions I offer. Next time, put the open negative space in the direction the rider is going. Right now, it looks like he is about to run into a wall. The exposure is great, but I feel this photo would benefit from being full color.  Another suggestion, I feel like the impact of the photo is as such that if you broke the photo into 4 quadrants, your main interest would be that upper right quadrant. Perhaps you can run it through PS again, cropping just to that quadrant and posting it on outtakes.', '2006-10-02 18:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888247, 402006, 61191, '<td valign="top">Love the details here. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Love the details here. Nice lighting.', '2006-10-02 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888252, 404068, 61191, '<td valign="top">Wow, scary shot!</td>', 'Wow, scary shot!', '2006-10-02 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888253, 402470, 17837, '<td valign="top">The DOF here doenst work too well here, its more a distraction than anything. I think your photo lies solely in the petal itself, so an extremely tighter crop would probably work well here.</td>', 'The DOF here doenst work too well here, its more a distraction than anything. I think your photo lies solely in the petal itself, so an extremely tighter crop would probably work well here.', '2006-10-02 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888258, 400629, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the desat and lighting. Quite strange and dark atmosphere.</td>', 'Great shot! Love the desat and lighting. Quite strange and dark atmosphere.', '2006-10-02 18:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888262, 395499, 8139, '<td valign="top">Surrealism isn''t ? Nice.</td>', 'Surrealism isn''t ? Nice.', '2006-10-02 18:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888263, 403915, 17837, '<td valign="top">a good childrens portrait! but the title is all wrong (dont worry, I dont mark off for titles). I think he is in his element, so long as he isnt staring into the camera. If he were to be actually playing with thomas, I think the title would fit. Actually, in this photo, I think thomas might be a bit of a distraction, and takes away focus from the boy. <br/> <br/>The photo is veyr sharp, as it should be. Great exposure, good pose, good lighting. Looks like a cloudy day, with a nice soft light on his face.</td>', 'a good childrens portrait! but the title is all wrong (dont worry, I dont mark off for titles). I think he is in his element, so long as he isnt staring into the camera. If he were to be actually playing with thomas, I think the title would fit. Actually, in this photo, I think thomas might be a bit of a distraction, and takes away focus from the boy.  The photo is veyr sharp, as it should be. Great exposure, good pose, good lighting. Looks like a cloudy day, with a nice soft light on his face.', '2006-10-02 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888268, 403614, 17837, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I did something VERY similar to this shot, and I got slammed for it. I imagine you also are feeling this same effect. I like the colors of the water, a part of the gull seems to be blown out. The reflection is wonderful. I could do with a different border, but thats personal opinion more than anything.</td>', 'Ya know, I did something VERY similar to this shot, and I got slammed for it. I imagine you also are feeling this same effect. I like the colors of the water, a part of the gull seems to be blown out. The reflection is wonderful. I could do with a different border, but thats personal opinion more than anything.', '2006-10-02 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888269, 403469, 8139, '<td valign="top">great emotional portrait .</td>', 'great emotional portrait .', '2006-10-02 18:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888275, 402436, 61191, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Your grungy processing works quite well - Great!</td>', 'Interesting subject. Your grungy processing works quite well - Great!', '2006-10-02 18:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888277, 396434, 61191, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, very creative!</td>', 'Cool idea, very creative!', '2006-10-02 18:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888285, 401173, 17837, '<td valign="top">a different take on this type of shot. I know I dont like how much the DOF drops off once it hits the dress... that almost seems unnatural.  Being a wedding photographer, I don''t even really know what to say. I can''t decide if the hair is distracting or not, even though I do likeit. Its just one of them images.</td>', 'a different take on this type of shot. I know I dont like how much the DOF drops off once it hits the dress... that almost seems unnatural.  Being a wedding photographer, I don''t even really know what to say. I can''t decide if the hair is distracting or not, even though I do likeit. Its just one of them images.', '2006-10-02 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888288, 402707, 17837, '<td valign="top">a cool photo, I cant decide if I like all that black in the bottom or if I would crop most of it out.</td>', 'a cool photo, I cant decide if I like all that black in the bottom or if I would crop most of it out.', '2006-10-02 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888289, 401081, 61191, '<td valign="top">What the hell...? This looks quite surreal. Where do you find subjects like this? The sky is quite amazing. The squares on the ground are leading towards the huge spike. Contrast and lighting are excellent. I would give an 11 on this, if possible!!</td>', 'What the hell...? This looks quite surreal. Where do you find subjects like this? The sky is quite amazing. The squares on the ground are leading towards the huge spike. Contrast and lighting are excellent. I would give an 11 on this, if possible!!', '2006-10-02 18:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
