(2888309, 403659, 17837, '<td valign="top">The focus is off, the colors are a bit muddy meaning its under exposed a bit. The composition doesnt work well here either, and that out of focus branch in the front is distracting.<br/> <br/>What type of flower is that?</td>', 'The focus is off, the colors are a bit muddy meaning its under exposed a bit. The composition doesnt work well here either, and that out of focus branch in the front is distracting. What type of flower is that?', '2006-10-02 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
