(2889605, 397075, 63360, '<td valign="top">Hey, this looks like where I live (middle of western Kansas, on the high plains)  :)  Your photo would have worked well for A Single Tree challenge, too!  I do like the wide-open spaces you are showing here.  This could be improved by deepening the color of blue in the sky, and burning some of the foreground to make the grasses more dramatic.  Now I am inspired to try a photo like this one.  Thanks!!</td>', 'Hey, this looks like where I live (middle of western Kansas, on the high plains)  :)  Your photo would have worked well for A Single Tree challenge, too!  I do like the wide-open spaces you are showing here.  This could be improved by deepening the color of blue in the sky, and burning some of the foreground to make the grasses more dramatic.  Now I am inspired to try a photo like this one.  Thanks!!', '2006-10-03 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
