(2889613, 403915, 63360, '<td valign="top">Wow, what beautiful brown eyes.  I really like how he is looking right into the camera.  And the tight shot with the way you cropped some of his head out works so well, too.  IMO, this photo would be much better without "Thomas", as this should really be all about the little boy!</td>', 'Wow, what beautiful brown eyes.  I really like how he is looking right into the camera.  And the tight shot with the way you cropped some of his head out works so well, too.  IMO, this photo would be much better without "Thomas", as this should really be all about the little boy!', '2006-10-03 00:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
