(2890168, 404027, 61318, '<td valign="top">you wouldn''t think this would make for a great shot, but it sure does...the textures of the wood and the wall make all the difference, and the soft tones make for a very warm scene.</td>', 'you wouldn''t think this would make for a great shot, but it sure does...the textures of the wood and the wall make all the difference, and the soft tones make for a very warm scene.', '2006-10-03 05:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
