(2890236, 403214, 12930, '<td valign="top">Double portraits are difficult because there are two pairs of eyes vying for attention and I think that this is the case here,also the left eye of the model on the left is very dark and would have benefitted from some reflected light.I think that a potrait of the model on the right, on her own, would be much better.</td>', 'Double portraits are difficult because there are two pairs of eyes vying for attention and I think that this is the case here,also the left eye of the model on the left is very dark and would have benefitted from some reflected light.I think that a potrait of the model on the right, on her own, would be much better.', '2006-10-03 06:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2890239, 403465, 44819, '<td valign="top">very good portrait!</td>', 'very good portrait!', '2006-10-03 06:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
