(2890901, 399805, 51538, '<td valign="top">A cliche in many ways, from pose to processing.  But if you are going that route, then do it well.  You have, IMO (even if it is not really my taste in photos). 8.</td>', 'A cliche in many ways, from pose to processing.  But if you are going that route, then do it well.  You have, IMO (even if it is not really my taste in photos). 8.', '2006-10-03 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
