(2891014, 402807, 51538, '<td valign="top">Anguished, oddball.  Even repulsive.  But a photographer who takes photos of images like this one would regard terms like those as compliments.  Terms which come to mind.  The geometry of the composition is intruiging.</td>', 'Anguished, oddball.  Even repulsive.  But a photographer who takes photos of images like this one would regard terms like those as compliments.  Terms which come to mind.  The geometry of the composition is intruiging.', '2006-10-03 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2891018, 402678, 61138, '<td valign="top">Nice "old school" kind of group shot. I like the setting. It seems to match the subject and treatment very well. The lighting, poses and expression are consistent and engaging.<br/> <br/>My only complaint (not a huge one) is that the distortion seems extreme in places, especially on the man seated on the right. His forearms and feet look out of proportion.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, very nicely done. I give it a 7.</td>', 'Nice "old school" kind of group shot. I like the setting. It seems to match the subject and treatment very well. The lighting, poses and expression are consistent and engaging. My only complaint (not a huge one) is that the distortion seems extreme in places, especially on the man seated on the right. His forearms and feet look out of proportion. Otherwise, very nicely done. I give it a 7.', '2006-10-03 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2891019, 398645, 51538, '<td valign="top">There''s always one car too many in NYC locations.  If it is not a blasted car, it is a window a/c unit.  Such is life.</td>', 'There''s always one car too many in NYC locations.  If it is not a blasted car, it is a window a/c unit.  Such is life.', '2006-10-03 11:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2891020, 402436, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice agricultural look to this engine.  Colours and forms are pleasant. 10.</td>', 'Nice agricultural look to this engine.  Colours and forms are pleasant. 10.', '2006-10-03 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2891022, 404010, 51538, '<td valign="top">Stalking among the stalks.  Nice animal.</td>', 'Stalking among the stalks.  Nice animal.', '2006-10-03 11:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2891025, 399080, 51538, '<td valign="top">Etherial.  Colours are lovely and the texture of the rocks is well detailed in your photo. 9.</td>', 'Etherial.  Colours are lovely and the texture of the rocks is well detailed in your photo. 9.', '2006-10-03 11:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
