(2891283, 403909, 59215, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. A couple suggestions- might bump up the midtones in levels just to bring out a little more detail in the rocks. Also maybe a slight clockwise rotation. Not sure if the ridge in the background is actually horizontal instead of sloped, but for the photograph''s composition it might help to use that ridgeline as gauge for a level horizon line- to reduce the effect of eyes sliding to the left. 7</td>', 'Beautiful image. A couple suggestions- might bump up the midtones in levels just to bring out a little more detail in the rocks. Also maybe a slight clockwise rotation. Not sure if the ridge in the background is actually horizontal instead of sloped, but for the photograph''s composition it might help to use that ridgeline as gauge for a level horizon line- to reduce the effect of eyes sliding to the left. 7', '2006-10-03 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
