(2891373, 403299, 41794, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan of spiders, actually I am quite terrified of them. That being said...this is a fantastic macro shot. The level of detail is amazing. Very well captured!</td>', 'I am not a big fan of spiders, actually I am quite terrified of them. That being said...this is a fantastic macro shot. The level of detail is amazing. Very well captured!', '2006-10-03 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
