(2891866, 398956, 62095, '<td valign="top">What I can see in this photo looks fairly detailed.  However it''s a bit on the small size to really see what is going on.</td>', 'What I can see in this photo looks fairly detailed.  However it''s a bit on the small size to really see what is going on.', '2006-10-03 16:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
