(2891883, 400902, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good image, and nice focus in places, although the centre could maybe be a bit sharper.  The green object in front is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good image, and nice focus in places, although the centre could maybe be a bit sharper.  The green object in front is a bit distracting.', '2006-10-03 17:05:03.000000', NULL, 1);
