(2895731, 403878, 6999, '<td valign="top">It must be of course, because of the colour, huh? The selective de-sat has an adverse effect on what might otherwise have been, to me, one of the more interesting baby shots I''ve seen. It''d even be more interesting if you''d said it was a boy. Maybe it''s effective around here, but I prefer to make my own stories from an image - I believe that''s where the magic lies - rather than to be slapped around the retina and told what''s most important like this.</td>', 'It must be of course, because of the colour, huh? The selective de-sat has an adverse effect on what might otherwise have been, to me, one of the more interesting baby shots I''ve seen. It''d even be more interesting if you''d said it was a boy. Maybe it''s effective around here, but I prefer to make my own stories from an image - I believe that''s where the magic lies - rather than to be slapped around the retina and told what''s most important like this.', '2006-10-04 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895733, 403626, 41794, '<td valign="top">Like the leading line of the shore. Would maybe have liked to see the shot pulled back a little further to see the end of the point, but then again..might make the lighthouse seem to small.</td>', 'Like the leading line of the shore. Would maybe have liked to see the shot pulled back a little further to see the end of the point, but then again..might make the lighthouse seem to small.', '2006-10-04 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
