(2897090, 399805, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is really really unpleasant - all the worst things about glossy magazine portraiture over done to extremes. The bizarre bordering, the soft-focus, the smoothing (or whatever it is), the weird shadows around her knees, the slightly peculiar expression. It''s just got no connection with any kind of world, real or imagined, that holds any appeal for me. Damn, you''ve even got a soft-focus effect on your border! Maybe it isn''t soft focus. Maybe it''s some other kind of glow effect or something. <br/> <br/>Beyond my personal distaste for it (I''m not just being rude, I think it''s important that opinion is heard), i guess it''s pretty well executed. I wonder if that glow might be too much even for fans of this stuff - it is, I think, perhaps just too strong - giving a feel of odd focus rather than a simple effect. The glow on the border likewise perhaps just draws the eye too much - especially on the left of frame, where the unmade bed (or whatever) is sliding quite nicely into darkness otherwise. And her expression is a touch uncomfortable - she doesn''t seem at ease with this world you''ve made for her. I''ll be intrigued to see how the site rates it though.</td>', 'This is really really unpleasant - all the worst things about glossy magazine portraiture over done to extremes. The bizarre bordering, the soft-focus, the smoothing (or whatever it is), the weird shadows around her knees, the slightly peculiar expression. It''s just got no connection with any kind of world, real or imagined, that holds any appeal for me. Damn, you''ve even got a soft-focus effect on your border! Maybe it isn''t soft focus. Maybe it''s some other kind of glow effect or something.  Beyond my personal distaste for it (I''m not just being rude, I think it''s important that opinion is heard), i guess it''s pretty well executed. I wonder if that glow might be too much even for fans of this stuff - it is, I think, perhaps just too strong - giving a feel of odd focus rather than a simple effect. The glow on the border likewise perhaps just draws the eye too much - especially on the left of frame, where the unmade bed (or whatever) is sliding quite nicely into darkness otherwise. And her expression is a touch uncomfortable - she doesn''t seem at ease with this world you''ve made for her. I''ll be intrigued to see how the site rates it though.', '2006-10-04 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897101, 397682, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely model.  I''ve seen her before.  I simply don''t know what to say about the veil or hat obscuring her face.  I''ve finally decided it creates a tension.  And it''s a good thing.  A 9 for me.  But a 10 without the veil.  ;)</td>', 'Lovely model.  I''ve seen her before.  I simply don''t know what to say about the veil or hat obscuring her face.  I''ve finally decided it creates a tension.  And it''s a good thing.  A 9 for me.  But a 10 without the veil.  ;)', '2006-10-04 19:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897103, 403391, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting; My first reaction is that the exposure lacks some control - has the impression of being brought back too far from over-exposed, or something, and I find the visibility of the cow''s shoulder unsettles the composition a bit - my eye can''t help but be pulled there - a slightly tighter crop might have made that balance more comfortable. background is something of a problem, not working with your subjects very happily; but the idea, overall, I like, and it''s been a lot more fun to look at than most.</td>', 'Interesting; My first reaction is that the exposure lacks some control - has the impression of being brought back too far from over-exposed, or something, and I find the visibility of the cow''s shoulder unsettles the composition a bit - my eye can''t help but be pulled there - a slightly tighter crop might have made that balance more comfortable. background is something of a problem, not working with your subjects very happily; but the idea, overall, I like, and it''s been a lot more fun to look at than most.', '2006-10-04 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897106, 391476, 58452, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure with beautiful light details.</td>', 'Excellent exposure with beautiful light details.', '2006-10-04 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897109, 401698, 6999, '<td valign="top">I never understand why people seem to like infra-red so much. Seems to me just another trick in a world of tricks.</td>', 'I never understand why people seem to like infra-red so much. Seems to me just another trick in a world of tricks.', '2006-10-04 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897117, 403299, 58452, '<td valign="top">My choice for the ribbons and I''ve voted on all but 14.  I love the lighting and transparency of the spider.  The pattern of the web is lovely.  Very nice!</td>', 'My choice for the ribbons and I''ve voted on all but 14.  I love the lighting and transparency of the spider.  The pattern of the web is lovely.  Very nice!', '2006-10-04 19:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897122, 403389, 6999, '<td valign="top">I get your point, obviously, but I''m unsure I''d think of riding one of those things as ''simple'' no matter how accustomed to it one was. Perhaps also slightly too cluttered a composition - just too much stuff involved really - and the lens distortion unsettles the eye a touch.</td>', 'I get your point, obviously, but I''m unsure I''d think of riding one of those things as ''simple'' no matter how accustomed to it one was. Perhaps also slightly too cluttered a composition - just too much stuff involved really - and the lens distortion unsettles the eye a touch.', '2006-10-04 19:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897126, 403657, 58452, '<td valign="top">Excellent rim lighting on the faces.  The smoke rings almost look like hearts.  I wonder if a diagonal representation of the faces would work.  Anyway, very nice image!</td>', 'Excellent rim lighting on the faces.  The smoke rings almost look like hearts.  I wonder if a diagonal representation of the faces would work.  Anyway, very nice image!', '2006-10-04 19:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897128, 403999, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the transparent feeling of the building with the clouds.  Nice balance between the hooded subject and the older building.</td>', 'Love the transparent feeling of the building with the clouds.  Nice balance between the hooded subject and the older building.', '2006-10-04 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897129, 403469, 6999, '<td valign="top">Black and white - surely this cries out for a black and white treatment? You''d lose the rather toneless background colour (no loss), the bland colours of his clothes (no loss), and emphasise the the textures of his head, the white of his beard, and the highlight of that tear (all win).</td>', 'Black and white - surely this cries out for a black and white treatment? You''d lose the rather toneless background colour (no loss), the bland colours of his clothes (no loss), and emphasise the the textures of his head, the white of his beard, and the highlight of that tear (all win).', '2006-10-04 19:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897138, 403299, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong nature shot - I would wish for just a little deeper DOF - it would be more interesting to me with that sharpness of all those threads fully realised. Detail and light are good.</td>', 'Strong nature shot - I would wish for just a little deeper DOF - it would be more interesting to me with that sharpness of all those threads fully realised. Detail and light are good.', '2006-10-04 20:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897144, 403705, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting at least - can''t quite decide whether I actually like it or not at the moment. Compositionally - yes. But whether i can sense any artistic justification for that I''m not sure.</td>', 'Interesting at least - can''t quite decide whether I actually like it or not at the moment. Compositionally - yes. But whether i can sense any artistic justification for that I''m not sure.', '2006-10-04 20:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897146, 402564, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely model.  I like the way you''ve separated her from the background.  A version with her somewhat closer in the frame with the camera lower  would be nice too.  A shame the background to our right has the high contrast pavement.  But detracts very little from this excellent image.  Bumped it to a 9.</td>', 'Lovely model.  I like the way you''ve separated her from the background.  A version with her somewhat closer in the frame with the camera lower  would be nice too.  A shame the background to our right has the high contrast pavement.  But detracts very little from this excellent image.  Bumped it to a 9.', '2006-10-04 20:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897150, 402990, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something of a classic - a touch boring for being so common, and a shame you didn''t find one with more grace to it''s neck shape, but it''s basically a well taken shot. I might have taken some trouble to lighten the head, just to keep it in the same brightness space as the body, but it''s your shot.</td>', 'Something of a classic - a touch boring for being so common, and a shame you didn''t find one with more grace to it''s neck shape, but it''s basically a well taken shot. I might have taken some trouble to lighten the head, just to keep it in the same brightness space as the body, but it''s your shot.', '2006-10-04 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897155, 401357, 6999, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach - and effective in negative too.</td>', 'An interesting approach - and effective in negative too.', '2006-10-04 20:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897193, 395763, 58452, '<td valign="top">I love the ripples and hills and the detail in the sky adds a lot to this image.  I think the polarization is just a touch over the top for my taste. Maybe this was at high  altitude.  Just a little more detail in the sand area would have made this a tremendous image.  As is, it''s just excellent!</td>', 'I love the ripples and hills and the detail in the sky adds a lot to this image.  I think the polarization is just a touch over the top for my taste. Maybe this was at high  altitude.  Just a little more detail in the sand area would have made this a tremendous image.  As is, it''s just excellent!', '2006-10-04 20:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897201, 402742, 58452, '<td valign="top">Seems to capture the tiredness of this old guy.  Wishing he were in colder climes.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Seems to capture the tiredness of this old guy.  Wishing he were in colder climes.Very nice.', '2006-10-04 20:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897208, 402173, 58452, '<td valign="top">Excellent bokeh on this shot.  A classic pose for the hummer.  Could be a touch sharper but still a very good capture.</td>', 'Excellent bokeh on this shot.  A classic pose for the hummer.  Could be a touch sharper but still a very good capture.', '2006-10-04 20:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897231, 403653, 58452, '<td valign="top">Came back to this image several times.  Not comfortable with the PP treatment but the intensity of the expression blasted through....... bumping this one up several notches to an 8.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Came back to this image several times.  Not comfortable with the PP treatment but the intensity of the expression blasted through....... bumping this one up several notches to an 8.Very nice.', '2006-10-04 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897234, 393687, 58452, '<td valign="top">White fur, feathers, etc are very difficult to capture well.  This seems a little  hot to me.  Perhaps a closer crop with the animal in a different position would be nicer.</td>', 'White fur, feathers, etc are very difficult to capture well.  This seems a little  hot to me.  Perhaps a closer crop with the animal in a different position would be nicer.', '2006-10-04 20:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897244, 392623, 58452, '<td valign="top">If frenetic movement you wanted to portray, success. The extremely high contrast splashes across the middle of the frame are very distracting.  Maybe a crop with her feet and hands also visible would help the subject.  I like the blurred colors of the subject.</td>', 'If frenetic movement you wanted to portray, success. The extremely high contrast splashes across the middle of the frame are very distracting.  Maybe a crop with her feet and hands also visible would help the subject.  I like the blurred colors of the subject.', '2006-10-04 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897248, 399805, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is simply stunning.  I''d love to see th eoriginal and the steps you used to get here.</td>', 'This is simply stunning.  I''d love to see th eoriginal and the steps you used to get here.', '2006-10-04 20:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897252, 398862, 58452, '<td valign="top">Sharp capture of the animals head.  The pose of the animal is not very flattering.  Maybe diagonally from the right or left would be better.  I''d like to see all of the ears.  The exposure seems a little dull with that light.  A monichrome conversion might work.  Good image.</td>', 'Sharp capture of the animals head.  The pose of the animal is not very flattering.  Maybe diagonally from the right or left would be better.  I''d like to see all of the ears.  The exposure seems a little dull with that light.  A monichrome conversion might work.  Good image.', '2006-10-04 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897278, 399805, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely model.  I like the way her head turns and her hair cascades.  The PP of her skin is just a bit over the top for me.  I find myself wondering what the object is behind her and to her right..  It''s somewhat distracting.  Sitting in front of the digital frame just doesn''t do a lot to the image for me.  Very good image.</td>', 'Lovely model.  I like the way her head turns and her hair cascades.  The PP of her skin is just a bit over the top for me.  I find myself wondering what the object is behind her and to her right..  It''s somewhat distracting.  Sitting in front of the digital frame just doesn''t do a lot to the image for me.  Very good image.', '2006-10-04 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897305, 403961, 58452, '<td valign="top">The yellow ball really jumps out front on this image.  A version without the OOF diagonal thru the dogs head and the OOF white spot to the right would be much nicer.</td>', 'The yellow ball really jumps out front on this image.  A version without the OOF diagonal thru the dogs head and the OOF white spot to the right would be much nicer.', '2006-10-04 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897337, 403266, 17837, '<td valign="top">This is a very traumatic photograph. Its so life like, and I can feel the heat still smoldering... Great Photojournalism shot.</td>', 'This is a very traumatic photograph. Its so life like, and I can feel the heat still smoldering... Great Photojournalism shot.', '2006-10-04 20:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897340, 403924, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like the image, I am uneasy about the background, id like to just see it all white, I think that would make this a 9-10. As is, 6</td>', 'I like the image, I am uneasy about the background, id like to just see it all white, I think that would make this a 9-10. As is, 6', '2006-10-04 20:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897342, 402006, 17837, '<td valign="top">Now that is scary *shudders*</td>', 'Now that is scary *shudders*', '2006-10-04 20:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897344, 403374, 17837, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think she should be staring at him, not away from him. Its a bit on the warm side also.</td>', 'Personally, I think she should be staring at him, not away from him. Its a bit on the warm side also.', '2006-10-04 20:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897349, 403940, 17837, '<td valign="top">The beginnings of a fisheye. It looks neat, but overall it seems a bit too dark for me.</td>', 'The beginnings of a fisheye. It looks neat, but overall it seems a bit too dark for me.', '2006-10-04 20:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897353, 399104, 17837, '<td valign="top">a great shot! Very americana... I plan on starting a series of photographs of "americana" very soon.</td>', 'a great shot! Very americana... I plan on starting a series of photographs of "americana" very soon.', '2006-10-04 20:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897358, 400680, 17837, '<td valign="top">Ah, young grasshopper... The background here is  very distracting. It looks as if you found the mantis climbing perhaps a chair or something.</td>', 'Ah, young grasshopper... The background here is  very distracting. It looks as if you found the mantis climbing perhaps a chair or something.', '2006-10-04 20:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897361, 403283, 17837, '<td valign="top">I think if you remove the sign and crop to the beginning of that wall, you have an 8.</td>', 'I think if you remove the sign and crop to the beginning of that wall, you have an 8.', '2006-10-04 20:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897364, 403091, 17837, '<td valign="top">Her expression is very vague, im not sure I would call it "striking" I do love her eyes however. its a so-so portrait. I''d clone out the straggling hairs on her forehead. and perhaps a little of the one by her mouth.</td>', 'Her expression is very vague, im not sure I would call it "striking" I do love her eyes however. its a so-so portrait. I''d clone out the straggling hairs on her forehead. and perhaps a little of the one by her mouth.', '2006-10-04 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897370, 403723, 40718, '<td valign="top">I really like this <i>except</i> for the very yellow chunk of clouds.  it a) sticks out and b) looks pretty altered.  I would have liked it to look more like the rest of the sky.  Still, I''ll give you a 7.  I would have cloned out the cars too.</td>', 'I really like this except for the very yellow chunk of clouds.  it a) sticks out and b) looks pretty altered.  I would have liked it to look more like the rest of the sky.  Still, I''ll give you a 7.  I would have cloned out the cars too.', '2006-10-04 21:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897374, 400819, 17837, '<td valign="top">Im not sure I like the selective desaturation here, Id much rather it all be bw.</td>', 'Im not sure I like the selective desaturation here, Id much rather it all be bw.', '2006-10-04 21:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897397, 404039, 17837, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, I do think though that the horizon should be straightened. just a personal preference. When I see horizons with slight tilts, not dramatic ones, I tend to think its just an oversight.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, I do think though that the horizon should be straightened. just a personal preference. When I see horizons with slight tilts, not dramatic ones, I tend to think its just an oversight.', '2006-10-04 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897402, 402638, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like this for the artistic merit. Photography speaking, well im not so sure.</td>', 'I like this for the artistic merit. Photography speaking, well im not so sure.', '2006-10-04 21:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897406, 396165, 17837, '<td valign="top">WOW. the only thing this portrait is missing, is catch lights in the eyes. I might even consider throwing some bouced lighting from the right side to lighten his face a bit. Anyways, This is an 8.</td>', 'WOW. the only thing this portrait is missing, is catch lights in the eyes. I might even consider throwing some bouced lighting from the right side to lighten his face a bit. Anyways, This is an 8.', '2006-10-04 21:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897416, 400399, 17837, '<td valign="top">The centered composition doesnt workwell here, and the exposure on the whites of the feathers are a little bit over exposed. To help this, when you are photographing pure white objects, you want to over expose by about 1/2 a stop.</td>', 'The centered composition doesnt workwell here, and the exposure on the whites of the feathers are a little bit over exposed. To help this, when you are photographing pure white objects, you want to over expose by about 1/2 a stop.', '2006-10-04 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897420, 402798, 17837, '<td valign="top">looks like an altima rear lights, I think that the reflections dont do much justice here though.</td>', 'looks like an altima rear lights, I think that the reflections dont do much justice here though.', '2006-10-04 21:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897430, 403169, 3724, '<td valign="top">Clean setting with this wall - maybe a interstate sound barrier? a good observation, glad the top of the wall was included, which makes for a complete environ.  Edit &amp; colour is really interesting, possibly hdr processed.  A favorite for me in this challenge.</td>', 'Clean setting with this wall - maybe a interstate sound barrier? a good observation, glad the top of the wall was included, which makes for a complete environ.  Edit & colour is really interesting, possibly hdr processed.  A favorite for me in this challenge.', '2006-10-04 21:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897432, 401789, 17837, '<td valign="top">ok, this is a great example of great timing, and perhaps planned timing as well. Good job. Especially with the DOF!</td>', 'ok, this is a great example of great timing, and perhaps planned timing as well. Good job. Especially with the DOF!', '2006-10-04 21:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897440, 403344, 17837, '<td valign="top">Wow, how you managed to get ABOVE the bird over what looks to be ocean, is beyond me! +1 for difficulty of shot.</td>', 'Wow, how you managed to get ABOVE the bird over what looks to be ocean, is beyond me! +1 for difficulty of shot.', '2006-10-04 21:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897445, 403143, 17837, '<td valign="top">I dont know how I feel about this. What I do wanna know is why you would post such a small photo in a challenge were you had 700pixels to work with.</td>', 'I dont know how I feel about this. What I do wanna know is why you would post such a small photo in a challenge were you had 700pixels to work with.', '2006-10-04 21:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897447, 403732, 17837, '<td valign="top">Such beauty! I like the black and white also.</td>', 'Such beauty! I like the black and white also.', '2006-10-04 21:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897450, 403567, 17837, '<td valign="top">I like that the younger girls face is that of disgust, as if the bird didnt choose her.</td>', 'I like that the younger girls face is that of disgust, as if the bird didnt choose her.', '2006-10-04 21:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897459, 395788, 17837, '<td valign="top">amazing colors!</td>', 'amazing colors!', '2006-10-04 21:18:55.000000', NULL, 1);
