(2897539, 396221, 17837, '<td valign="top">great lighting, great tones. I like it as black and white also. Her expression could be better Ithink, but it isnt horrid.</td>', 'great lighting, great tones. I like it as black and white also. Her expression could be better Ithink, but it isnt horrid.', '2006-10-04 21:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
