(2897816, 403964, 33515, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems too be to centered and I''m not sure if the tree on the right really adds anything to the photo. It looks like a great day at the lake to take pictures and I think if you could have found a place on the shore where you could have taken better advantage of the fall colors, reflection, as well as the mist on the water you would have had a better entry. Im being picky here because it looks like a great spot, so please take my comments for what they are worth. Best of luck 6</td>', 'The horizon seems too be to centered and I''m not sure if the tree on the right really adds anything to the photo. It looks like a great day at the lake to take pictures and I think if you could have found a place on the shore where you could have taken better advantage of the fall colors, reflection, as well as the mist on the water you would have had a better entry. Im being picky here because it looks like a great spot, so please take my comments for what they are worth. Best of luck 6', '2006-10-04 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
