(2898117, 399805, 54843, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I keep finding neat details the longer I look.  Love the border!  I get all sort of complaints about my border experiments, but this one really stands out and make the image classy and dynamic.</td>', 'Fantastic.  I keep finding neat details the longer I look.  Love the border!  I get all sort of complaints about my border experiments, but this one really stands out and make the image classy and dynamic.', '2006-10-04 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
