(2898130, 403626, 54843, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a foreground object and leading lines to move the viewer''s eyes through the image. Excellent exposure.  One of the better images IMOP.</td>', 'Nice use of a foreground object and leading lines to move the viewer''s eyes through the image. Excellent exposure.  One of the better images IMOP.', '2006-10-04 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
