(2898179, 396972, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice and clean.  Good capture.  Like the focal area(s).  Perhaps a fraction more in focus, not sure, but definitely more stop motion (difficult obviously) make this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition (although <i>maybe</i> a little tighter at the bottom, losing some more stem, not sure) and simple colors - although <i>perhaps</i> the colors tweaked just a fraction, may have given this even more, who knows.</td>', '8 - Nice and clean.  Good capture.  Like the focal area(s).  Perhaps a fraction more in focus, not sure, but definitely more stop motion (difficult obviously) make this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition (although maybe a little tighter at the bottom, losing some more stem, not sure) and simple colors - although perhaps the colors tweaked just a fraction, may have given this even more, who knows.', '2006-10-05 00:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2898180, 403663, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, I like this a lot!  If the sky were brighter, that would for sure give it the extra "wow", meaning the sky is darker than I would like.  (The fence post on the left is perfectly placed for my taste, and I like the decision to square crop!)</td>', 'This is a great composition, I like this a lot!  If the sky were brighter, that would for sure give it the extra "wow", meaning the sky is darker than I would like.  (The fence post on the left is perfectly placed for my taste, and I like the decision to square crop!)', '2006-10-05 00:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
