(2898555, 402385, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular photograph!<br/> <br/>I have a couple of really good moonlit scenery phoyos over the years and I know how rare a picture like this truly is!<br/> <br/>The really unusual cloud formations make it even better.<br/> <br/>A "10" from me....I''d give it an "11" if I could simply for the virtual impossibility that you could have planned this.<br/> <br/>Wonderful job!</td>', 'What a spectacular photograph! I have a couple of really good moonlit scenery phoyos over the years and I know how rare a picture like this truly is! The really unusual cloud formations make it even better. A "10" from me....I''d give it an "11" if I could simply for the virtual impossibility that you could have planned this. Wonderful job!', '2006-10-05 02:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2898559, 402310, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful, heartwarming photograph!</td>', 'What a wonderful, heartwarming photograph!', '2006-10-05 02:09:09.000000', NULL, 1);
