(2900165, 401417, 64175, '<td valign="top">The clouds are nice, but in this shot, i think the b/w actually took something away from the photo.  I would have prefered some blue sky behind those puffy clouds.</td>', 'The clouds are nice, but in this shot, i think the b/w actually took something away from the photo.  I would have prefered some blue sky behind those puffy clouds.', '2006-10-05 15:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
