(2900174, 401936, 64175, '<td valign="top">Subject is out of focus.</td>', 'Subject is out of focus.', '2006-10-05 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900178, 396221, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, what a beautiful model. oh, and a good picture, too! I like the foreshortening of the knees, the way you make the perspective lines of the bridge look like a box that she''s trapped in.</td>', 'wow, what a beautiful model. oh, and a good picture, too! I like the foreshortening of the knees, the way you make the perspective lines of the bridge look like a box that she''s trapped in.', '2006-10-05 16:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900196, 402744, 64733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I love the soft lines and the the BW contrast.  A winner!</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I love the soft lines and the the BW contrast.  A winner!', '2006-10-05 16:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900201, 399104, 64733, '<td valign="top">The colors are very intense considering the subject.  Cropped and shot perfectly.</td>', 'The colors are very intense considering the subject.  Cropped and shot perfectly.', '2006-10-05 16:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900206, 401630, 64733, '<td valign="top">This one really does allude to a story.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This one really does allude to a story.  Nicely done.', '2006-10-05 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900211, 403865, 64733, '<td valign="top">truly wonderful</td>', 'truly wonderful', '2006-10-05 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900216, 399227, 64733, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and light.  great detail in the face and a great expression.</td>', 'very nice composition and light.  great detail in the face and a great expression.', '2006-10-05 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900220, 399278, 64733, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this was staged or if it was a candid.  Either way, it''s a great image and nice editing too.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this was staged or if it was a candid.  Either way, it''s a great image and nice editing too.', '2006-10-05 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900223, 403552, 64733, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, but would like to see her centered in the frame.</td>', 'A lovely shot, but would like to see her centered in the frame.', '2006-10-05 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900283, 403299, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Really like this, especially the detail on the upper threads and the transparency captured.  ''If only'' the dof were a little more bringing the whole spider into focus.  The bottom thread looks a bit ''odd'', whether that is a result of oof or pp not sure.  Depending what you had to work with, I wonder if nudge rotating this up on the right to gain more symmetry and balance, especially in the sharper areas, may have given this a little extra.  The little ''bundle'' of strings top left, whilst fairly good detail, detracts <i>slightly</i> in my opinion, and could likely afford to have been cropped out, especially as it is already ''chopped''.  Like the composition.</td>', '7 - Really like this, especially the detail on the upper threads and the transparency captured.  ''If only'' the dof were a little more bringing the whole spider into focus.  The bottom thread looks a bit ''odd'', whether that is a result of oof or pp not sure.  Depending what you had to work with, I wonder if nudge rotating this up on the right to gain more symmetry and balance, especially in the sharper areas, may have given this a little extra.  The little ''bundle'' of strings top left, whilst fairly good detail, detracts slightly in my opinion, and could likely afford to have been cropped out, especially as it is already ''chopped''.  Like the composition.', '2006-10-05 16:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900300, 396434, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, excellent idea! 10</td>', 'I really do like this photo, excellent idea! 10', '2006-10-05 16:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900302, 398283, 36060, '<td valign="top">I really do like this photo, great colours.</td>', 'I really do like this photo, great colours.', '2006-10-05 16:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
