(2900326, 399805, 36060, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the atmosphere in this photo.</td>', 'I like the composition and the atmosphere in this photo.', '2006-10-05 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900328, 398499, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice capture.  Perhaps a variation in cropping at the bottom to eliminate the bricks/paving/edging (or maybe cloning them out, who knows)and a fraction nudge rotate up on the left to ''straighten'', likely have made this even better in my opinion.  The one on the left is easy to miss on ''quick view''.  Difficult with the white bird bath, but just a slight tweaking of color saturation/contrast/something may have also lifted this a little more.</td>', '6 - Nice capture.  Perhaps a variation in cropping at the bottom to eliminate the bricks/paving/edging (or maybe cloning them out, who knows)and a fraction nudge rotate up on the left to ''straighten'', likely have made this even better in my opinion.  The one on the left is easy to miss on ''quick view''.  Difficult with the white bird bath, but just a slight tweaking of color saturation/contrast/something may have also lifted this a little more.', '2006-10-05 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900333, 401238, 15002, '<td valign="top">This my pick for the blue ribbon.  Great action shot.  The DOF and focus are spot on.  The tonal range is excellent.  The expression on the athletes face provides insight into the action.  Great job.<br/> <br/>Good Luck.</td>', 'This my pick for the blue ribbon.  Great action shot.  The DOF and focus are spot on.  The tonal range is excellent.  The expression on the athletes face provides insight into the action.  Great job. Good Luck.', '2006-10-05 16:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900335, 403804, 15002, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal range and focus.</td>', 'Excellent tonal range and focus.', '2006-10-05 16:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900342, 390831, 15002, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a big fan of kitty photos, but this is excellent.  Fresh perspective, great use of color.</td>', 'I''m not usually a big fan of kitty photos, but this is excellent.  Fresh perspective, great use of color.', '2006-10-05 17:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900353, 403675, 52713, '<td valign="top">Norway?</td>', 'Norway?', '2006-10-05 17:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900396, 404081, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.  Wish it were 720 - sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  Probably looks very good wall sized.  Like the composition.  A slight tweaking of the ''ranges'' might have given this a little more depth/drama and even more of an edge, but perhaps difficult with likely resulting pp issues.  Good detail and dof.</td>', '7 - Nice image.  Wish it were 720 - sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  Probably looks very good wall sized.  Like the composition.  A slight tweaking of the ''ranges'' might have given this a little more depth/drama and even more of an edge, but perhaps difficult with likely resulting pp issues.  Good detail and dof.', '2006-10-05 17:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900404, 403299, 36199, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot</td>', 'Fantastic shot', '2006-10-05 17:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900408, 402955, 25166, '<td valign="top">What kite''s he flying. I buggy and board in the UK! Flexifoil Rule!</td>', 'What kite''s he flying. I buggy and board in the UK! Flexifoil Rule!', '2006-10-05 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900436, 394022, 35994, '<td valign="top">really nice colors, the waves from him moving definitely add to the picture. nice shot</td>', 'really nice colors, the waves from him moving definitely add to the picture. nice shot', '2006-10-05 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900437, 396379, 35994, '<td valign="top">nice actions shot! colors are great &amp; good bokeh!</td>', 'nice actions shot! colors are great & good bokeh!', '2006-10-05 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900449, 404090, 6999, '<td valign="top">The actual flow of the water has been very well captured in this long exposure - but your framing of it, your composition, lacks finesse I think; there''s a discomforting sense of a tilted horizon, but only partially so, so that the viewer is simply discomforted, rather than forced to change their point of view. Placing the waterfall so centrally in frame is also quite weak - the eye is constantly drawn to areas other than what ought surely to be your point pf interest. And finally, there''s a blue colour cast to the whole thing, which makes it seem firstly washed out and lacking the drama of light, and secondly, not completely under your control.</td>', 'The actual flow of the water has been very well captured in this long exposure - but your framing of it, your composition, lacks finesse I think; there''s a discomforting sense of a tilted horizon, but only partially so, so that the viewer is simply discomforted, rather than forced to change their point of view. Placing the waterfall so centrally in frame is also quite weak - the eye is constantly drawn to areas other than what ought surely to be your point pf interest. And finally, there''s a blue colour cast to the whole thing, which makes it seem firstly washed out and lacking the drama of light, and secondly, not completely under your control.', '2006-10-05 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900456, 403828, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fascinating; the implications of this are tremendous, taking one off in all sorts of directions. The composition is clever, too. Excellent entry.</td>', 'Fascinating; the implications of this are tremendous, taking one off in all sorts of directions. The composition is clever, too. Excellent entry.', '2006-10-05 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900617, 401844, 19708, '<td valign="top">awwwwww - look at those eyes!!!<br/>Not sure what the title implies - a sibling bite?<br/>No matter - I don''t vote on a title, just curious.</td>', 'awwwwww - look at those eyes!!!Not sure what the title implies - a sibling bite?No matter - I don''t vote on a title, just curious.', '2006-10-05 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900622, 397616, 19708, '<td valign="top">An impossible metering condition using the camera''s wants.<br/>Fill flash is the only way around this.</td>', 'An impossible metering condition using the camera''s wants.Fill flash is the only way around this.', '2006-10-05 18:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900633, 402673, 19708, '<td valign="top">An amazing sunset here!<br/>I really like the wide-aspect ratio crop on this.<br/>I''m sure you have been getting comments regarding the border treatment knowing DPC and the general feeling about bold borders. This would have worked better, as it is, but in a less bold color, perhaps doinig it in white, then fading it back a bit, or in a neutral grey.</td>', 'An amazing sunset here!I really like the wide-aspect ratio crop on this.I''m sure you have been getting comments regarding the border treatment knowing DPC and the general feeling about bold borders. This would have worked better, as it is, but in a less bold color, perhaps doinig it in white, then fading it back a bit, or in a neutral grey.', '2006-10-05 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900656, 400819, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good photograph.  Some nice character elements, a few distracting ones, like the selective desat, but do wonder (if the clothing color suited) whether leaving the couple in color as well, may have made this even better, but your call - obviously.  Judging by your title, perhaps you wanted the island to dominate/visually offset.</td>', '8 - Good photograph.  Some nice character elements, a few distracting ones, like the selective desat, but do wonder (if the clothing color suited) whether leaving the couple in color as well, may have made this even better, but your call - obviously.  Judging by your title, perhaps you wanted the island to dominate/visually offset.', '2006-10-05 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900679, 400819, 8643, '<td valign="top">Maybe a slightly different viewpoint to square up the bench, otherwise an attracive idea.</td>', 'Maybe a slightly different viewpoint to square up the bench, otherwise an attracive idea.', '2006-10-05 19:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900680, 402081, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept.  Lighting is nice.  The perspective though, in my opinion, is distracting.  <i>Perhaps</i> a rotate 90 degrees right, not sure - which might ''lift'' the facial expression a little too.  The curtain(?) on the right takes a little to decipher as there is not enough of it yet it is visible, so perhaps including more, not sure, but again, could just be this angle/perspective.  The desaturation/toning works well, however the roses more subtle in color and processing, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Like the concept.  Lighting is nice.  The perspective though, in my opinion, is distracting.  Perhaps a rotate 90 degrees right, not sure - which might ''lift'' the facial expression a little too.  The curtain(?) on the right takes a little to decipher as there is not enough of it yet it is visible, so perhaps including more, not sure, but again, could just be this angle/perspective.  The desaturation/toning works well, however the roses more subtle in color and processing, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-10-05 19:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900688, 403468, 8643, '<td valign="top">Bit too much negative space top &amp; bottom for me, otherwise a nice idea.</td>', 'Bit too much negative space top & bottom for me, otherwise a nice idea.', '2006-10-05 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900698, 398172, 8643, '<td valign="top">Pity the toe is so bright, but a very attractive image.</td>', 'Pity the toe is so bright, but a very attractive image.', '2006-10-05 19:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900702, 395788, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Oh - like the detail.  Like the composition, colors and close crop.  Difficult, but ''even sharper'' (including more stop motion) and either the fore flowers and all bee in focus or else ''somehow'' just the bee with the flowers a little ''softer'' (including contrast), if that makes sense.  Maybe a <i>fraction</i> more height compositionally at the top, not sure.</td>', '6 - Oh - like the detail.  Like the composition, colors and close crop.  Difficult, but ''even sharper'' (including more stop motion) and either the fore flowers and all bee in focus or else ''somehow'' just the bee with the flowers a little ''softer'' (including contrast), if that makes sense.  Maybe a fraction more height compositionally at the top, not sure.', '2006-10-05 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900715, 398307, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture.</td>', 'Brilliant capture.', '2006-10-05 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900721, 401962, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean action  shot, attractively composed.</td>', 'Very nice clean action  shot, attractively composed.', '2006-10-05 19:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2900737, 404003, 58247, '<td valign="top">Those cheeks are just begging for some pinching. :-)</td>', 'Those cheeks are just begging for some pinching. :-)', '2006-10-05 19:37:15.000000', NULL, 1);
