(2901015, 403999, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m tough on statue shots, because I feel like the sculptor did most of the work. But clearly you have re-imagined the landscape here... from the clouds in the building to the severe angle and crop of the statue. This picture should stand as a model for other photographers who wish to shoot statues. 9</td>', 'I''m tough on statue shots, because I feel like the sculptor did most of the work. But clearly you have re-imagined the landscape here... from the clouds in the building to the severe angle and crop of the statue. This picture should stand as a model for other photographers who wish to shoot statues. 9', '2006-10-05 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
