(2901076, 403842, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dark triangular shadows on his face echo the butterfly in his hand. splendid. 9</td>', 'the dark triangular shadows on his face echo the butterfly in his hand. splendid. 9', '2006-10-05 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901077, 395499, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah, I love a dose of Surrealism! 8</td>', 'ah, I love a dose of Surrealism! 8', '2006-10-05 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901085, 399396, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a photo of a rectangle of light. This rectangle is rudely interrupted by Wally, which in turn shows us a little something about the rectangle, and also about Wally. The reason this is so wonderful is because it reveals an essential truth: all photography is a picture of light... and an even more profound truth: all vision is a matter of seeing how things affect light. 9</td>', 'This is a photo of a rectangle of light. This rectangle is rudely interrupted by Wally, which in turn shows us a little something about the rectangle, and also about Wally. The reason this is so wonderful is because it reveals an essential truth: all photography is a picture of light... and an even more profound truth: all vision is a matter of seeing how things affect light. 9', '2006-10-05 20:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901091, 401441, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture. I feel like I know so much about this girl, about how she approaches life. I can almost sense her whole life. I like her, I root for her: she is brave. you have revealed a spirit she has, one that might be hidden from most, or might even be hidden from her. 8</td>', 'wonderful capture. I feel like I know so much about this girl, about how she approaches life. I can almost sense her whole life. I like her, I root for her: she is brave. you have revealed a spirit she has, one that might be hidden from most, or might even be hidden from her. 8', '2006-10-05 20:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901094, 395792, 50695, '<td valign="top">you should''ve called it ARK II. Great picture. 8</td>', 'you should''ve called it ARK II. Great picture. 8', '2006-10-05 20:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901176, 390831, 50034, '<td valign="top">I know that cat...</td>', 'I know that cat...', '2006-10-05 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901181, 402756, 50034, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you have to build all of your houses on stilts!  ;)</td>', 'I''ll bet you have to build all of your houses on stilts!  ;)', '2006-10-05 21:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901187, 398980, 50034, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!!!!!!!</td>', 'Spectacular!!!!!!!', '2006-10-05 21:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901222, 399278, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lots of processing has produced a striking triple portrait.</td>', 'Lots of processing has produced a striking triple portrait.', '2006-10-05 21:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901304, 401630, 44453, '<td valign="top">magical! Post processing is spot on and composition is beautiful.  I''m a sucker for a nice seascape and this fits the bill perfectly.</td>', 'magical! Post processing is spot on and composition is beautiful.  I''m a sucker for a nice seascape and this fits the bill perfectly.', '2006-10-05 22:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901315, 396873, 44453, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of high contrast - would probably win the blue in that challenge but should also do very well in this one.  like all good portraits you''ve captured the eyes perfectly - well done</td>', 'beautiful use of high contrast - would probably win the blue in that challenge but should also do very well in this one.  like all good portraits you''ve captured the eyes perfectly - well done', '2006-10-05 22:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901318, 394679, 44453, '<td valign="top">very dramatic angle - interesting to see a b/w of what is traditionally a colour subject - and I love it - 9</td>', 'very dramatic angle - interesting to see a b/w of what is traditionally a colour subject - and I love it - 9', '2006-10-05 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901420, 401839, 17837, '<td valign="top">Well, I understand the title, but doesnt think it has much to do with the photo. As it is, I wish that the sky wasnt blown out. if it werent, this photo would be superb.</td>', 'Well, I understand the title, but doesnt think it has much to do with the photo. As it is, I wish that the sky wasnt blown out. if it werent, this photo would be superb.', '2006-10-05 22:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
