(2901492, 404033, 63360, '<td valign="top">So precious.  I think the hand and all those blankets around the head are taking away from such a beautiful face.  (If this is your baby, congratulations!)</td>', 'So precious.  I think the hand and all those blankets around the head are taking away from such a beautiful face.  (If this is your baby, congratulations!)', '2006-10-05 22:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
