(2901518, 404076, 63360, '<td valign="top">The water looks pretty with the reflections of the trees, but I''m not sure that the light is creating much interest.  Also, the sky should be cropped out because it really doesn''t add anything here.</td>', 'The water looks pretty with the reflections of the trees, but I''m not sure that the light is creating much interest.  Also, the sky should be cropped out because it really doesn''t add anything here.', '2006-10-05 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901528, 403805, 63360, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here, and the overall composition is good.  I think that the number on the door should have been cloned out.</td>', 'I really like the colors here, and the overall composition is good.  I think that the number on the door should have been cloned out.', '2006-10-05 22:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901537, 403710, 63360, '<td valign="top">The colors are quite lovely.  If the focus is on the fields, then maybe a tighter shot and a horizontal crop would work better here.</td>', 'The colors are quite lovely.  If the focus is on the fields, then maybe a tighter shot and a horizontal crop would work better here.', '2006-10-05 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2901538, 402673, 23680, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, magnificent colors, not overdone.  I''m sure you''re getting plenty of comments about the border so I won''t add mine :)</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, magnificent colors, not overdone.  I''m sure you''re getting plenty of comments about the border so I won''t add mine :)', '2006-10-05 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
