(2902218, 404097, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think you may have adjusted contrast too much on this one.  It really made the sun and trail on the water way overexposed.  If you have a way of extracting that portion of it while adjusting the brightness and contrast of the rest of the image, it might have made a better, less glary image.  Your rock detail is very clear and well lit, but the rest of the image doesn''t really support the rocks.</td>', 'I think you may have adjusted contrast too much on this one.  It really made the sun and trail on the water way overexposed.  If you have a way of extracting that portion of it while adjusting the brightness and contrast of the rest of the image, it might have made a better, less glary image.  Your rock detail is very clear and well lit, but the rest of the image doesn''t really support the rocks.', '2006-10-06 07:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
