(2902288, 392380, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need more tonal lighting to enhance the shape of the garlic and the lines of its skin.  I think the orangy warming filter took away the varying details that would make this image pop.<br/>As to lighting, maybe glancing over the image from the right might have added more tonal detail.  Work with lighting, using what you have whether it be flashlights or mirrored light and you can get the tones and shaping light that you need.</td>', 'Need more tonal lighting to enhance the shape of the garlic and the lines of its skin.  I think the orangy warming filter took away the varying details that would make this image pop.As to lighting, maybe glancing over the image from the right might have added more tonal detail.  Work with lighting, using what you have whether it be flashlights or mirrored light and you can get the tones and shaping light that you need.', '2006-10-06 08:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
