(2902535, 395713, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh I so adore cheetahs. Unusual composition and close up portrait - I like it.</td>', 'Oooh I so adore cheetahs. Unusual composition and close up portrait - I like it.', '2006-10-06 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902538, 402798, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lovely light and reflections, unusual almost abstract presentation of an everyday object. Works.</td>', 'Great composition, lovely light and reflections, unusual almost abstract presentation of an everyday object. Works.', '2006-10-06 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902541, 401578, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the image a lot but the processing - leading to those extreme halos around the silhouettes - is, to me, very offputting. Shame, as I think the silhouette subject matter is great fun, nicely captured and the sky too is great.</td>', 'Like the image a lot but the processing - leading to those extreme halos around the silhouettes - is, to me, very offputting. Shame, as I think the silhouette subject matter is great fun, nicely captured and the sky too is great.', '2006-10-06 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902549, 404077, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of foreground to add more interest and to make it a bit different.</td>', 'Nice choice of foreground to add more interest and to make it a bit different.', '2006-10-06 10:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902551, 396434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! With their heads closer in and in a more accurate circle, and without the red outfit, they''d almost look like a human sunflower!</td>', 'Cute! With their heads closer in and in a more accurate circle, and without the red outfit, they''d almost look like a human sunflower!', '2006-10-06 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902553, 403643, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice framing using the foreground and foliage and bottom and left edges and to some extent, the darker area of cloud across the top. Lovely black and white conversion with wonderful high contrast. That sky is just fabulous. Composition rocks!</td>', 'Nice framing using the foreground and foliage and bottom and left edges and to some extent, the darker area of cloud across the top. Lovely black and white conversion with wonderful high contrast. That sky is just fabulous. Composition rocks!', '2006-10-06 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902554, 403844, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very serene, almost ghostly...</td>', 'Very serene, almost ghostly...', '2006-10-06 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902557, 404027, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great subject and I like the simple presentation. I wonder if a slightly different viewpoint would help avoid the corner shadow at the top right and whether a light reflector might help reduce shadows a touch to the right of the machine? Regardless, I do like the simplicity of what is presented and the wonderful patina of age.</td>', 'Great subject and I like the simple presentation. I wonder if a slightly different viewpoint would help avoid the corner shadow at the top right and whether a light reflector might help reduce shadows a touch to the right of the machine? Regardless, I do like the simplicity of what is presented and the wonderful patina of age.', '2006-10-06 11:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902573, 400819, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this needs selective desaturation, I think I''d prefer it without. But I really like the image itself, the portrait of this elderly couple in quiet conversation sitting infront of such a beautiful, almost timeless, view.</td>', 'I''m not sure this needs selective desaturation, I think I''d prefer it without. But I really like the image itself, the portrait of this elderly couple in quiet conversation sitting infront of such a beautiful, almost timeless, view.', '2006-10-06 11:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902583, 403846, 3087, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured that smokey light well and I like how the shaft of light falls on the man drinking. I almost with the lady behind either weren''t there or were somewhat differently positioned as I think she detracts from the more striking drinking man.</td>', 'You''ve really captured that smokey light well and I like how the shaft of light falls on the man drinking. I almost with the lady behind either weren''t there or were somewhat differently positioned as I think she detracts from the more striking drinking man.', '2006-10-06 11:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902586, 392623, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool! Like the motion and colour and energy.</td>', 'Cool! Like the motion and colour and energy.', '2006-10-06 11:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902590, 402745, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and shadow and shallow DOF. Like it a lot.</td>', 'Great use of light and shadow and shallow DOF. Like it a lot.', '2006-10-06 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902607, 394619, 56978, '<td valign="top">fascinating effect...looking forward to trying this out!</td>', 'fascinating effect...looking forward to trying this out!', '2006-10-06 11:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902613, 394284, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice color contrasts and detail.  Great use of DOF as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice color contrasts and detail.  Great use of DOF as well.  Well done!', '2006-10-06 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
