(2902788, 403886, 29797, '<td valign="top">Very touching photo, you''ve captured the warm heart of these people perfectly, and the backlighting of the trees is a really nice touch. I hope the voters look past the literalness of the photo and see the true essence of what you captured here, as to the little girl here this is much more than a just pony ride. Nice job!<br/> <br/>Back in high school, I volunteered for a year at a place like this called <a href="//aheadwithhorses.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ahead With Horses</a>, which has incredible programs for special-needs children (and some challenged adults). William Shatner (amongst many others) is a huge supporter of this place. -My apologies if this isn''t the same type of facility.</td>', 'Very touching photo, you''ve captured the warm heart of these people perfectly, and the backlighting of the trees is a really nice touch. I hope the voters look past the literalness of the photo and see the true essence of what you captured here, as to the little girl here this is much more than a just pony ride. Nice job! Back in high school, I volunteered for a year at a place like this called Ahead With Horses, which has incredible programs for special-needs children (and some challenged adults). William Shatner (amongst many others) is a huge supporter of this place. -My apologies if this isn''t the same type of facility.', '2006-10-06 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902792, 399762, 61318, '<td valign="top">nice colors...I like the splash of gold in the background...usually it''s a good idea to utilize the full 720px allowed</td>', 'nice colors...I like the splash of gold in the background...usually it''s a good idea to utilize the full 720px allowed', '2006-10-06 11:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902796, 401857, 61318, '<td valign="top">very nice b+w here...love that cloud...horizon is definitely askew, though</td>', 'very nice b+w here...love that cloud...horizon is definitely askew, though', '2006-10-06 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902798, 403755, 61318, '<td valign="top">nice contrasty scene here</td>', 'nice contrasty scene here', '2006-10-06 11:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902802, 403643, 53243, '<td valign="top">lovely black and white - the dark clouds give it an ominous look.</td>', 'lovely black and white - the dark clouds give it an ominous look.', '2006-10-06 11:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902803, 402864, 53243, '<td valign="top">the flowers in the front are distracting.  They compete for attention with the dark foreground of the castle</td>', 'the flowers in the front are distracting.  They compete for attention with the dark foreground of the castle', '2006-10-06 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902804, 403768, 42100, '<td valign="top">Incredible sunset, the colors are so rich and vibrant.  I''m sure the split the middle composition is by design, but it doesn''t seem to work, at least not for me.  There is some really great things happening in the lower half, and the upper half seems to be robbing it of its glory.</td>', 'Incredible sunset, the colors are so rich and vibrant.  I''m sure the split the middle composition is by design, but it doesn''t seem to work, at least not for me.  There is some really great things happening in the lower half, and the upper half seems to be robbing it of its glory.', '2006-10-06 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902811, 404050, 53243, '<td valign="top">what happen to the rotation!</td>', 'what happen to the rotation!', '2006-10-06 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902818, 403109, 53243, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful colors and reflection</td>', 'absolutely beautiful colors and reflection', '2006-10-06 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902824, 403880, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is very cool photo, very cool with the graffiti and the way person is posed.  I wonder if a slightly tighter crop eliminating the black area would be better on this.  Most of the focus of this photo is person and the immediate environment, and the darkness seems more of a black-hole sucking the attention away.</td>', 'This is very cool photo, very cool with the graffiti and the way person is posed.  I wonder if a slightly tighter crop eliminating the black area would be better on this.  Most of the focus of this photo is person and the immediate environment, and the darkness seems more of a black-hole sucking the attention away.', '2006-10-06 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902825, 403468, 58590, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, but i would have cropped out more of the bottom part to eliminate SO much black.</td>', 'I love the shot, but i would have cropped out more of the bottom part to eliminate SO much black.', '2006-10-06 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902831, 403725, 58590, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2006-10-06 12:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902833, 396120, 58590, '<td valign="top">great contrast!!</td>', 'great contrast!!', '2006-10-06 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902834, 400454, 64175, '<td valign="top">The blues in the eye are very nice. A bit more lighting in the top right quadrant of the eye would enhance this photo further. As it is right now, you end up with a comple black void for a section of the phot whcih then starts to pick up color on the outer edge.</td>', 'The blues in the eye are very nice. A bit more lighting in the top right quadrant of the eye would enhance this photo further. As it is right now, you end up with a comple black void for a section of the phot whcih then starts to pick up color on the outer edge.', '2006-10-06 12:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902840, 403803, 58590, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot!!!!  very romantic!!</td>', 'I LOVE this shot!!!!  very romantic!!', '2006-10-06 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902843, 403635, 58590, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2006-10-06 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902844, 403248, 58590, '<td valign="top">It looks like a scene from LOST... gorgeous islnad!!! great color, excellent composition... nicely shot!</td>', 'It looks like a scene from LOST... gorgeous islnad!!! great color, excellent composition... nicely shot!', '2006-10-06 12:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902851, 402564, 58590, '<td valign="top">awesome... love everything about it!</td>', 'awesome... love everything about it!', '2006-10-06 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902856, 400681, 58590, '<td valign="top">a little too washed out for my taste</td>', 'a little too washed out for my taste', '2006-10-06 12:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902868, 402564, 46853, '<td valign="top">So you continue with your somewhere, nowhere seris.</td>', 'So you continue with your somewhere, nowhere seris.', '2006-10-06 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902871, 397111, 50695, '<td valign="top">you have made the entire world into an insignificant piece of colored glass, but ever so pretty. art can do no finer thing. 10<br/> <br/>addendum: I''m sorry if my wording alarmed you. I really think you did something wonderful. After all, every photograph is a matter of taking the big, fat world and squeezing it into a little square. You have revealed the bones of that process. Many photographs do this, and I think it''s a very good thing to do. In your case, you simply turned your photo upside-down, showing that it was never rightside-up to begin with. That''s a fairly common "trick" with reflections, but it''s very successful here: reality does a good job of being a rich, dark reflection of artifice.</td>', 'you have made the entire world into an insignificant piece of colored glass, but ever so pretty. art can do no finer thing. 10 addendum: I''m sorry if my wording alarmed you. I really think you did something wonderful. After all, every photograph is a matter of taking the big, fat world and squeezing it into a little square. You have revealed the bones of that process. Many photographs do this, and I think it''s a very good thing to do. In your case, you simply turned your photo upside-down, showing that it was never rightside-up to begin with. That''s a fairly common "trick" with reflections, but it''s very successful here: reality does a good job of being a rich, dark reflection of artifice.', '2006-10-06 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902875, 403844, 29797, '<td valign="top">Ooh, this is NICE! I was at this exact spot at Mono lake just 3 days ago! I really like your choice of composition here, going wide to include the foreground tufa and plants. The duotone adds a very nice originality to the usual kind of Mono Lake shots out there. Nice job!</td>', 'Ooh, this is NICE! I was at this exact spot at Mono lake just 3 days ago! I really like your choice of composition here, going wide to include the foreground tufa and plants. The duotone adds a very nice originality to the usual kind of Mono Lake shots out there. Nice job!', '2006-10-06 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902877, 403659, 58590, '<td valign="top">a little too grainy and OOF... IMO</td>', 'a little too grainy and OOF... IMO', '2006-10-06 12:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902897, 403732, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Very nice indeed.', '2006-10-06 12:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902899, 398862, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast and detail.  The roo looks very sad, maybe it''s just the darkness of the photo.  Very good!</td>', 'Wonderful contrast and detail.  The roo looks very sad, maybe it''s just the darkness of the photo.  Very good!', '2006-10-06 12:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902901, 393445, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very gothic and eery looking with the setting and the PP.  Well done!</td>', 'Very gothic and eery looking with the setting and the PP.  Well done!', '2006-10-06 12:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902905, 403697, 52549, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The leaf and background the same shade is very clever (and very nice).</td>', 'I like this a lot. The leaf and background the same shade is very clever (and very nice).', '2006-10-06 12:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902906, 398980, 58590, '<td valign="top">I wish my camera could do this!!! Great shot!</td>', 'I wish my camera could do this!!! Great shot!', '2006-10-06 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902909, 403469, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2006-10-06 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
