(2902942, 403723, 64175, '<td valign="top">The greenish tint coming from the cloud looks off or even "fake".  I really like the shot though and will give it higher score. If you used some post processing and got rid of that green, it should show much better.</td>', 'The greenish tint coming from the cloud looks off or even "fake".  I really like the shot though and will give it higher score. If you used some post processing and got rid of that green, it should show much better.', '2006-10-06 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902945, 401633, 64175, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but the colors just are not sharp enough on this image.  Perhaps a little more post processing is necessary to really make them stand out such as the lime green on the black baloon or the brightness of the orange?/red of the pumpkin? balloon in the middle.</td>', 'Not sure why, but the colors just are not sharp enough on this image.  Perhaps a little more post processing is necessary to really make them stand out such as the lime green on the black baloon or the brightness of the orange?/red of the pumpkin? balloon in the middle.', '2006-10-06 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
