(2903044, 395788, 64175, '<td valign="top">Best Bee shot of the Bunch.  As far as a critique, the 1 and only thing I could find that could have bene improved is if there was any way to reduce some of that blurred object in the upper right corner. If it was located just a hint more to the right where the blue sky was behind the tail of the Bee, it would be a 10.  It''s still got a solid 9 in my book.</td>', 'Best Bee shot of the Bunch.  As far as a critique, the 1 and only thing I could find that could have bene improved is if there was any way to reduce some of that blurred object in the upper right corner. If it was located just a hint more to the right where the blue sky was behind the tail of the Bee, it would be a 10.  It''s still got a solid 9 in my book.', '2006-10-06 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903045, 394679, 64175, '<td valign="top">The heat vapors escaping from the side almost make it look as if this were some sort of balloon rising from beneath the water. I like it.</td>', 'The heat vapors escaping from the side almost make it look as if this were some sort of balloon rising from beneath the water. I like it.', '2006-10-06 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
