(2903069, 395499, 25678, '<td valign="top">Kudos on making a photo that invokes a sense of minimalism and surrelaism at the same time.  I half expect to see a Dali elephant walking in the backgtround.  I like the idea and concept of this.  Normally I''d say it needs a touch of sharpening, but for this picture, I wouldn''t change a thing</td>', 'Kudos on making a photo that invokes a sense of minimalism and surrelaism at the same time.  I half expect to see a Dali elephant walking in the backgtround.  I like the idea and concept of this.  Normally I''d say it needs a touch of sharpening, but for this picture, I wouldn''t change a thing', '2006-10-06 13:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
