(2903091, 396614, 42100, '<td valign="top">The small sizing makes it very difficult to see details, you really want to use the full 720 pixels this challenge allows(or at least the normal 640).  There also is some tilt to this, makes the boat look like it''s going downhill.  Little things, but they could make almost a full point difference in your score.</td>', 'The small sizing makes it very difficult to see details, you really want to use the full 720 pixels this challenge allows(or at least the normal 640).  There also is some tilt to this, makes the boat look like it''s going downhill.  Little things, but they could make almost a full point difference in your score.', '2006-10-06 13:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2903093, 394939, 42100, '<td valign="top">The close-up is a great choice for showing all the detail.  But much of the detail gets lost in the extreme differences between shaded and full sun areas.  Look for opportunities that are more favorable, like full shade or full sun.</td>', 'The close-up is a great choice for showing all the detail.  But much of the detail gets lost in the extreme differences between shaded and full sun areas.  Look for opportunities that are more favorable, like full shade or full sun.', '2006-10-06 13:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
