(2903095, 392893, 25678, '<td valign="top">Great DOF in this.  It''s a shame the left eye (the critter''s right) blends into the colourings.  Other than that, great capture</td>', 'Great DOF in this.  It''s a shame the left eye (the critter''s right) blends into the colourings.  Other than that, great capture', '2006-10-06 13:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
