(2903404, 399439, 62187, '<td valign="top">We had advanced editing - I think cloning the cable running from the roof of the little house out would have greatly improved your photo as well as darkening the sky. I love the colors of the buildings in the background as well as the motion of the person . Your crop and focus are nice too. Good luck to ya!</td>', 'We had advanced editing - I think cloning the cable running from the roof of the little house out would have greatly improved your photo as well as darkening the sky. I love the colors of the buildings in the background as well as the motion of the person . Your crop and focus are nice too. Good luck to ya!', '2006-10-06 15:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
