(2904533, 400436, 25355, '<td valign="top">I wonder where this is. It would be quite ironic if it was in Australia, as there we have something we know as Paterson''s Curse. It''s a weed introduced from Europe thatbis not good for livestock. (Also known as Salvation Jane).<br/> <br/>As for the photo, I''d like to see a wee bit more at the top. Good exposure of the flowing water.</td>', 'I wonder where this is. It would be quite ironic if it was in Australia, as there we have something we know as Paterson''s Curse. It''s a weed introduced from Europe thatbis not good for livestock. (Also known as Salvation Jane). As for the photo, I''d like to see a wee bit more at the top. Good exposure of the flowing water.', '2006-10-06 23:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904542, 403909, 25355, '<td valign="top">Grand Canyon is absolutely wonderful. However, there''s not much "pop" to this photo. I think maybe you thought, "I have a bit of pink light on the cliffs there, that will wow ''em". If there was a later shot with more light on the mesa, I''d like to see it - but there might have been too many clouds in front of the sun.</td>', 'Grand Canyon is absolutely wonderful. However, there''s not much "pop" to this photo. I think maybe you thought, "I have a bit of pink light on the cliffs there, that will wow ''em". If there was a later shot with more light on the mesa, I''d like to see it - but there might have been too many clouds in front of the sun.', '2006-10-06 23:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904550, 403220, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is kind of spooky, and sad. The tones are great.<br/>I can recognise most of the characters, but as it''s Chinese, I don''t know what they say all together. Perhaps it''s a gate to a cemetery...</td>', 'This is kind of spooky, and sad. The tones are great.I can recognise most of the characters, but as it''s Chinese, I don''t know what they say all together. Perhaps it''s a gate to a cemetery...', '2006-10-06 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
