(2904589, 399080, 40355, '<td valign="top">I remember one a lot like this in another challenge.  It is an amazing shot, I love the tonal range of the blues, in contrast with the yellow sky.  It is soft where it should be soft and sharp where it should be sharp, and overall just a great capture.  10</td>', 'I remember one a lot like this in another challenge.  It is an amazing shot, I love the tonal range of the blues, in contrast with the yellow sky.  It is soft where it should be soft and sharp where it should be sharp, and overall just a great capture.  10', '2006-10-06 23:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904593, 401578, 25355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful silhouette. But if the haloing effect is due to sharpening, then perhaps you''ve gone a bit far - I would imagine sillhouettes don''t need much sharpening as there''s no detail to bring out.</td>', 'Wonderful silhouette. But if the haloing effect is due to sharpening, then perhaps you''ve gone a bit far - I would imagine sillhouettes don''t need much sharpening as there''s no detail to bring out.', '2006-10-06 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2904594, 402316, 40355, '<td valign="top">I like the shift in colors, it adds something, and really goes well with the title.  Perfect composition for this, good angle, clean background.  And she''s a beauty herself!  10</td>', 'I like the shift in colors, it adds something, and really goes well with the title.  Perfect composition for this, good angle, clean background.  And she''s a beauty herself!  10', '2006-10-06 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
