(2905350, 403656, 63360, '<td valign="top">Lovely shallow DOF, and I like how the pinks in the flowers are repeated in the butterfly.  Wish that all the wings were in sharp focus.</td>', 'Lovely shallow DOF, and I like how the pinks in the flowers are repeated in the butterfly.  Wish that all the wings were in sharp focus.', '2006-10-07 10:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
