(2905534, 403886, 63360, '<td valign="top">This has a snapshot feel.  A better composition would be to only have the small child and the woman on the horse in the photo, maybe at a different angle.</td>', 'This has a snapshot feel.  A better composition would be to only have the small child and the woman on the horse in the photo, maybe at a different angle.', '2006-10-07 12:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905539, 402356, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop, and the soft texture of the fur here.  I might have cropped out the lower part up to the shoulders, because the eyes are really drawn to the face, anyway.</td>', 'I like the tight crop, and the soft texture of the fur here.  I might have cropped out the lower part up to the shoulders, because the eyes are really drawn to the face, anyway.', '2006-10-07 12:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
