(2905566, 401081, 63360, '<td valign="top">The desat works well here.  I love how the eyes are drawn skyward.  The buildings make a nice frame for the foreground, but the bus is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'The desat works well here.  I love how the eyes are drawn skyward.  The buildings make a nice frame for the foreground, but the bus is somewhat distracting.', '2006-10-07 12:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
