(2905669, 394766, 60698, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will be told a number of times that the image is too small and noisy. If you have photoshop there is an excellent tutorial here on how to prepare your photos for challenges.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Preparing photos for DP Challenge</a> <br/>Happy shooting! :)</td>', 'I am sure you will be told a number of times that the image is too small and noisy. If you have photoshop there is an excellent tutorial here on how to prepare your photos for challenges.Preparing photos for DP Challenge Happy shooting! :)', '2006-10-07 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
