(2905949, 404050, 19944, '<td valign="top">Somehow, I feel like this should have been rotated 90 degrees clockwise.  Other than that, the shot itself doesn''t really hold my interest.  To me, the shadows are kind of harsh, and the photo isn''t really sharp.  If there were water coming out of the mouth, maybe I would like it better.</td>', 'Somehow, I feel like this should have been rotated 90 degrees clockwise.  Other than that, the shot itself doesn''t really hold my interest.  To me, the shadows are kind of harsh, and the photo isn''t really sharp.  If there were water coming out of the mouth, maybe I would like it better.', '2006-10-07 15:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
