(2905984, 403581, 19944, '<td valign="top">Who taught that lady to use a ladder?  Should I call 911 now, or wait until she falls?<br/> <br/>Interesting capture, just someone going about their daily business.  I perhaps would have cropped the right side, righ up to the end of the rail.  But that''s just me.</td>', 'Who taught that lady to use a ladder?  Should I call 911 now, or wait until she falls? Interesting capture, just someone going about their daily business.  I perhaps would have cropped the right side, righ up to the end of the rail.  But that''s just me.', '2006-10-07 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
