(2906205, 403773, 5885, '<td valign="top">You are probably getting comments to the contrary, but I like the grain in this shot.</td>', 'You are probably getting comments to the contrary, but I like the grain in this shot.', '2006-10-07 18:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906207, 403878, 5885, '<td valign="top">To be honest, You did a great job with the B&amp;W conversion, but the pink diaper distracts from the image.<br/> <br/>Selective desat, should bring focus to your main subject. In the case the babies face. Now, I think I can give you aretistic license (maybe you are showing she''s a girl). So, I''m not gonna count off for me being distracted by a little thing :-)</td>', 'To be honest, You did a great job with the B&W conversion, but the pink diaper distracts from the image. Selective desat, should bring focus to your main subject. In the case the babies face. Now, I think I can give you aretistic license (maybe you are showing she''s a girl). So, I''m not gonna count off for me being distracted by a little thing :-)', '2006-10-07 18:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
