(2906239, 403603, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Most likely opportune, so little to be done about the vehicles in the background, although oof and fairly minor.  Your call (obviously), but perhaps cloning out the white/gray ''something'' bottom right of the saddle, but again, minor.  A few nit-picks here and there but really none that detract from an overall great (and fun) shot.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Most likely opportune, so little to be done about the vehicles in the background, although oof and fairly minor.  Your call (obviously), but perhaps cloning out the white/gray ''something'' bottom right of the saddle, but again, minor.  A few nit-picks here and there but really none that detract from an overall great (and fun) shot.', '2006-10-07 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
