(2906262, 397312, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Oh, very nice capture, including of the ''reversing'' - just the finer details in such a delicate image, in my opinion, need to be ''super clean'', to really make this excellent... I can see traces of sharpening/haloing around the beak, and possibly tail and just some minor grain here and there - but difficult, especially as this is likely a very close crop.  Even the gray background works well, as it does help ''showcase'' the natural colors in the hummingbird.</td>', '7 - Oh, very nice capture, including of the ''reversing'' - just the finer details in such a delicate image, in my opinion, need to be ''super clean'', to really make this excellent... I can see traces of sharpening/haloing around the beak, and possibly tail and just some minor grain here and there - but difficult, especially as this is likely a very close crop.  Even the gray background works well, as it does help ''showcase'' the natural colors in the hummingbird.', '2006-10-07 19:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906263, 399541, 50680, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-10-07 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906265, 403210, 50680, '<td valign="top">great technique really draws me into your composition</td>', 'great technique really draws me into your composition', '2006-10-07 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906266, 403015, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh... very nice.  ''If only'' the face/beak/eye were as sharp as the wing/etc.. but difficult - and at any rate, may well have made a ''different image'' - if that makes sense.  Depending what you had to work with, I do wonder about a variation in composition framing, but your call, obviously, and you likely had reason(s) for composing like this. <i>edit:typo &amp; wording</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 06:35:01.</i></td>', '8 - Oh... very nice.  ''If only'' the face/beak/eye were as sharp as the wing/etc.. but difficult - and at any rate, may well have made a ''different image'' - if that makes sense.  Depending what you had to work with, I do wonder about a variation in composition framing, but your call, obviously, and you likely had reason(s) for composing like this. edit:typo & wording', '2006-10-07 19:11:01.000000', '2006-10-08 07:35:01.000000', 1),
(2906267, 404051, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like your use of muted color tones as they compliment the silhouette nicely.  The fisheye lens does make the sky more interesting, but not sure if this actually improves the image overall.</td>', 'I like your use of muted color tones as they compliment the silhouette nicely.  The fisheye lens does make the sky more interesting, but not sure if this actually improves the image overall.', '2006-10-07 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906268, 402365, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice lighting, colors, composition and framing.  Just wish a <i>fraction</i> more contrast, or possibly saturation, not sure - but likely difficult with exposure issues.  May well be exactly as you intended anyway.  Perhaps a more refined crop at the bottom, or a softening to help the ''glow'' dominate more, not sure.</td>', '7 - Nice lighting, colors, composition and framing.  Just wish a fraction more contrast, or possibly saturation, not sure - but likely difficult with exposure issues.  May well be exactly as you intended anyway.  Perhaps a more refined crop at the bottom, or a softening to help the ''glow'' dominate more, not sure.', '2006-10-07 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906269, 403651, 50680, '<td valign="top">the lens flare in this shot distracts in my opinion. great location</td>', 'the lens flare in this shot distracts in my opinion. great location', '2006-10-07 19:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906271, 403721, 42125, '<td valign="top">Magnús wrapping it up again!</td>', 'Magnús wrapping it up again!', '2006-10-07 19:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906273, 398652, 63360, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed.  The greens may be a bit oversaturated, but I like the overall effect you have created with post-processing.</td>', 'Beautifully composed.  The greens may be a bit oversaturated, but I like the overall effect you have created with post-processing.', '2006-10-07 19:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906275, 397312, 63360, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture!  The muted colors in the background work so well here.</td>', 'Lovely capture!  The muted colors in the background work so well here.', '2006-10-07 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906276, 401844, 52074, '<td valign="top">awwwwwwww...great capture of "THAT" moment. Priceless~</td>', 'awwwwwwww...great capture of "THAT" moment. Priceless~', '2006-10-07 19:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906277, 401485, 50680, '<td valign="top">great composition just way too much noise</td>', 'great composition just way too much noise', '2006-10-07 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906278, 403731, 42125, '<td valign="top">Mun eðlilegri litir hér þótt hin sé líka allt í lagi.</td>', 'Mun eðlilegri litir hér þótt hin sé líka allt í lagi.', '2006-10-07 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906281, 402990, 42125, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is not enough, i.e. swans head out of focus and the water in good focus.</td>', 'Depth of field is not enough, i.e. swans head out of focus and the water in good focus.', '2006-10-07 19:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906286, 397423, 63360, '<td valign="top">Such a pretty little girl with a great smile!  I would crop out the lower portion of the picture as all that turquoise color is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Such a pretty little girl with a great smile!  I would crop out the lower portion of the picture as all that turquoise color is a bit distracting.', '2006-10-07 19:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906288, 402673, 42125, '<td valign="top">Yes it is! Great colourful sky!</td>', 'Yes it is! Great colourful sky!', '2006-10-07 19:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906289, 396783, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the close-up, but the image needs to be sharper.</td>', 'I like the close-up, but the image needs to be sharper.', '2006-10-07 19:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906291, 403236, 42125, '<td valign="top">Now this is very special! Natural light effects.<br/>IMO cropping a bit from the top makes it better.</td>', 'Now this is very special! Natural light effects.IMO cropping a bit from the top makes it better.', '2006-10-07 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906294, 396604, 63360, '<td valign="top">A beautiful vista.  There does not seem to be enough contrast in the mountains due to the haze, which I find somewhat distracting.</td>', 'A beautiful vista.  There does not seem to be enough contrast in the mountains due to the haze, which I find somewhat distracting.', '2006-10-07 19:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906295, 390253, 42125, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!</td>', 'Hilarious!', '2006-10-07 19:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906300, 403618, 42125, '<td valign="top">Title could also be: Do I know you from somewhere? :-)<br/>Great capture!</td>', 'Title could also be: Do I know you from somewhere? :-)Great capture!', '2006-10-07 19:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906302, 398073, 18505, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture!!</td>', 'Amazing capture!!', '2006-10-07 19:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906303, 403711, 18505, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of growing up in Missouri - nice capture!</td>', 'Reminds me of growing up in Missouri - nice capture!', '2006-10-07 19:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906304, 396783, 42125, '<td valign="top">IMO this picture would be alot better with a bit level adjustment.</td>', 'IMO this picture would be alot better with a bit level adjustment.', '2006-10-07 19:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906307, 403663, 63360, '<td valign="top">A slight change of angle where you would see more of a line of fence posts would create more visual interest, IMO.  This also needs to be brightened up a bit as well; not enough contrast.</td>', 'A slight change of angle where you would see more of a line of fence posts would create more visual interest, IMO.  This also needs to be brightened up a bit as well; not enough contrast.', '2006-10-07 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906308, 395788, 18505, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture.  I''d like to hear how you did this.</td>', 'Incredible capture.  I''d like to hear how you did this.', '2006-10-07 19:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906309, 399805, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus, may be a bit too much NI used.</td>', 'I like the soft focus, may be a bit too much NI used.', '2006-10-07 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906310, 392821, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.  Like the colors, including the ''blue shoreline''.  The light/rays captured are nice.  Main issues in my opinion are what appears to be elements of resizing/jpeg issues (but apologies in advance if wrong - could just be the unusual water surface), the white ''something'' bottom right, cloned/cropped out make this even better in my opinion.  The only other issue (and it could just be a visual/perspective thing) is that this looks like it <i>may</i> need a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, but again - apologies in advance if wrong.</td>', '7 - Nice image.  Like the colors, including the ''blue shoreline''.  The light/rays captured are nice.  Main issues in my opinion are what appears to be elements of resizing/jpeg issues (but apologies in advance if wrong - could just be the unusual water surface), the white ''something'' bottom right, cloned/cropped out make this even better in my opinion.  The only other issue (and it could just be a visual/perspective thing) is that this looks like it may need a fraction nudge rotate up on the left, but again - apologies in advance if wrong.', '2006-10-07 19:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906311, 397114, 42125, '<td valign="top">IMO to much of empty space on top. Cropping it would give use of rule of thirds!</td>', 'IMO to much of empty space on top. Cropping it would give use of rule of thirds!', '2006-10-07 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906312, 398818, 36619, '<td valign="top">that''s a familiar site, great composition</td>', 'that''s a familiar site, great composition', '2006-10-07 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906313, 399439, 36619, '<td valign="top">that''s a really cool photo!</td>', 'that''s a really cool photo!', '2006-10-07 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906314, 395839, 42125, '<td valign="top">No legs?</td>', 'No legs?', '2006-10-07 19:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906315, 403110, 63360, '<td valign="top">Is this really snow?  I like the framework created by the trees, but I think that the two individuals detract from the overall effect.</td>', 'Is this really snow?  I like the framework created by the trees, but I think that the two individuals detract from the overall effect.', '2006-10-07 19:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906316, 398052, 36619, '<td valign="top">love the clarity&amp; feel of this, great image!</td>', 'love the clarity& feel of this, great image!', '2006-10-07 19:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906317, 403581, 36619, '<td valign="top">very captivating</td>', 'very captivating', '2006-10-07 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906318, 394633, 63360, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I like the desat, and the background really compliments the subject.</td>', 'Great capture.  I like the desat, and the background really compliments the subject.', '2006-10-07 19:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906320, 404072, 42125, '<td valign="top">Rosalega er þetta eitthvað íslenskt!</td>', 'Rosalega er þetta eitthvað íslenskt!', '2006-10-07 19:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906321, 401485, 63360, '<td valign="top">The graininess works very well to create a nostalgic moment; reminds me of the old super-8 movies my parents have of my childhood.  I would crop out a bit more of the foreground.  Nice work!</td>', 'The graininess works very well to create a nostalgic moment; reminds me of the old super-8 movies my parents have of my childhood.  I would crop out a bit more of the foreground.  Nice work!', '2006-10-07 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906324, 398187, 18505, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea and composition of this image.  The red posts impart an amazing visual element.  I love the man''s expression.  It looks, however, like something went wrong with the post-processing of the man''s hair.</td>', 'I really like the idea and composition of this image.  The red posts impart an amazing visual element.  I love the man''s expression.  It looks, however, like something went wrong with the post-processing of the man''s hair.', '2006-10-07 19:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906325, 404005, 63360, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene.  I think it needs to be a bit sharper and maybe play with the shadows/highlights a bit to create more of a focal point which will help draw the eyes in.</td>', 'A lovely scene.  I think it needs to be a bit sharper and maybe play with the shadows/highlights a bit to create more of a focal point which will help draw the eyes in.', '2006-10-07 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906328, 404091, 63360, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what you are focused on (sunflower head?)  I do like the bright yellows contrasting with the black background.  Possibly a different angle on this same theme.</td>', 'Not quite sure what you are focused on (sunflower head?)  I do like the bright yellows contrasting with the black background.  Possibly a different angle on this same theme.', '2006-10-07 19:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906330, 403679, 63360, '<td valign="top">Great title; beautiful girl.  This is composed so well!  I like how the light and focus are more on her than the bike (as it should be)!</td>', 'Great title; beautiful girl.  This is composed so well!  I like how the light and focus are more on her than the bike (as it should be)!', '2006-10-07 19:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906332, 403940, 42125, '<td valign="top">IMO to much burning.<br/>Íslenskt?</td>', 'IMO to much burning.Íslenskt?', '2006-10-07 19:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906333, 403075, 42125, '<td valign="top">The frame fits the subject well!</td>', 'The frame fits the subject well!', '2006-10-07 19:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906334, 403465, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like your composition:  a beautiful woman, her best friend (?), and a comfortable spot to relax and enjoy the day.  Good work!</td>', 'I like your composition:  a beautiful woman, her best friend (?), and a comfortable spot to relax and enjoy the day.  Good work!', '2006-10-07 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906335, 396673, 18505, '<td valign="top">Compelling image.  I think it would have even more impact if it was cropped more tightly at the top to just a bit above the police officer''s hat.  Your desaturation is good, but the tighter crop would really force the viewer to focus on the wonderful interaction you have captured.  Good work!!</td>', 'Compelling image.  I think it would have even more impact if it was cropped more tightly at the top to just a bit above the police officer''s hat.  Your desaturation is good, but the tighter crop would really force the viewer to focus on the wonderful interaction you have captured.  Good work!!', '2006-10-07 19:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906337, 404060, 63360, '<td valign="top">THe soft greens in the background and purple of the thistle contrast nicely.  I think that the butterfly should be a bit sharper in focus.</td>', 'THe soft greens in the background and purple of the thistle contrast nicely.  I think that the butterfly should be a bit sharper in focus.', '2006-10-07 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906341, 398283, 63360, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky with all those stars.  I would like to see more of the horizon on the right, as the pink colors of the sunset must have been spectacular.  The rock formation might be better off-center to the left, IMO.</td>', 'What a beautiful sky with all those stars.  I would like to see more of the horizon on the right, as the pink colors of the sunset must have been spectacular.  The rock formation might be better off-center to the left, IMO.', '2006-10-07 20:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906343, 399183, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have cropped the baskets.  Nice contrasting colors, could be sharpened a bit more.</td>', 'I like the way you have cropped the baskets.  Nice contrasting colors, could be sharpened a bit more.', '2006-10-07 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906344, 403834, 42125, '<td valign="top">Og hér er ein íslensk sem er ekki á Ljósmyndakeppni.is!<br/>Flott mynd. Skemmtilega tekin og góðir litir í henni.</td>', 'Og hér er ein íslensk sem er ekki á Ljósmyndakeppni.is!Flott mynd. Skemmtilega tekin og góðir litir í henni.', '2006-10-07 20:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906345, 404020, 6999, '<td valign="top">A nice natural portrait, good detail, light etc.; I''d have done something about the sheer brightness of the background - the yellow moments in the trees are really very bright, and could easily have been calmed down a touch to stay as just background.</td>', 'A nice natural portrait, good detail, light etc.; I''d have done something about the sheer brightness of the background - the yellow moments in the trees are really very bright, and could easily have been calmed down a touch to stay as just background.', '2006-10-07 20:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906346, 403502, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this; I suspect (hope I''m wrong) you''ll get a bunch of comments about lack of contrast, but it''s just fine as is - has a strong sense of that developing grey of early autumn. Good exposure.</td>', 'I like this; I suspect (hope I''m wrong) you''ll get a bunch of comments about lack of contrast, but it''s just fine as is - has a strong sense of that developing grey of early autumn. Good exposure.', '2006-10-07 20:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906347, 396434, 42125, '<td valign="top">D - :-)<br/>Good idea and well executed.</td>', 'D - :-)Good idea and well executed.', '2006-10-07 20:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906348, 404050, 42125, '<td valign="top">Seems that you have failed to rotate the picture.</td>', 'Seems that you have failed to rotate the picture.', '2006-10-07 20:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906351, 400819, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool shot!', '2006-10-07 20:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906352, 395499, 42125, '<td valign="top">Still on the Far Side :-)<br/>Great portraiture of an (in)sane woman.</td>', 'Still on the Far Side :-)Great portraiture of an (in)sane woman.', '2006-10-07 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
