(2906551, 396120, 55838, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  Beautiful colors &amp; light.  Back to bump to 8.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  Beautiful colors & light.  Back to bump to 8.', '2006-10-07 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906552, 403581, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and I like the composition - interesting &amp; different.  Very crisp too.  My goodness though, I hope she didn''t fall - the way she set the ladder on the box is definitely breaking the rules!  A couple of nits..I might have cropped an inch off the right and also made the lines of the stairs perfectly horizontal.  You seem to have the talent of making a simple everyday thing into an interesting pic.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Lovely colors and I like the composition - interesting & different.  Very crisp too.  My goodness though, I hope she didn''t fall - the way she set the ladder on the box is definitely breaking the rules!  A couple of nits..I might have cropped an inch off the right and also made the lines of the stairs perfectly horizontal.  You seem to have the talent of making a simple everyday thing into an interesting pic.  Nicely done!', '2006-10-07 22:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906556, 402081, 55838, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the perspective but overall a very nice shot - something a little different.  I like the B&amp;W with the splash of red.  7</td>', 'Not sure I like the perspective but overall a very nice shot - something a little different.  I like the B&W with the splash of red.  7', '2006-10-07 22:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906557, 398508, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  Great smiles and I like their positions.  Did they stop wrestling just long enough to look up at the camera?!! :)  Good choice to go with B&amp;W here.  Decent lighting and the white back works well.  Ahhh brothers...nicely done. 7</td>', 'Very sweet.  Great smiles and I like their positions.  Did they stop wrestling just long enough to look up at the camera?!! :)  Good choice to go with B&W here.  Decent lighting and the white back works well.  Ahhh brothers...nicely done. 7', '2006-10-07 22:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906559, 403801, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute and I like the B&amp;W here.  A sweet flirty composition.  One suggestion would be to even up the horizon to make the building lines (and other lines) in the pic parallel with the crop.  Good eye to catch a fun shot. 7</td>', 'Very cute and I like the B&W here.  A sweet flirty composition.  One suggestion would be to even up the horizon to make the building lines (and other lines) in the pic parallel with the crop.  Good eye to catch a fun shot. 7', '2006-10-07 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906560, 396614, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - This looks snapshottish.  Your title suggests an image of a ''harbour'', yet the main thing I see is a ship/liner.  There are grain issues, as well as seemingly blur issues, it is overall too dark and the ''elements'' on the left and right bottom corner are distracting as I cannot recognize them.  Also (but quality dependent) this much bigger would have been better... maybe.  If this was all you had to work with, your best or favorite shot for the month for the Free Study, perhaps trying to adjust the levels/lighting/something in pp may have helped this, or even a conversion to sepia or b&amp;w, who knows.  This image may hold some meaning to you (from a vacation etc), however to a viewer - they would not hold the same attachment - if that makes sense, and is indeed appropriate.</td>', '1 - This looks snapshottish.  Your title suggests an image of a ''harbour'', yet the main thing I see is a ship/liner.  There are grain issues, as well as seemingly blur issues, it is overall too dark and the ''elements'' on the left and right bottom corner are distracting as I cannot recognize them.  Also (but quality dependent) this much bigger would have been better... maybe.  If this was all you had to work with, your best or favorite shot for the month for the Free Study, perhaps trying to adjust the levels/lighting/something in pp may have helped this, or even a conversion to sepia or b&w, who knows.  This image may hold some meaning to you (from a vacation etc), however to a viewer - they would not hold the same attachment - if that makes sense, and is indeed appropriate.', '2006-10-07 22:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906563, 390831, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to bump you to 8.  Very well done.  Great color &amp; focus (not to mention the title!).</td>', 'Back to bump you to 8.  Very well done.  Great color & focus (not to mention the title!).', '2006-10-07 22:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906564, 403653, 60914, '<td valign="top">His eyes really lack emotion with this post processing</td>', 'His eyes really lack emotion with this post processing', '2006-10-07 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
