(2906566, 403908, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute - typical little boy moment.  I like the crop and the quiet color tones - and the black back works very well.  His skin is a wee bit washed out on his chest but my eye goes to his face anyway. 7</td>', 'Very cute - typical little boy moment.  I like the crop and the quiet color tones - and the black back works very well.  His skin is a wee bit washed out on his chest but my eye goes to his face anyway. 7', '2006-10-07 22:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906567, 403685, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, light, and composition.  Very pretty.  It would be a wee bit nicer if more of the vine was on this side of the fence maybe. 7</td>', 'Lovely colors, light, and composition.  Very pretty.  It would be a wee bit nicer if more of the vine was on this side of the fence maybe. 7', '2006-10-07 22:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906568, 397855, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...great stuff.  I love this creative idea - it''s so fun.  Great choice to go with B&amp;W.  Nice crop - some of the background is less than beautiful but I''m not complaining. 7</td>', 'Ahhh...great stuff.  I love this creative idea - it''s so fun.  Great choice to go with B&W.  Nice crop - some of the background is less than beautiful but I''m not complaining. 7', '2006-10-07 22:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906570, 401257, 55838, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and coloring here and it''s nice to see different subject matter (even though I went with the boring "usual" myself! :)  A couple of nits - I might have cropped a little off the left and the right (Crop Right to get rid of the distracting gold chair and Crop Left nearly up to the left edge of the doorway) and I might have desaturated the blue shirt on the guy standing in the hallway on the left - also a littl distracting.  Overall nicely done.  A glimpse into the life of the three individuals in green. 7</td>', 'Nice composition and coloring here and it''s nice to see different subject matter (even though I went with the boring "usual" myself! :)  A couple of nits - I might have cropped a little off the left and the right (Crop Right to get rid of the distracting gold chair and Crop Left nearly up to the left edge of the doorway) and I might have desaturated the blue shirt on the guy standing in the hallway on the left - also a littl distracting.  Overall nicely done.  A glimpse into the life of the three individuals in green. 7', '2006-10-07 22:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906572, 404089, 64176, '<td valign="top">Holy Schitt, he''s cute!</td>', 'Holy Schitt, he''s cute!', '2006-10-07 22:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906573, 395773, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice image.  Good play on the title, which for those who didn''t take time to study it longer than 2 seconds, would likely be lost on.  A more refined crop, especially top right corner, make this even better in my opinion.  Like the colors and clarity - good stop motion and ''texture''.  Perhaps a few sprouts closer to the surface for added effect and element(s), who knows.</td>', '8 - Nice image.  Good play on the title, which for those who didn''t take time to study it longer than 2 seconds, would likely be lost on.  A more refined crop, especially top right corner, make this even better in my opinion.  Like the colors and clarity - good stop motion and ''texture''.  Perhaps a few sprouts closer to the surface for added effect and element(s), who knows.', '2006-10-07 22:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906574, 402344, 60914, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see some detail/color in the stained glass</td>', 'Would have loved to see some detail/color in the stained glass', '2006-10-07 22:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906575, 397423, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Sweet model.  The tight crop works well - in fact I wonder what it would look like if it was tighter still - maybe crop off the bottom two (or more) inches of the shot because the sweater is a bit hot so it distracts a little from the very well captured face.  Again - great model beautifully captured - well done.  7</td>', 'Very cute.  Sweet model.  The tight crop works well - in fact I wonder what it would look like if it was tighter still - maybe crop off the bottom two (or more) inches of the shot because the sweater is a bit hot so it distracts a little from the very well captured face.  Again - great model beautifully captured - well done.  7', '2006-10-07 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
