(2906634, 404019, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice detail.  Maybe a more refined crop, especially at the bottom and a slight variation in composition (maybe not so centered, not sure - depends what you had to work with, obviously) may have made this even better in my opinion, although does still work well as is.  Framing color choice works, but wonder if another color rather than the green may have lifted this more and given it a little extra.</td>', '7 - Nice detail.  Maybe a more refined crop, especially at the bottom and a slight variation in composition (maybe not so centered, not sure - depends what you had to work with, obviously) may have made this even better in my opinion, although does still work well as is.  Framing color choice works, but wonder if another color rather than the green may have lifted this more and given it a little extra.', '2006-10-07 22:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906647, 403915, 60914, '<td valign="top">Love the kid, great expression, the train doesn''t serve a purpose to me</td>', 'Love the kid, great expression, the train doesn''t serve a purpose to me', '2006-10-07 22:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906669, 398679, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Especially like the originality and simplicity.  Colors are nice.  Like the composition, however wonder if a fraction more centered, or else off-centered, plus a slight tweaking of colors may have given this even more impact.</td>', '8 - Especially like the originality and simplicity.  Colors are nice.  Like the composition, however wonder if a fraction more centered, or else off-centered, plus a slight tweaking of colors may have given this even more impact.', '2006-10-07 22:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906670, 404067, 12253, '<td valign="top">Love to know when and where this was taken--I am thinking of heading into the adirondacks tomorrow.  I didn''t see much color though yet on webcams in the lake george region.  But this shows some nice color--and it''s got to be at least a week old.  The lake looks great and serene.  Two technical issues: you need a GND filter for this shot to better equalize the sky light so it''s manageable.  That really hurts an otherwise fine shot.  Also, and it may be an illusion, but I get the feeling this is pitched to the left a bit.</td>', 'Love to know when and where this was taken--I am thinking of heading into the adirondacks tomorrow.  I didn''t see much color though yet on webcams in the lake george region.  But this shows some nice color--and it''s got to be at least a week old.  The lake looks great and serene.  Two technical issues: you need a GND filter for this shot to better equalize the sky light so it''s manageable.  That really hurts an otherwise fine shot.  Also, and it may be an illusion, but I get the feeling this is pitched to the left a bit.', '2006-10-07 22:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906674, 396379, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot.  Nice and clean.  Good panning(?) and stop motion.  Like the composition but wonder whether a fraction more space/green at the top may have balanced this out a little more, but depends what you had to work with, obviously.</td>', '8 - Good shot.  Nice and clean.  Good panning(?) and stop motion.  Like the composition but wonder whether a fraction more space/green at the top may have balanced this out a little more, but depends what you had to work with, obviously.', '2006-10-07 22:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906677, 392623, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I think it might be nice to have been back a bit (or cropped a bit less).  Also, to avoid some of the brighter backgroun (white) highlights.  But I know how hard these shots are, and this is generally terrific!</td>', 'Excellent!  I think it might be nice to have been back a bit (or cropped a bit less).  Also, to avoid some of the brighter backgroun (white) highlights.  But I know how hard these shots are, and this is generally terrific!', '2006-10-07 22:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906684, 394152, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice scene/potential.  Wish the horizon was straight.  Perhaps (if possible) a slight variation in perspective/angle, to enable the island in the distance to not be obstructed by the globe.  Compositionally (again, depending what is there to the left), perhaps placing the globe on the right side of the frame, using the ''path'' as a leading line, may have also given this a little extra, who knows.  Colors are nice.  Nice and clean.  Like the single cloud in the sky. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 06:10:00.</i></td>', '5 - Nice scene/potential.  Wish the horizon was straight.  Perhaps (if possible) a slight variation in perspective/angle, to enable the island in the distance to not be obstructed by the globe.  Compositionally (again, depending what is there to the left), perhaps placing the globe on the right side of the frame, using the ''path'' as a leading line, may have also given this a little extra, who knows.  Colors are nice.  Nice and clean.  Like the single cloud in the sky. edit:typo', '2006-10-07 22:53:34.000000', '2006-10-08 07:10:00.000000', 1),
(2906709, 394766, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Too small and pixelation/resizing issues (perhaps), to discern if this is clouds.. perhaps taken from a plane, who knows.  Straightening and a crop to eliminate that ''something'' bottom right, also make this better in my opinion.</td>', '1 - Too small and pixelation/resizing issues (perhaps), to discern if this is clouds.. perhaps taken from a plane, who knows.  Straightening and a crop to eliminate that ''something'' bottom right, also make this better in my opinion.', '2006-10-07 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906714, 401607, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice sunset capture, colors, composition, silhouettes, elements and reflection.  Wonder about a little less at the top, only because the sky and clouds up there do not seem to be quite as dramatic as further down the frame, but minor.  Like the ducks(?) on the left, be good if there was another ''element'' on the right balancing that out - if that makes sense, but fairly minor.</td>', '7 - Nice sunset capture, colors, composition, silhouettes, elements and reflection.  Wonder about a little less at the top, only because the sky and clouds up there do not seem to be quite as dramatic as further down the frame, but minor.  Like the ducks(?) on the left, be good if there was another ''element'' on the right balancing that out - if that makes sense, but fairly minor.', '2006-10-07 23:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906719, 403643, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition, the foreground comes around and balances everything so nicely.  Pretty good b&amp;w tones as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Great composition, the foreground comes around and balances everything so nicely.  Pretty good b&w tones as well.  Well done!', '2006-10-07 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906724, 401081, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Not sure if it was possible, but ''if only'' the lines on the street/road were symmetrical too may have made this even better, although not sure on that- could just be a ''different'' image.  Toning works well.  Good character and elements here, including the sky/clouds.</td>', '8 - Good.  Not sure if it was possible, but ''if only'' the lines on the street/road were symmetrical too may have made this even better, although not sure on that- could just be a ''different'' image.  Toning works well.  Good character and elements here, including the sky/clouds.', '2006-10-07 23:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906726, 402707, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice shot.  Undecided on the white ''reflection''(?)/something under the windmill, but does add something so who knows.  Colors are very nice, good sky capture, although I wonder about a slightly tighter crop at the top to eliminate that one darker cloud left of middle, but minor.  Nice and clean and good symmetry.</td>', '8 - Nice shot.  Undecided on the white ''reflection''(?)/something under the windmill, but does add something so who knows.  Colors are very nice, good sky capture, although I wonder about a slightly tighter crop at the top to eliminate that one darker cloud left of middle, but minor.  Nice and clean and good symmetry.', '2006-10-07 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906733, 403165, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good capture.  Wonder about a variation in composition (or a frame?) though - just to give it something extra, but not sure what to suggest.</td>', '8 - Good capture.  Wonder about a variation in composition (or a frame?) though - just to give it something extra, but not sure what to suggest.', '2006-10-07 23:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906735, 397694, 33515, '<td valign="top">Even though the little girl in the doorway adds a lot of interest the exact side view of the musicians is bothersome. Even if the picture was taken a few more degrees head on this would have been much better. I love her expression as well as the little boy. 6</td>', 'Even though the little girl in the doorway adds a lot of interest the exact side view of the musicians is bothersome. Even if the picture was taken a few more degrees head on this would have been much better. I love her expression as well as the little boy. 6', '2006-10-07 23:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
