(2906788, 404020, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great colors. The detail and position of the coyote are excellent. For some reason the bokeh or texture in the background is a bit distracting, but an excellent shot overall. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great colors. The detail and position of the coyote are excellent. For some reason the bokeh or texture in the background is a bit distracting, but an excellent shot overall. 8', '2006-10-07 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
