(2906799, 403244, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best portrait shot inthe challenge. Great detail and interesting looking model enhanced by the flow of water on the glass. Very nice. Bumping up.</td>', 'I think this is the best portrait shot inthe challenge. Great detail and interesting looking model enhanced by the flow of water on the glass. Very nice. Bumping up.', '2006-10-07 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906800, 403653, 33515, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking the processing has really removed any resemblance to a photo. I''m sure this would have scored better as a high contrast B&amp;W than how it is presented.</td>', 'I''m thinking the processing has really removed any resemblance to a photo. I''m sure this would have scored better as a high contrast B&W than how it is presented.', '2006-10-07 23:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906802, 403110, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Excellent colors and detail. I would be interested in seeing the original as I feel the editing on this one is brilliant. My only peeves are the pink tassles and the red vests. Removed or changed those a bit and you could think it was from a bygone era. Very nice work overall. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot. Excellent colors and detail. I would be interested in seeing the original as I feel the editing on this one is brilliant. My only peeves are the pink tassles and the red vests. Removed or changed those a bit and you could think it was from a bygone era. Very nice work overall. Bumping up.', '2006-10-07 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906803, 403678, 26464, '<td valign="top">really nice, just wish it wasn''t so ''pink'' <br/>.. i would have maybe desaturated the reds</td>', 'really nice, just wish it wasn''t so ''pink'' .. i would have maybe desaturated the reds', '2006-10-07 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906812, 402365, 33515, '<td valign="top">I really love pictures of aspens, and this time of the year they are beautiful. This photo seems to lack an overall saturation of color to pull out the brilliant yellows and the white of the trunk. Very nice in keeping the blue of the sky and picking up detail on the forest floor.</td>', 'I really love pictures of aspens, and this time of the year they are beautiful. This photo seems to lack an overall saturation of color to pull out the brilliant yellows and the white of the trunk. Very nice in keeping the blue of the sky and picking up detail on the forest floor.', '2006-10-07 23:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906814, 402564, 48546, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Larus shot. Good job. - 10</td>', 'Looks like a Larus shot. Good job. - 10', '2006-10-08 00:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906819, 404073, 61863, '<td valign="top">Great photo, colours and pose. Perhaps a tiny bit dark on the left hand eye but of course all forgotten because of the model being "not unattractive......</td>', 'Great photo, colours and pose. Perhaps a tiny bit dark on the left hand eye but of course all forgotten because of the model being "not unattractive......', '2006-10-08 00:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906821, 395499, 33515, '<td valign="top">Has a nice 50''s feel about it and I''m guessing this is the Salt Flats. If you could have included the Utah tree in the back ground this would have had a very surreal feel. Some how I''m feeling the woman is to centered but this is a very nice photo.</td>', 'Has a nice 50''s feel about it and I''m guessing this is the Salt Flats. If you could have included the Utah tree in the back ground this would have had a very surreal feel. Some how I''m feeling the woman is to centered but this is a very nice photo.', '2006-10-08 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906822, 396221, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice portrait.  Toning works well.  Main detractor in my opinion are the knees dominate the image too much, perhaps the pose a little more side on, who knows.  Also, a fraction nudge rotate up on the right (if you were able) just to get the boardwalk/decking straightened, or at least the line cropped out - if that makes sense.  Toning works well.</td>', '7 - Nice portrait.  Toning works well.  Main detractor in my opinion are the knees dominate the image too much, perhaps the pose a little more side on, who knows.  Also, a fraction nudge rotate up on the right (if you were able) just to get the boardwalk/decking straightened, or at least the line cropped out - if that makes sense.  Toning works well.', '2006-10-08 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906823, 403938, 61863, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Humour, Colour, camels and orthodontics - one could not wish for more!</td>', 'Great shot, Humour, Colour, camels and orthodontics - one could not wish for more!', '2006-10-08 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
