(2906841, 402823, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Up from 8.  Really like this.  Like the little toadstool/mushroom elements too.  The pose/expression is very good.  Colors also very nice.  Just wish it were 720.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop at the bottom, but minor.</td>', '9 - Up from 8.  Really like this.  Like the little toadstool/mushroom elements too.  The pose/expression is very good.  Colors also very nice.  Just wish it were 720.  Perhaps a more finely tuned crop at the bottom, but minor.', '2006-10-08 00:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
