(2906845, 399839, 48546, '<td valign="top">Looks HDR-ish. Tone mapped or something. Highly saturated tans and browns. Debating whether I like it or not. 6 for now.</td>', 'Looks HDR-ish. Tone mapped or something. Highly saturated tans and browns. Debating whether I like it or not. 6 for now.', '2006-10-08 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906846, 403626, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice colors and scene and composition.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but (and especially with the reflection) this just seems like it needs a very slight rotate up on the left... but could just be a visual/perspective thing.  Looks quite processed (apologies again if wrong), however I think it suits this image and gives it the drama that makes it.</td>', '8 - Nice colors and scene and composition.  Apologies in advance if wrong, but (and especially with the reflection) this just seems like it needs a very slight rotate up on the left... but could just be a visual/perspective thing.  Looks quite processed (apologies again if wrong), however I think it suits this image and gives it the drama that makes it.', '2006-10-08 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906847, 391073, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like the composition and the elements in this, especially the mushrooms/toadstools/fungii.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better, not sure.  Would also liked to have seen a little more detail and definition in the mantis, including texture.  Like to see more of that ''mushroom'' too, but that is likely ''another image''. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:31:29.</i></td>', '8 - Like the composition and the elements in this, especially the mushrooms/toadstools/fungii.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop, especially at the top, may have made this even better, not sure.  Would also liked to have seen a little more detail and definition in the mantis, including texture.  Like to see more of that ''mushroom'' too, but that is likely ''another image''. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:15:14.000000', '2006-10-08 17:31:29.000000', 1),
(2906849, 400847, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Really like the perspective in this, including the angle across the water and the showing of the ''steam''.  Like the elements in the water, just wish they were more defined.  Overall very clean and nice colors - but wonder about them ''boosted'' just a fraction, whether that may have given this a little extra.  Could just be another case of ''this size doesn''t do this justice''. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:31:53.</i></td>', '8 - Really like the perspective in this, including the angle across the water and the showing of the ''steam''.  Like the elements in the water, just wish they were more defined.  Overall very clean and nice colors - but wonder about them ''boosted'' just a fraction, whether that may have given this a little extra.  Could just be another case of ''this size doesn''t do this justice''. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:15:33.000000', '2006-10-08 17:31:53.000000', 1),
(2906850, 403796, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Up from 8 - Really liked this image and scene, especially the varying levels of dof/focus used and how they were used to emphasize the elements in the image you wanted.  Nice composition and colors.  The only thing for me was the background - where the ground seems to go to another level and there are some oof objects/etc there - if the image were able to be cropped and that removed (yet still retain the proportions, etc) likely have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe bottom left corner too, but difficult.  Lighting is very nice. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:31:38.</i></td>', '9 - Up from 8 - Really liked this image and scene, especially the varying levels of dof/focus used and how they were used to emphasize the elements in the image you wanted.  Nice composition and colors.  The only thing for me was the background - where the ground seems to go to another level and there are some oof objects/etc there - if the image were able to be cropped and that removed (yet still retain the proportions, etc) likely have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe bottom left corner too, but difficult.  Lighting is very nice. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:16:06.000000', '2006-10-08 17:31:38.000000', 1),
(2906852, 396434, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent photo, sure it is treasured.  Each and every one seems so naturally happy and at ease.  Was just the top section (including lighting), the hand and the wristband on the right, that were the only things holding this back in my opinion, but I''m sure you''re likely well aware of it all and yes, it does <i>not</i> have to be ''perfect'' to still be an excellent photograph. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:32:34.</i></td>', '8 - Excellent photo, sure it is treasured.  Each and every one seems so naturally happy and at ease.  Was just the top section (including lighting), the hand and the wristband on the right, that were the only things holding this back in my opinion, but I''m sure you''re likely well aware of it all and yes, it does not have to be ''perfect'' to still be an excellent photograph. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:16:44.000000', '2006-10-08 17:32:34.000000', 1),
(2906853, 404013, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice scene and colors.  Composition very good.  Liked the dof.  Undecided on a little softer overall, or else just ''sharper'', more definition in all - both would work well I imagine.  Could just be a visual thing, but also this looks like a fraction nudge up on the right, might have given it a greater perspective, but not sure.  Minor, but a more refined crop (or clone) of the very bottom right as well, perhaps. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:32:47.</i></td>', '8 - Nice scene and colors.  Composition very good.  Liked the dof.  Undecided on a little softer overall, or else just ''sharper'', more definition in all - both would work well I imagine.  Could just be a visual thing, but also this looks like a fraction nudge up on the right, might have given it a greater perspective, but not sure.  Minor, but a more refined crop (or clone) of the very bottom right as well, perhaps. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:16:49.000000', '2006-10-08 17:32:47.000000', 1),
(2906855, 403268, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Mainly the distant light and rays and <i>on</i> the island/headland(?) that I liked about this, that coupled with the fact that I am sure that this size does not do this justice and would look excellent wall sized.  The foreground does detract somewhat in my opinion, onlybecause I cannot discern the detail nor color enough, so perhaps a fraction less of it, else (if possible) a little more color brought in, who knows.  Possibly a little less of the sky/top too, but only because I''d like to see the ''main attraction'' dominate even more. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:32:51.</i></td>', '8 - Mainly the distant light and rays and on the island/headland(?) that I liked about this, that coupled with the fact that I am sure that this size does not do this justice and would look excellent wall sized.  The foreground does detract somewhat in my opinion, onlybecause I cannot discern the detail nor color enough, so perhaps a fraction less of it, else (if possible) a little more color brought in, who knows.  Possibly a little less of the sky/top too, but only because I''d like to see the ''main attraction'' dominate even more. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:16:57.000000', '2006-10-08 17:32:51.000000', 1),
(2906856, 397791, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Liked the simplicity of this and the tones used.  Like that there is a name on the boat yet (at this size) cannot be read. Like the ''lost'' horizon, etc.  Perhaps just a <i>fraction</i> more contrast/something might have given this just a little more drama - but you may well have intended for this ''haze'', which works well anyway in my opinion. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:32:54.</i></td>', '8 - Liked the simplicity of this and the tones used.  Like that there is a name on the boat yet (at this size) cannot be read. Like the ''lost'' horizon, etc.  Perhaps just a fraction more contrast/something might have given this just a little more drama - but you may well have intended for this ''haze'', which works well anyway in my opinion. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:17:02.000000', '2006-10-08 17:32:54.000000', 1),
(2906857, 396674, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is a slightly ''contradictory'' type image, in my opinion and took me a while to form an opinion on it.  The lighting is very nice and the moment capture very good.  The unusual combination of elements (bubbles, young male, little ''beard/goatee'', etc) make this original.  The main things that detracted (but very minor) were the barely discernible ''dirt under fingernails'' (but again, the contradiction) and the slight grain/something, especially at the bottom middle to right, in the darker areas. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:32:58.</i></td>', '8 - This is a slightly ''contradictory'' type image, in my opinion and took me a while to form an opinion on it.  The lighting is very nice and the moment capture very good.  The unusual combination of elements (bubbles, young male, little ''beard/goatee'', etc) make this original.  The main things that detracted (but very minor) were the barely discernible ''dirt under fingernails'' (but again, the contradiction) and the slight grain/something, especially at the bottom middle to right, in the darker areas. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:17:08.000000', '2006-10-08 17:32:58.000000', 1),
(2906858, 401844, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This didn''t look like ''prompted acting'' to me.  Tones work very well.  Only thing that detracted in this for me was the upper left darker area (the thicker steel or such, the thinner angled ''whatever'' adds, in my opinion).  Maybe a slightly tighter crop, especially with those nice eyes, who knows. ''Once bitten twice shy''. <i>edit:to add comments - edit2:typo &amp; to say thank you, glad you liked my ''comments''</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-09 15:24:39.</i></td>', '8 - This didn''t look like ''prompted acting'' to me.  Tones work very well.  Only thing that detracted in this for me was the upper left darker area (the thicker steel or such, the thinner angled ''whatever'' adds, in my opinion).  Maybe a slightly tighter crop, especially with those nice eyes, who knows. ''Once bitten twice shy''. edit:to add comments - edit2:typo & to say thank you, glad you liked my ''comments''', '2006-10-08 00:17:13.000000', '2006-10-09 16:24:39.000000', 1),
(2906859, 395763, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent colors, textures and patterns. At first look I thought this needed a slight nudge rotate up on the right, but on looking again it seems fine.  The only few (and minor) things were what appears to be feint footprints in the sand and the very bottom left corner ''triangle'', but again - minor.  Good color/contrast control, also like the darker shaded cloud in the distance, which likely cannot be appreciated at this size. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:33:08.</i></td>', '8 - Excellent colors, textures and patterns. At first look I thought this needed a slight nudge rotate up on the right, but on looking again it seems fine.  The only few (and minor) things were what appears to be feint footprints in the sand and the very bottom left corner ''triangle'', but again - minor.  Good color/contrast control, also like the darker shaded cloud in the distance, which likely cannot be appreciated at this size. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:17:18.000000', '2006-10-08 17:33:08.000000', 1),
(2906860, 403785, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this, especially the gunfire - wish you had been able to capture ''more'' within frame, but obviously difficult, especially with this ''zoom''.  Good capture of the ''re-enactment''.  Liked the colors.  Just seemed to be a little processing visible here and there - but apologies in advance if wrong. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:33:11.</i></td>', '8 - Like this, especially the gunfire - wish you had been able to capture ''more'' within frame, but obviously difficult, especially with this ''zoom''.  Good capture of the ''re-enactment''.  Liked the colors.  Just seemed to be a little processing visible here and there - but apologies in advance if wrong. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:17:24.000000', '2006-10-08 17:33:11.000000', 1),
