(2906863, 402744, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Toning/b&amp;w works very well.  Really liked the braids, but especially the expression captured, which seems purely candid.  Lovely face.  Composition very good.  Only few things were the nose ''hot spot'' and the minor grain/''gamma''/contrast/something issues in the darker areas.  Also in the upper right, but I think the shading/gradient there does add to the depth of this. <i>edit:to add comments</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 16:37:12.</i></td>', '8 - Very nice.  Toning/b&w works very well.  Really liked the braids, but especially the expression captured, which seems purely candid.  Lovely face.  Composition very good.  Only few things were the nose ''hot spot'' and the minor grain/''gamma''/contrast/something issues in the darker areas.  Also in the upper right, but I think the shading/gradient there does add to the depth of this. edit:to add comments', '2006-10-08 00:17:50.000000', '2006-10-08 17:37:12.000000', 1),
