(2906865, 403995, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern here - well done.</td>', 'I like the pattern here - well done.', '2006-10-08 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906869, 396806, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice Portrait!</td>', 'Nice Portrait!', '2006-10-08 00:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906874, 396446, 38032, '<td valign="top">hmmm ... he''s using psychology there.  That''s agreat shot - the perspective is excellent.</td>', 'hmmm ... he''s using psychology there.  That''s agreat shot - the perspective is excellent.', '2006-10-08 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906875, 402564, 50641, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2006-10-08 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906879, 403725, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice perspective/angle.  Like the detail in the ''oral arms''.  Perhaps a variation in the colors/tones/curves to give this a boost color-wise may have given this a little extra, although very difficult to adjust due to resulting contrast issues.  Also, depending what you had to work with, a variation in composition, or else getting the whole jellyfish in focus, with this centered composition, may have also made this even better in my opinion.  There are a few minor ''specks'' here and there that, with advanced editing, perhaps could have been cloned out, but fairly minor.  Up to 6 from 5.</td>', '6 - Nice perspective/angle.  Like the detail in the ''oral arms''.  Perhaps a variation in the colors/tones/curves to give this a boost color-wise may have given this a little extra, although very difficult to adjust due to resulting contrast issues.  Also, depending what you had to work with, a variation in composition, or else getting the whole jellyfish in focus, with this centered composition, may have also made this even better in my opinion.  There are a few minor ''specks'' here and there that, with advanced editing, perhaps could have been cloned out, but fairly minor.  Up to 6 from 5.', '2006-10-08 00:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906880, 404001, 48546, '<td valign="top">Gotta be a Lensbaby shot. If it is, then GREAT capture. If it''s not, well.....<br/> <br/>GREAT capture. - 9</td>', 'Gotta be a Lensbaby shot. If it is, then GREAT capture. If it''s not, well..... GREAT capture. - 9', '2006-10-08 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906881, 390831, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this - just the reflections/''something'' in the eyes, detracts too much in my opinion.  Colors are very nice.  Like the composition.  Detail on the fur in focus is very good.  Also good to see is that the eyes seem nice and clean.  Up to 6 from 5.</td>', '6 - Like this - just the reflections/''something'' in the eyes, detracts too much in my opinion.  Colors are very nice.  Like the composition.  Detail on the fur in focus is very good.  Also good to see is that the eyes seem nice and clean.  Up to 6 from 5.', '2006-10-08 00:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906882, 403909, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Just can''t see how such a large expanse could have been this ''sloped''/tilted.  Apologies if wrong, but this really looks like it needs straightening (in post processing at least).  A tweaking of what looks like a nice range of colors, to bring them out more, may also have lifted this.  A more refined crop, especially bottom right (else included more as an element if it was good (and you had it, obviously)), also make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Just can''t see how such a large expanse could have been this ''sloped''/tilted.  Apologies if wrong, but this really looks like it needs straightening (in post processing at least).  A tweaking of what looks like a nice range of colors, to bring them out more, may also have lifted this.  A more refined crop, especially bottom right (else included more as an element if it was good (and you had it, obviously)), also make this better in my opinion.', '2006-10-08 00:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906894, 403880, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great location.. nicely done.  Love the duotone. 7</td>', 'Great location.. nicely done.  Love the duotone. 7', '2006-10-08 00:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906900, 402798, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Gorgeous composition, utterly perfect.</td>', 'Wow!  Gorgeous composition, utterly perfect.', '2006-10-08 00:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906905, 400910, 52336, '<td valign="top">I know it well.  Lovely sky, nicely seen.</td>', 'I know it well.  Lovely sky, nicely seen.', '2006-10-08 00:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906910, 403552, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid.. her hair couldn''t have been more perfect.</td>', 'Lovely candid.. her hair couldn''t have been more perfect.', '2006-10-08 00:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906915, 403755, 52336, '<td valign="top">Personally would have liked a tighter crop that eliminated some of the area at bottom, but the composition is very nice here... the three heads in the window are very well placed for this shot.</td>', 'Personally would have liked a tighter crop that eliminated some of the area at bottom, but the composition is very nice here... the three heads in the window are very well placed for this shot.', '2006-10-08 00:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906927, 390831, 52336, '<td valign="top">Whoa... best cat portrait ever!</td>', 'Whoa... best cat portrait ever!', '2006-10-08 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906941, 399708, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but for the imperfect angle.  I''m sure others have said this, and you may actually like it as is, but it seems to me that such formal leading lines really cry out for perfect symmetry.  For me, it would have made this great.  As it is, I very much enjoy the scene and the lines, and the b/w.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but for the imperfect angle.  I''m sure others have said this, and you may actually like it as is, but it seems to me that such formal leading lines really cry out for perfect symmetry.  For me, it would have made this great.  As it is, I very much enjoy the scene and the lines, and the b/w.', '2006-10-08 00:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906946, 401761, 12253, '<td valign="top">I recognize that place!  Nicely done!</td>', 'I recognize that place!  Nicely done!', '2006-10-08 00:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906949, 403810, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice youthful portrait.  The frame/crop is very interesting, and the lighting is great.</td>', 'Nice youthful portrait.  The frame/crop is very interesting, and the lighting is great.', '2006-10-08 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
