(2907023, 403785, 61012, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your finish. I personally would have placed you higher. I disagree with many of the comments regarding the cutting off of the barrels and I think many people didn''t appreciate the capture of the flint on one gun and the blast from the one above it being caught simultaneously. I wouldn''t change a thing!</td>', 'Congrats on your finish. I personally would have placed you higher. I disagree with many of the comments regarding the cutting off of the barrels and I think many people didn''t appreciate the capture of the flint on one gun and the blast from the one above it being caught simultaneously. I wouldn''t change a thing!', '2006-10-08 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2907026, 401844, 50695, '<td valign="top">congrats on the 6+. I came so close to commenting on this, but ultimately forgot. I gave it a 7. I love how it is ultimately not a portrait, but a picture of a bruise. ok, I''m exaggerating. But the bruise is so important to the shot. Very interesting.</td>', 'congrats on the 6+. I came so close to commenting on this, but ultimately forgot. I gave it a 7. I love how it is ultimately not a portrait, but a picture of a bruise. ok, I''m exaggerating. But the bruise is so important to the shot. Very interesting.', '2006-10-08 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2907028, 404072, 50231, '<td valign="top">WOW I had this doing better. I think underrated ... great image and very well done!</td>', 'WOW I had this doing better. I think underrated ... great image and very well done!', '2006-10-08 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
