(2907030, 403374, 60862, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the show, but oooohhhh ... she looks like she''s up to something! :)  Nice shot!  The sepia tones give it an old-timey feel.</td>', 'I don''t know the show, but oooohhhh ... she looks like she''s up to something! :)  Nice shot!  The sepia tones give it an old-timey feel.', '2006-10-08 01:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
