(2907556, 392623, 30896, '<td valign="top">the white is a bit distracting, but just a bit, and it makes the photo look natural, unstaged, so I didn''t take it as a minus - in fact i gave it ten and I hope that i) you will upload more pictures in future and ii) they will score as they deserve, I mean much higher</td>', 'the white is a bit distracting, but just a bit, and it makes the photo look natural, unstaged, so I didn''t take it as a minus - in fact i gave it ten and I hope that i) you will upload more pictures in future and ii) they will score as they deserve, I mean much higher', '2006-10-08 07:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
