(2907665, 403732, 8891, '<td valign="top">Thanks Jen and Becky! And thank you for all the great comments during the challenge. This was my best free study showing yet. Becky, per your request, here is the color version:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=407862" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/407862.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/407862.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/407862.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks Jen and Becky! And thank you for all the great comments during the challenge. This was my best free study showing yet. Becky, per your request, here is the color version: ', '2006-10-08 09:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2907666, 400847, 55838, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this shot boring at all.  In fact, I was one of your seventeen 7''s.  The colors are marvelous and the steam is so cool.  Nice choice on the crop &amp; composition accenting the golden tones in the foreground yet pulling the eye deeper into the picture with the interesting smoke and vibrant sky.  Nicely done.  Just a challenge full of very good competition.</td>', 'I don''t find this shot boring at all.  In fact, I was one of your seventeen 7''s.  The colors are marvelous and the steam is so cool.  Nice choice on the crop & composition accenting the golden tones in the foreground yet pulling the eye deeper into the picture with the interesting smoke and vibrant sky.  Nicely done.  Just a challenge full of very good competition.', '2006-10-08 09:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
