(2907681, 403713, 53572, '<td valign="top">a lovely portrait.  super composition and exposure.  my one quibble is the eyes.  the USM has made strange little sparkly things in the eyes, like they''re filled with shiny dust.<br/> <br/>i was getting tired of usm doing that to me, so i took what i''d read somewhere inthe forums and applied it to my work:<br/> <br/>duplicate your background layer<br/>do a high pass filter at around 10 pixels (or more, it''s up to you)<br/>blend option that layer to soft light<br/>alt+click on the mask icon to create a complete mask of the layer<br/>paint in just the eyes.  <br/> <br/>this will sharpen them nicely<br/> <br/>duplicate background layer again<br/>blend option screen<br/>alt+click layer mask<br/>paint in eyes<br/>adjust opacity until don''t look freaky.<br/> <br/>this gives the eyes a little more light and oomph.<br/> <br/>This way keeps the appearance of the real texture of the eyes.<br/> <br/>this is only legal in advanced<br/> <br/>an example: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=401844" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/401844.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/401844.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/401844.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-08 08:30:33.</i></td>', 'a lovely portrait.  super composition and exposure.  my one quibble is the eyes.  the USM has made strange little sparkly things in the eyes, like they''re filled with shiny dust. i was getting tired of usm doing that to me, so i took what i''d read somewhere inthe forums and applied it to my work: duplicate your background layerdo a high pass filter at around 10 pixels (or more, it''s up to you)blend option that layer to soft lightalt+click on the mask icon to create a complete mask of the layerpaint in just the eyes.   this will sharpen them nicely duplicate background layer againblend option screenalt+click layer maskpaint in eyesadjust opacity until don''t look freaky. this gives the eyes a little more light and oomph. This way keeps the appearance of the real texture of the eyes. this is only legal in advanced an example: ', '2006-10-08 09:29:22.000000', '2006-10-08 09:30:33.000000', 0),
