(2907813, 404088, 55838, '<td valign="top">A fine emotive shot (emotive are my favorites).  Nice crop and very attractive color tones.  I even think the plain off-white looking sky provides contrast and adds to the mood of this picture.  Looks like you might have added a slight grain here (or maybe it is a result of the point and shoot) - either way it''s a nice effect and might have been cool even grainier.  One very small nit - a tiny piece of crud in the sky just over his forehead could use cloning out IMO.  Well done.</td>', 'A fine emotive shot (emotive are my favorites).  Nice crop and very attractive color tones.  I even think the plain off-white looking sky provides contrast and adds to the mood of this picture.  Looks like you might have added a slight grain here (or maybe it is a result of the point and shoot) - either way it''s a nice effect and might have been cool even grainier.  One very small nit - a tiny piece of crud in the sky just over his forehead could use cloning out IMO.  Well done.', '2006-10-08 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
