(2907914, 394022, 31399, '<td valign="top">wooooooooohooooooooooo we gotta ''femme fetale'' in the top 40!!!! woman you rock!!!  your guy know your out chatting with men in waders at sunset?j/k  <br/> <br/>I never saw this picture when I voted challenge, either.  I love the choice of sky tones as opposed to the dark lower tones.  I look at this picture and it feels like I can hear the sound of the fishing line as it crosses the water.  Very emotive and peaceful.  NICE NICE job here!</td>', 'wooooooooohooooooooooo we gotta ''femme fetale'' in the top 40!!!! woman you rock!!!  your guy know your out chatting with men in waders at sunset?j/k   I never saw this picture when I voted challenge, either.  I love the choice of sky tones as opposed to the dark lower tones.  I look at this picture and it feels like I can hear the sound of the fishing line as it crosses the water.  Very emotive and peaceful.  NICE NICE job here!', '2006-10-08 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
