(2908369, 399080, 11897, '<td valign="top">A stunning vista, congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'A stunning vista, congratulations on the ribbon.', '2006-10-08 15:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908375, 396120, 11897, '<td valign="top">A great result for a great picture Robert, HDR is certainly the future for landscapes like this, congrats again and hard luck not to ribbon.</td>', 'A great result for a great picture Robert, HDR is certainly the future for landscapes like this, congrats again and hard luck not to ribbon.', '2006-10-08 15:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908381, 402561, 11897, '<td valign="top">An excellent addition to your portfolio Justin,love the skin tones, highly placed and deservedly so.</td>', 'An excellent addition to your portfolio Justin,love the skin tones, highly placed and deservedly so.', '2006-10-08 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908394, 403110, 25754, '<td valign="top">This really stood out during voting. Excellent work!</td>', 'This really stood out during voting. Excellent work!', '2006-10-08 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908397, 396120, 30982, '<td valign="top">Eh, it doesn''t suck.  I still want my print that isn''t all green and icky.  :-)</td>', 'Eh, it doesn''t suck.  I still want my print that isn''t all green and icky.  :-)', '2006-10-08 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908403, 403349, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by traquino98:</b></div><hr/><i> What a great idea. I bet something like this would do good in a stock site. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wish I could use it as a stock photo.  Unfortunately the Pentax W10 has so much noise, even at ISO 64, that I can''t see much chance of getting it accepted.</td>', 'Originally posted by traquino98: What a great idea. I bet something like this would do good in a stock site.   I wish I could use it as a stock photo.  Unfortunately the Pentax W10 has so much noise, even at ISO 64, that I can''t see much chance of getting it accepted.', '2006-10-08 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908405, 404045, 52549, '<td valign="top">Agree with Brian, this deserved higher.</td>', 'Agree with Brian, this deserved higher.', '2006-10-08 16:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908414, 395499, 42125, '<td valign="top">This is great stuff!<br/>The only thing though is, the lack of details on her (a bit out of focus)!<br/>Maybe it would be better to sharpen a bit!</td>', 'This is great stuff!The only thing though is, the lack of details on her (a bit out of focus)!Maybe it would be better to sharpen a bit!', '2006-10-08 16:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908415, 396674, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot Ursula, it should have finished higher (IMO).</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot Ursula, it should have finished higher (IMO).', '2006-10-08 16:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908431, 402564, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pedro:</b></div><hr/><i> the best of the series so far.  Spring is going to have a tough time beating fall, I''m afraid :)<br/> <br/>Very well done, Larus<br/> <br/>P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m surprised you said that. I think the other two are better. The road on the right there detracts a bit where as the other two were in "perfect" locales, IMO. However that said, I''m surprised this didn''t make Larus'' front page.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pedro: the best of the series so far.  Spring is going to have a tough time beating fall, I''m afraid :) Very well done, Larus P   I''m surprised you said that. I think the other two are better. The road on the right there detracts a bit where as the other two were in "perfect" locales, IMO. However that said, I''m surprised this didn''t make Larus'' front page.', '2006-10-08 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908438, 390473, 49326, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot. I gave it a nine and it was one of my highest rated shots. I love the post processing and the composition.</td>', 'I loved this shot. I gave it a nine and it was one of my highest rated shots. I love the post processing and the composition.', '2006-10-08 16:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908443, 398283, 49326, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 3rd blue in a row. That''s amazing! I really like this shot.</td>', 'Congrats on your 3rd blue in a row. That''s amazing! I really like this shot.', '2006-10-08 16:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908508, 402286, 41337, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is better than your other version, IMO. Congrats on a top 10.</td>', 'The composition of this is better than your other version, IMO. Congrats on a top 10.', '2006-10-08 17:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908513, 404088, 45475, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get around to voting on this one, unfortunately. Whether or not I realised this wasn''t from an actual war zone, wouldn''t have swayed my feelings in any way. It still has excellent photojournalistic qualities. Really, he could be anywhere. Your decision to convert to sepia, along with the great title, adds much to the overall atmosphere and aids the viewer in feeling a wide range of emotions - nostalgia, pity, heartbreak, pride etc... I suspect your intention here was to evoke those feelings, and if so, it worked for me.</td>', 'I didn''t get around to voting on this one, unfortunately. Whether or not I realised this wasn''t from an actual war zone, wouldn''t have swayed my feelings in any way. It still has excellent photojournalistic qualities. Really, he could be anywhere. Your decision to convert to sepia, along with the great title, adds much to the overall atmosphere and aids the viewer in feeling a wide range of emotions - nostalgia, pity, heartbreak, pride etc... I suspect your intention here was to evoke those feelings, and if so, it worked for me.', '2006-10-08 17:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908539, 396521, 44878, '<td valign="top">I really think this is an outstanding photograph<br/>It makes you want to look at it.<br/>I would have been proud of that one !</td>', 'I really think this is an outstanding photographIt makes you want to look at it.I would have been proud of that one !', '2006-10-08 17:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908558, 397682, 7786, '<td valign="top">I agree with the other post-vote commentators: its underrated. I would have asumed it was a top 10.</td>', 'I agree with the other post-vote commentators: its underrated. I would have asumed it was a top 10.', '2006-10-08 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908571, 402436, 60224, '<td valign="top">This is very impressive. You took a pretty normal, boring photo of a pretty boring normal subject and made it very interesting. I love the textures you''ve created with some very clever editing. Great colors too. This could be a tutorial to those with limited or no editing skills. I was amazed at the stark difference between the original and this edit!! When I first looked at the two, I had to really study them before I could believe they were pics of the same engine!</td>', 'This is very impressive. You took a pretty normal, boring photo of a pretty boring normal subject and made it very interesting. I love the textures you''ve created with some very clever editing. Great colors too. This could be a tutorial to those with limited or no editing skills. I was amazed at the stark difference between the original and this edit!! When I first looked at the two, I had to really study them before I could believe they were pics of the same engine!', '2006-10-08 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908590, 403815, 25754, '<td valign="top">Revisiting the images I left comments on - sorry to hear you inadvertantly entered this one. I''ve made the same mistake :)</td>', 'Revisiting the images I left comments on - sorry to hear you inadvertantly entered this one. I''ve made the same mistake :)', '2006-10-08 17:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908615, 398283, 22734, '<td valign="top">I am addressing this free study Blue Ribbon image with the also Blue Ribbon image in purple two. What a monumental achievement to score the coveted prizes with such flair. My deepest felt congratulations on the expertise you are displaying. It is nothing short of stunning. Added to this is the sheer beauty of your captures. You are raising the bar higher and higher.<br/> <br/>Yes, Jason, you are a rising star gushing upwards like hot larva to find your rightful place amongst the top photographers at DPC. Talent like yours is always admired.<br/> <br/>In the purple challenge you bring us your magic of outstanding tonal and color beauty and in the free study you outdo yourself with a most interesting and captivating image with campers being showered by scintillating stars. Again: a monumental achievement.</td>', 'I am addressing this free study Blue Ribbon image with the also Blue Ribbon image in purple two. What a monumental achievement to score the coveted prizes with such flair. My deepest felt congratulations on the expertise you are displaying. It is nothing short of stunning. Added to this is the sheer beauty of your captures. You are raising the bar higher and higher. Yes, Jason, you are a rising star gushing upwards like hot larva to find your rightful place amongst the top photographers at DPC. Talent like yours is always admired. In the purple challenge you bring us your magic of outstanding tonal and color beauty and in the free study you outdo yourself with a most interesting and captivating image with campers being showered by scintillating stars. Again: a monumental achievement.', '2006-10-08 18:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908618, 403792, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most arresting macro capture and great composition. Congratulations on your RED.</td>', 'A most arresting macro capture and great composition. Congratulations on your RED.', '2006-10-08 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908620, 395499, 45475, '<td valign="top">I don''t get those low votes. I had this so pegged for a ribbon. As soon as I saw it, I thought, "thank god, something completely different". Composition, minor technical nitpicks... matter not. Your vision excites me here. What a bizarre and wonderful set up.</td>', 'I don''t get those low votes. I had this so pegged for a ribbon. As soon as I saw it, I thought, "thank god, something completely different". Composition, minor technical nitpicks... matter not. Your vision excites me here. What a bizarre and wonderful set up.', '2006-10-08 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908622, 399080, 22734, '<td valign="top">The beauty exceeds the imagination. The eye finds good visual food here without sudden satiation. Very well done! Congratulations on your yellow.</td>', 'The beauty exceeds the imagination. The eye finds good visual food here without sudden satiation. Very well done! Congratulations on your yellow.', '2006-10-08 18:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908624, 396120, 22734, '<td valign="top">Robert: your images are always so compelling with a beauty that only you can find. Congratulations on your 4th placing, worthy of a ribbon.</td>', 'Robert: your images are always so compelling with a beauty that only you can find. Congratulations on your 4th placing, worthy of a ribbon.', '2006-10-08 18:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908627, 402561, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 5th placing with this refreshing portrait.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 5th placing with this refreshing portrait.', '2006-10-08 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908629, 395763, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image that charms the senses. Clean and crisp and then telling a long visual tale. Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'An image that charms the senses. Clean and crisp and then telling a long visual tale. Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2006-10-08 18:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908631, 403844, 22734, '<td valign="top">This lovely image imparts a sense of serenety and what a visual treat! Congratulations on your top ten finish.</td>', 'This lovely image imparts a sense of serenety and what a visual treat! Congratulations on your top ten finish.', '2006-10-08 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908633, 395788, 22734, '<td valign="top">A masterful capture wherein the viewer almost hears the buzz. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'A masterful capture wherein the viewer almost hears the buzz. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2006-10-08 18:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908635, 404043, 36382, '<td valign="top">Don''t be disheartened.  It is a great shot.  I think Jutilda''s idea is a great one.  If not completely black and white maybe semi-desaturate.  I love that semi-desaturated look.</td>', 'Don''t be disheartened.  It is a great shot.  I think Jutilda''s idea is a great one.  If not completely black and white maybe semi-desaturate.  I love that semi-desaturated look.', '2006-10-08 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908638, 403109, 22734, '<td valign="top">An intriguing interplay of yellows, oranges and red to blow off the viewers socks off. Congratulations on your top ten.</td>', 'An intriguing interplay of yellows, oranges and red to blow off the viewers socks off. Congratulations on your top ten.', '2006-10-08 18:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2908640, 402286, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top ten finish with this lovely silver and orange study. The reflections are outstanding.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top ten finish with this lovely silver and orange study. The reflections are outstanding.', '2006-10-08 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
