(2908932, 403391, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this and the title is most appropriate.  I think Ed''s given you some excellent suggestions/tips.  And by the way, in my most humble opinion, the holy grail of DPC is not the coveted Blue Ribbon, it''s a meaningful and detailed comment from e301.  Dude, you rock!  Now did you shoot this in RAW??</td>', 'I love the idea of this and the title is most appropriate.  I think Ed''s given you some excellent suggestions/tips.  And by the way, in my most humble opinion, the holy grail of DPC is not the coveted Blue Ribbon, it''s a meaningful and detailed comment from e301.  Dude, you rock!  Now did you shoot this in RAW??', '2006-10-08 20:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
