(2911414, 400629, 30861, '<td valign="top">I found this image to be absolutely haunting, eerie and surreal. It was one of my 9''s, and I can''t believe it finished as low as it did. Except of course I can believe it, because weird, off-the-wall shots like this rarely do well at DPC... Regardless, congrats on a fine piece of work!</td>', 'I found this image to be absolutely haunting, eerie and surreal. It was one of my 9''s, and I can''t believe it finished as low as it did. Except of course I can believe it, because weird, off-the-wall shots like this rarely do well at DPC... Regardless, congrats on a fine piece of work!', '2006-10-09 13:14:27.000000', NULL, 0),
