(2911736, 391801, 59215, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RulerZigzag:</b></div><hr/><i> is this a night shot? nice clarity and lighting here.I like your shallow DOF with the nice and full background...looks like a long exposure..I do not believe you used a flash here or did you? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not a night shot, also no flash, and not a long exposure. Taken late afternoon (~4 PM ish). I was under the tree in the shade and focused on a branch in the sun. I liked the repetition of the other branches/berries in the background.</td>', 'Originally posted by RulerZigzag: is this a night shot? nice clarity and lighting here.I like your shallow DOF with the nice and full background...looks like a long exposure..I do not believe you used a flash here or did you?   Not a night shot, also no flash, and not a long exposure. Taken late afternoon (~4 PM ish). I was under the tree in the shade and focused on a branch in the sun. I liked the repetition of the other branches/berries in the background.', '2006-10-09 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
