(2912290, 398187, 60698, '<td valign="top">Ha! I guess I was the only one that saw this as a 10. I love everything about it including the bright white hair and the King Charles Spaniel. The man looks wise and gentle and he is a perfect selection for this image. It''s peaceful and serene.<br/> <br/>Don''t understand why this wasn''t higher up in the voting, but what do I know. I am a n00b! :)<br/> <br/>Great photo!<br/></td>', 'Ha! I guess I was the only one that saw this as a 10. I love everything about it including the bright white hair and the King Charles Spaniel. The man looks wise and gentle and he is a perfect selection for this image. It''s peaceful and serene. Don''t understand why this wasn''t higher up in the voting, but what do I know. I am a n00b! :) Great photo!', '2006-10-09 18:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
