(2912325, 401012, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ha, you only get a brief critique.  6.82...fuggedaboutit.<br/> <br/>I gave the shot a 7 which is beyond a solid shot and into the excellent category.  Square crop was a great choice due to the symmetry.  The nearly B&amp;W is a good touch with the high contrast.  I wouldn''t change the shot much at all...</td>', 'Ha, you only get a brief critique.  6.82...fuggedaboutit. I gave the shot a 7 which is beyond a solid shot and into the excellent category.  Square crop was a great choice due to the symmetry.  The nearly B&W is a good touch with the high contrast.  I wouldn''t change the shot much at all...', '2006-10-09 18:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
