(2912343, 396673, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not a fan of selective desat because it looks so unreal... but in this case I didn''t even realize you''d done it until I read your comments.  I was completely focused on the little girl and police officer.  The other thing I like about this photo is the little girl in the background who seems to be watching what is going on.  Overall, this is a fantastic shot that has captured the moment well.  And as for sending the offer a print of the picture, go for it!  I''m sure he would apprecaite it! :)</td>', 'I''m usually not a fan of selective desat because it looks so unreal... but in this case I didn''t even realize you''d done it until I read your comments.  I was completely focused on the little girl and police officer.  The other thing I like about this photo is the little girl in the background who seems to be watching what is going on.  Overall, this is a fantastic shot that has captured the moment well.  And as for sending the offer a print of the picture, go for it!  I''m sure he would apprecaite it! :)', '2006-10-09 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2912354, 403844, 24681, '<td valign="top">Great picture -- there''s something about the way you''ve captured the scene that draws one in. Hard to look away :-) Congrats!</td>', 'Great picture -- there''s something about the way you''ve captured the scene that draws one in. Hard to look away :-) Congrats!', '2006-10-09 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2912419, 400629, 5728, '<td valign="top">Your creativity dazzles me! Your imagination and photography is beyond DPC challenges, take it further girl, you have such a wonderful talent that you should take elsewhere, you are wasting your time here. When I see a masterpiece like this and see a placing of 194th I can only shake my head in disappointment. No offence to the top 3 placegetters in this challenge but this is by far the BEST photo of the lot! You are an inspiration for me Rengim!</td>', 'Your creativity dazzles me! Your imagination and photography is beyond DPC challenges, take it further girl, you have such a wonderful talent that you should take elsewhere, you are wasting your time here. When I see a masterpiece like this and see a placing of 194th I can only shake my head in disappointment. No offence to the top 3 placegetters in this challenge but this is by far the BEST photo of the lot! You are an inspiration for me Rengim!', '2006-10-09 19:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2912447, 404043, 63868, '<td valign="top">Hi Shez -<br/> <br/>The sepia is good, although I prefer the original version because the colors on your husband''s face add to the warmth of the photo.<br/> <br/>Don''t let the low rating get you down because you can''t please everyone. It would be nice if some background information was included with each photo for the challenges, as evidenced by the fact that You ycertainly scored big with those who recognized your husband. And others who commented on this shot rated this pretty high!</td>', 'Hi Shez - The sepia is good, although I prefer the original version because the colors on your husband''s face add to the warmth of the photo. Don''t let the low rating get you down because you can''t please everyone. It would be nice if some background information was included with each photo for the challenges, as evidenced by the fact that You ycertainly scored big with those who recognized your husband. And others who commented on this shot rated this pretty high!', '2006-10-09 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2912494, 404013, 38648, '<td valign="top">My kinda photo.  Very nice.</td>', 'My kinda photo.  Very nice.', '2006-10-09 20:12:17.000000', NULL, 0),
