(2931436, 390473, 31403, '<td valign="top">this photo rocks - ranking this 321 is just stupid if you don''t mind me being completely honest.  The voters have one style and different viewpoints and originality just aren''t what they look for here.  But I love both, particularly in your case<br/>I just looked through your web site gallery and I love the way you see the world!  Seriously pursue a gallery showing of your work - it is amazing and so consistent in your "style" that it could easily translate to a show.<br/> <br/>I''m very glad to have found your work - and look forward to what you have for us in the future!</td>', 'this photo rocks - ranking this 321 is just stupid if you don''t mind me being completely honest.  The voters have one style and different viewpoints and originality just aren''t what they look for here.  But I love both, particularly in your caseI just looked through your web site gallery and I love the way you see the world!  Seriously pursue a gallery showing of your work - it is amazing and so consistent in your "style" that it could easily translate to a show. I''m very glad to have found your work - and look forward to what you have for us in the future!', '2006-10-16 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
