(2960268, 403101, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BradP:</b></div><hr/><i> The smile.<br/>There''s always something about a smile that just light up a shot like this.<br/>With some more post-processing to bring details out of the shadows, this would be awesome.<br/>Let me know if you want me to help out on a slightly different edit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi Rick,<br/>As I mentioned during the challenge, <i>(and nearly forgot)</i>,<br/>I went ahead and did an edit of your daughter''s pic:<br/>From this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=403101" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/403101.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/403101.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/551/thumb/403101.jpg"/></a> --to this--&gt; <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=417075" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/417075.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/417075.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/417075.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Obviously having a full-sized original would be better, but for web viewing, this size is ok.</td>', 'Originally posted by BradP: The smile.There''s always something about a smile that just light up a shot like this.With some more post-processing to bring details out of the shadows, this would be awesome.Let me know if you want me to help out on a slightly different edit.  Hi Rick,As I mentioned during the challenge, (and nearly forgot),I went ahead and did an edit of your daughter''s pic:From this  --to this-->   Obviously having a full-sized original would be better, but for web viewing, this size is ok.', '2006-10-25 07:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
