(2978968, 403451, 6349, '<td valign="top">This rocks.  Sorry I missed voting this challenge.  Absurd what goes on with the scores on this site.  This is a great example of why I don''t submit that much anymore.<br/> <br/>PS, I actually like this version better than the b+w in your portfolio.  In rare cases such as this a strong image with lots of lines worked in color because of the matching reds and subtle blues you have kept in.  Great post-processing decision in my opinion.</td>', 'This rocks.  Sorry I missed voting this challenge.  Absurd what goes on with the scores on this site.  This is a great example of why I don''t submit that much anymore. PS, I actually like this version better than the b+w in your portfolio.  In rare cases such as this a strong image with lots of lines worked in color because of the matching reds and subtle blues you have kept in.  Great post-processing decision in my opinion.', '2006-10-31 14:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
