(3029333, 402564, 68458, '<td valign="top">I looked at most of your pictures and this series of 3 is my favorite, with this one being tops among them all.  My only criticism would be the model and her outfit.  To me she seems entirely prearranged like something out of a fashion catalog, rather than a unique human being.  But, I really like the concept, I just think there is so much more opportunity to explore how the person changes as opposed to the superficial coverings.</td>', 'I looked at most of your pictures and this series of 3 is my favorite, with this one being tops among them all.  My only criticism would be the model and her outfit.  To me she seems entirely prearranged like something out of a fashion catalog, rather than a unique human being.  But, I really like the concept, I just think there is so much more opportunity to explore how the person changes as opposed to the superficial coverings.', '2006-11-14 05:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3030298, 396120, 12611, '<td valign="top">So nice; so eye pleasing; beautiful pink and blues; what makes this is the fantastic is the mist and haze qualities contrasted with the fact that you can see so deeply into the picture with clarity and depth to the horizon. makes it surreal.</td>', 'So nice; so eye pleasing; beautiful pink and blues; what makes this is the fantastic is the mist and haze qualities contrasted with the fact that you can see so deeply into the picture with clarity and depth to the horizon. makes it surreal.', '2006-11-14 12:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
