(3039309, 399805, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really processed looking, but I do really like the overall mood - I think mostly from her expression.  It looks very relaxed and natural.  Maybe bringing out the eyes a bit more would help.  I think it was underrated in the challenge.</td>', 'This is really processed looking, but I do really like the overall mood - I think mostly from her expression.  It looks very relaxed and natural.  Maybe bringing out the eyes a bit more would help.  I think it was underrated in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 01:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
