(3091230, 404060, 6804, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this one, the more I like it.  It''s a shame soft focus and blur techniques are so taboo with the DPC voters.  I think so many of them miss out on some great work by zipping past to the next shot and not taking a moment to ponder the expression.</td>', 'The more I look at this one, the more I like it.  It''s a shame soft focus and blur techniques are so taboo with the DPC voters.  I think so many of them miss out on some great work by zipping past to the next shot and not taking a moment to ponder the expression.', '2006-12-06 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 0),
