(3313464, 403118, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and think it got a lower score than it deserved but still, I can understand it cause in free studies you need to make sure your shot stands out and has that wow factor.  I would have voted a 6 on this one as well.<br/> <br/>For starters, I like the lighting.  I think the framing could be better though, I would have liked it better if you had framed it closer to him cause that t-shirt is drawing too much of my attention, I would have lost the bottom and right part of the photo, cutting it off just under his jaw and hair on the right.  I also would have chosen a warmer white balance cause of your choice in WB the skin tones aren´t as pleasing as they could have been.  That or either just gone the total opposite direction, made it much cooler, drawn down the saturation and up with the contrast.</td>', 'I like this shot and think it got a lower score than it deserved but still, I can understand it cause in free studies you need to make sure your shot stands out and has that wow factor.  I would have voted a 6 on this one as well. For starters, I like the lighting.  I think the framing could be better though, I would have liked it better if you had framed it closer to him cause that t-shirt is drawing too much of my attention, I would have lost the bottom and right part of the photo, cutting it off just under his jaw and hair on the right.  I also would have chosen a warmer white balance cause of your choice in WB the skin tones aren´t as pleasing as they could have been.  That or either just gone the total opposite direction, made it much cooler, drawn down the saturation and up with the contrast.', '2007-02-01 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 0),
