(3359500, 392577, 48471, '<td valign="top">A very good photo. The half of the body included in the photo gives some dynamics to the shot and I get the impression that the guy just stopped for a shot and then he''ll run and get fully into the frame. He''s in charge, man! Also background lightning works well here. And the format, I love this movie like feel of the shot.</td>', 'A very good photo. The half of the body included in the photo gives some dynamics to the shot and I get the impression that the guy just stopped for a shot and then he''ll run and get fully into the frame. He''s in charge, man! Also background lightning works well here. And the format, I love this movie like feel of the shot.', '2007-02-12 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 0),
