(3371214, 402006, 70375, '<td valign="top">Do you know what kind of wasp this is? I am very interested to find out! I will go and look him up :) I''ll be back in a few...<br/> <br/>OKIE DOKIE!! It appears you have photographed a species of yellowjacket :) I have found the link for you <a href="//wasps.ucr.edu/waspid.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">YellowJackets</a> :)<br/> <br/>IMHO, you are lucky not to have been stung as those little boogers are quite agressive :)<br/> <br/>Perhaps you are a bee whisperer?  This is certainly a very interesting photograph in that the colours of his thorax and head match the yellow of the goldenrod :) The detail of the hairs is AWESOME!! I am drooling over this pic :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-15 22:32:31.</i></td>', 'Do you know what kind of wasp this is? I am very interested to find out! I will go and look him up :) I''ll be back in a few... OKIE DOKIE!! It appears you have photographed a species of yellowjacket :) I have found the link for you YellowJackets :) IMHO, you are lucky not to have been stung as those little boogers are quite agressive :) Perhaps you are a bee whisperer?  This is certainly a very interesting photograph in that the colours of his thorax and head match the yellow of the goldenrod :) The detail of the hairs is AWESOME!! I am drooling over this pic :)', '2007-02-15 22:17:22.000000', '2007-02-15 22:32:31.000000', 0),
