(4471674, 403719, 7473, '<td valign="top">I suppose to give this a good critique I would have to imagine someone not quite so beautiful as the model which is quite difficult i must say.<br/> <br/>Ok.  The backdrop comes across nice, not being too lighted being black.  The lighting is perfect on the model lighting up all of her to include the cloth she tossed in the air.  her skin tones come through nicely and nothing is blown out.  In all it is a very beautiful image that is deserving to be hung on the wall.<br/> <br/>Ben</td>', 'I suppose to give this a good critique I would have to imagine someone not quite so beautiful as the model which is quite difficult i must say. Ok.  The backdrop comes across nice, not being too lighted being black.  The lighting is perfect on the model lighting up all of her to include the cloth she tossed in the air.  her skin tones come through nicely and nothing is blown out.  In all it is a very beautiful image that is deserving to be hung on the wall. Ben', '2008-02-08 17:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
